<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Mbula</book>
  <para style="h">1 Samuyila</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Sam</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samu</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Samuyila</para>
  <para style="mt1">SAMUYILA MƏDƏMBE</para>
  <para style="imt">MƏNCAU</para>
  <para style="im">Malǝmce mǝnia a tunǝi ama <char style="k">Samuyila mǝdǝmbe</char> ka bangcau mala nggaɗi a Isǝrayila twal a bàkú mala akasǝla aban ká mala amurǝma. Nggaɗi mǝnia aɓa do-yilǝmu mala nzali Isǝrayila ka, kàrìkì-rǝì aban aburana tàrú: Samuyila, masǝlǝata ɓwa atà akaɓa kasǝla; Sawul, murǝm mǝdǝmbe mala Isǝrayila; andǝ Dauda, mǝnana agya male andǝ agir mǝnana kum ɓamurì aɓalǝia sǝ yi eauwe a buno-murǝm ngga, à taɓǝli aɓalǝarǝia andǝ acau mala adoyilǝmu mala Samuyila andǝ Sawul.</para>
  <para style="ip">Múrcau mala malǝmce mǝnia, kǝla mala acili acau-ɓaraɓara mǝnana à gilǝia aɓa Kùrcau Mǝ'e ka, nda mǝnana ama domǝsǝcau aban Ɓakuli ka kǝ yinǝ lidǝmba, sǝ mgbikiru ka kǝ yinǝ gir'murmwana. Mǝnia ka à bangŋi bwāng aɓa cau mala Yahweh aban Eli pǝris mǝnana ama: &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ gusǝlǝ aɓwana mǝnana à gusǝlǝam ngga, sǝ aɓwana mǝnana à ɓǝsǝkiam ngga, mǝ nǝ pàkcea-ɓa.&gt;&gt; (<char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:30">1Sam 2:30</ref>.)</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Aɓa mǝnia yì malǝmce ka, à lǝmdǝa sǝm anzongcau mala gingnǝ do ma'sǝm ani: (1) Ɓakuli ka pà nǝ̀ vwakibuì arǝ aɓwana male ɗàng; ko ɓǝ̀ agir swárkiô, kǝla mǝnana pǎ a nza mala Eli andǝ amuna-burana male ka, Ɓakuli kǝ yinǝ tsǝkɓalǝu, kǝla mǝnana pè nǝ ɓǝl Samuyila ka. (2) Ɓakuli ka à pà nǝ̀ gandǝ tsǝie púp, ko à nǝ̀ swárí aɓa kutan ɓǝ̀ kpata agir mǝnana sǝm earkiyice ka ɗàng, sǝama yì ka nǝ̀ bwali aɓwana mǝnana à gūlì arǝì sǝ à kǝ alta pàk nê male ka. (3) Nggearǝ peri ma'sǝm aban Ɓakuli ka pànǝ ɓoaro ɗàng ɓǝ̀ sǝm kpapì andǝ okiru raka. (4) Lǝmdǝa mala ɓwa a nza ka, kǝgìr na aban Ɓakuli ɗang; gìr mǝnana Ɓakuli earkiyice ka nda ɓabum mǝnana dàrrì arǝ túró male ka. (5) Aɓwana mǝnana à ɗeki mɓali ɓǝ̀ gingnǝ do malea ka, à nǝ̀ pakkî ɓamúrià mǝɓane mana kútì mǝɓane mǝnana à nǝ̀ pàkkî ɓià ɓwapǝndǝa ka.</para>
  <para style="iot">Agir mǝnana a ɓālǝi ka</para>
  <para style="io1">Lo mala Samuyila kǝla kasǝla mala Isǝrayila <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 1:1-3:1">1:1--3:1-21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Amǝ'Filisti bwal Akwati Kùrcau sǝ à nyesǝì <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 4:1-6:20">4:1--6:20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Samuyila yálmúr Isǝrayila sǝ à ɗice murǝm <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 7:1-8:22">7:1--8:22</ref></char> 3</para>
  <para style="io1">Sawul, murǝm mǝdǝmbe mala Isǝrayila <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 9:1-11:15">9:1--11:15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">A'lwa mala Sawul andǝ mgbikiru male <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 13:1-15:35">13:1--15:35</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lo mala Dauda kǝla murǝm Isǝrayila <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 16:1-17:58">16:1--17:58</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Sawul pàk mɓali sǝ alte nǝ̀ wal-lú Dauda <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 18:1-24:22">18:1--24:22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lú mala Sawul andǝ amuni <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">31:1-13</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Elkana andǝ amǝ'ɓala male a Shilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Ɓè ɓwabura nakam lullǝì ama Elkana. Tárrí nda Jeroham, kè-mǝɓwabure nda Elihu, sǝ tár-kè-mǝ-ɓwabure ka nda Tohu, a nggurkwar mala Zuf, ɓwa'Efǝrat. Yì ka do a Rama, ɓè nggea-là aɓa nzali múr ankono mala Ifǝrem. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Ndanǝ amamǝna ɓari, Hana andǝ Penina. Penina ka ndanǝ amuna, sǝ Hana ka pànǝ kǝ muna ɗang.<verse eid="1SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Ɓwabura mǝnia ka kǝ pur a nggea-là male koya pǝlǝa ace ká peri andǝ pà gir'nkila aban Yahweh, Mǝtala Abangŋo, a Shilo. Hofni andǝ Finehas, amuna-burana ɓari mala Eli ka, à nda ka apǝris mala Yahweh kano. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Koya pwari sǝ Elkana nǝ̀ pà gir'nkila ka, kǝ pê māmí Penina andǝ koyan atà amuni amuna-burana andǝ amuna-mamǝna kāmbe mala nyama. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Sǝ Hana ka kǝ pe wi akāmbe ɓari,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">akāmbe ɓari </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aɓea malǝmce gilǝ ama kāmbe mwashat, sǝ aɓea ka ama kāmbe mǝɓoarne mwashat.</char></note> acemǝnana kǝ earce Hana, kat andǝ amani ama Yahweh pè wi ɓǝlmuna raka. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Pàk ka ɓimama kǝ altacau arǝì, nǝ̀ lulbumi acemǝnana Yahweh pè wi ɓǝlmuna raka. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Anggo sǝ gìrnî lidǝmba pǝlǝa anzǝm pǝlǝa. Ɓǝ̀ kusǝ shen sǝ wari a ɓala mala Yahweh ka, anggo gbal sǝ ɓimama nǝ̀ nggǝ lulbumi. Acemani ka, Hana nǝ̀ nggǝ ɓua sǝ pà nǝ̀ li girlina ɗang. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Sǝ Elkana burí ka banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Hana, palang sǝ a kǝ ɓua? Sǝ palang sǝ a kǝ li girlina ɗang? Sǝ palang sǝ a pàk bumkiɗikea? Ən kútì amuna-burana lum a bano re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9-10" />A ɓè pwari anzǝm mana à malna li girlina sǝ à nuna gìr a Shilo ka, Hana lo. Nda aɓa bumpina mǝlime, sǝ pakhiwi aban Yahweh nǝ sukkimǝrǝm kǝ̀rkǝ́r. Aɓa mǝno anggo ka, Eli pǝris ka, nda aban do a buno male a nkanggari kpangbang-kunkurǝm mala ndà mala Yahweh. <verse eid="1SA 1:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Pǝlǝa Hana pàcau nǝ-shambum ama, &lt;&lt;We Yahweh mana a Karban Kat nǝ Gulo ka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yahweh mana a Karban Kat nǝ Gulo ka </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;Yahweh mǝ'sàrǝ̀ amǝ'lwa mala kuli&gt;&gt;</char></note> ɓǝ̀ aɓa mǝsǝcau awu nǝ sǝn tanni mem, mim guro mò, sǝ awu nǝ ɗenyinǝ mim, ɓalǝo pà nǝ̀ lorǝǎm, mim guro mò ɗàng, sǝ awu nǝ pàm, mim guro mò, muna-ɓwabura ka, mǝ nǝ nyesǝi mǝ nǝ po wi we Yahweh, aɓalǝ anonggio mala do-yilǝmu male kat, sǝ kǝ nkembu pa nǝ̀ je múrí ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Lang lidǝmba nǝ pakhiwi aɓadǝm Yahweh ka, Eli soa mǝsǝi kǝ sǝn kúni. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hana na aban nacau a ɓabumi; kǝ amburkuni na à kǝ dǝurǝ ka, sǝ gì ka à oè ɗàng. Acemani ka, Eli twali ama mba-walì nǝ walo. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Sǝ Eli banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Nǝ̀ sau lang sǝ awu nǝ ueo aɓa walo-mba? Nying nu mùr-anap mò.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Sǝ Hana ka eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Awo, ɓwamǝgule mem, Mǝ nda ɓwama mǝnana yilǝmem na aɓa zunggǝli ka. Ən nu kǝ mùr-anap ko mba ɗàng. Mǝ nda rǝ ú bumam a ɓadǝm Yahweh. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Kǝa twalam, mim guro mò kǝla ɓwama mǝɓane ɗàng; ǝn mal pwari yi pur ado mǝ ndaban lǝmdǝ ɓuanǝbum andǝ bumkiɗikea mǝgule mem aɓa hiwi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Pǝlǝa Eli pà eare ama, &lt;&lt;Kyane aɓa rǝpwala, sǝ ɓǝ̀ Ɓakuli mala Isǝrayila po zǝmba mô mǝnana a alte a baní ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Pǝlǝa Hana bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ guro mò kum earmúrú a mǝsǝo.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa ɓwame oa o male sǝ kya lili sǝ ɓamǝsǝi panzǝa.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Pǝlǝa à lo nǝ dǝmbari ɗiɗyal sǝ à peri aɓadǝm Yahweh; sǝ à nyar a ɓala malea a Rama. Elkana yi súrǝ̀ māmí Hana, sǝ Yahweh ɗenyinǝ Hana. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Lang anonggio yi karna ka, muna kpa a bum Hana sǝ ɓǝl muna-ɓwabura, sǝ tsǝki wi lullǝu ama Samuyila, acemǝnana bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ən zǝmbì aban Yahweh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hana pà Samuyila aban Ɓakuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Lang ɓè bàkú kàrna ka, ɓwabura man, yì Elkana ka wari andǝ ɓala male kat ace pà gìr'nkila mala koya pǝlǝa, sǝ ace lùmsǝ pàcau nǝ-shambum male aban Yahweh. <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Sǝama Hana ka wari ɗang. Banggi burí ama, &lt;&lt;Anzǝm mǝnana ǝn kasǝna muna a kiura ka, sǝ mǝ nǝ kánǝi, mǝ nǝ lǝmdǝí aɓadǝm Yahweh, sǝ yì ka nǝ̀ ue kano ba do-yilǝmu male kat.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nǝ̀ ue kano ba do-yilǝmu male kat. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amalǝmce-nggú mala amǝ Ibǝru tsǝì ama: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ən panì ɓǝ̀ duk ɓwa Nazir aɓalǝ anonggio mala do-yilǝmu male kat. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Burí Elkana banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Pàk gìr mǝnana ɓoaro kutibani a bano ka; kúndǝô sheɓǝ̀ a kasǝni a kiura ka; ɓǝ̀ Yahweh tsǝk cau male ɓǝ̀ yi lumsǝo.&gt;&gt; Nda ɓwame ueo sǝ lǝsǝ muni she lang kasǝni a kiura ka.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Sǝ lang kasǝni a kiura ka, twali atè, atārǝia andǝ muna-jamnda mǝnana mbule tàrú ka, andǝ tyang lum mala muku alkama, andǝ sambǝram mana lùmsǝì nǝ mùr-anap ka. Sǝ twal Samuyila aɓa kyauwe male yinǝi a ɓala mala Yahweh a Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Pǝlǝa à pwanmyal muna-jamndè, sǝ à yinǝ munê aban Eli. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Pǝlǝa Hana bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, ɓwamǝgule mem, kǝla mǝnana a ndakam nǝyilǝmu ka, mǝ nda ɓwama mǝnana ǝn cam kani aɓadǝmbo, aban pakhiwi aban Yahweh ka. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Ən pakhiwi ace muna mǝnia ka, sǝ Yahweh panam zǝmba mem mǝnana ǝn warinǝi a baní ka. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Acemani ka, ǝn panì Yahweh. Aɓa do-yilǝmu male kat ka, ǝn nyingŋǝ́nì Yahweh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 1:28">Pǝlǝa à peri aban Yahweh a banì.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Hiwi ɓwangsǝban mala Hana</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Sǝ Hana pakhiwi ama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Ɓabumam pàk banɓoarnado kǝ̀rkǝ́r aban Yahweh!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">Njawe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Njawe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;Rǝcandǝa&gt;&gt;</char></note> mem kumǝna loasǝ́bân atàcau mala Yahweh!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Kunam nǝ̀ nacau nǝ mǝsǝkàng-kàngŋa arǝ aɓiam-mǝbura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">acemǝnana ǝn nggǝ pàk-banɓoarnado aɓa amsǝban mô.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />Kǝɓwa pà kàm mǝfele kǝla Yahweh ɗàng!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:2">Kǝɓè pà kàm ɗàng she we!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">Sǝ kǝ Tali pa kàm kǝla Ɓakuli ma'sǝm ɗàng.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Kǝa wu hatǝki nacau twàlɓamúrû kǝ̀rkǝ́r ɗàng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">sǝ kǝa ɗeki acau gusǝlǝ-múrû pur a kuno ɗàng!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">Acemǝnana Yahweh ka Ɓakuli mala sǝlǝe na,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">sǝ nǝbani sǝ à kǝ karǝki atúró mala aɓwana.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />À ɓungina anta mala akanggǝrang-ɓwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:4">sǝ amǝ'tanggigya ka à marǝia nǝ rǝcandǝa.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Aɓwana mǝnana à ɗǝm ɗiɗyal ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">à mak ɓamuria ace nɗǝmo bǝtikulyak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">sǝ aɓwana mana nzala walia ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">à ɗwanyi ɗǝm ɗàng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">Nggearǝ nkombi ka, ɓǝlna amuna tongno-nong-ɓari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">sǝ ɓwama mǝnana ndanǝ amuna pas ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">dumǝna-pwari'pwari.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Isha 54:1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />Yahweh kǝ wal-lú sǝ kǝ pa yilǝmu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:6">kǝ sulǝ ɓwa a Shewol<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Shewol </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;ɓembe, ko ban mala alú&gt;&gt;</char></note> sǝ kǝ loasǝ ɓwa.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Yahweh kǝ tsǝk ɓwa a tǝ̀r, sǝ kǝ tsǝk ɓwa ɓǝ̀ duk mǝkume;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:7">kǝ kyauwiki ɓwa, sǝ kǝ gusǝlǝ ɓwa.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Kǝ loasǝ amǝ'tǝ̀r ɓǝà purî ɓá tú,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">sǝ amǝtapwasǝa ka kǝ pusǝia aɓa gìgí,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">ace tsǝia ɓǝà do andǝ amǝgulo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">sǝ ɓǝà kum liɓala mala buno ɓoarɓwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Akusǝɓa mala ɓanza ka à mala Yahweh na;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">amúria sǝ tamsǝ ɓanza.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Kǝ yál kusǝ amǝ'do-mǝsǝcau male,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:9">sǝ amǝ'ɓealɓikea ka nǝ̀ tsǝa kunia nǝ̀ pwal aɓa pǝndǝa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">Pà nǝ rǝcandǝa sǝ ɓwa nǝ̀ duk-gbani ɗang.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Amǝ'ɓinǝcau arǝ Yahweh ka, à nǝ̀ arkia gucik-gucik;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">nǝ̀ ìm arǝia a kuli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">Yahweh nǝ̀ ɓashì ɓanza kat;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">nǝ̀ pè murǝm male rǝcandǝa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">nǝ̀ loasǝ bù ɓwa male mǝnana tàrì ka.<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Pǝlǝa Elkana nyar a là a Rama. Sǝ muna ka ueo ace pàkkî Yahweh túró aɓadǝm Eli pǝris.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cauɓikea mala amuna-burana mala Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Amuna-burana mala Eli ka, aɓwana mǝɓane na. À súrǝ̀ Yahweh ɗàng <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />sǝ à tsǝkiria arǝ anggurcau amur agir mǝnana ɓoaro apǝris nǝ̀ ɗice aban aɓwana ka ɗàng. A kún mani ka, lang ɓwa na aban pà gir'nkila ka, mǝtúró-ɓala mala pǝris nǝ̀ yiu nǝ shokali-soa-nyama. Lang nyama narǝ ɓǝla a bǝsa ka, <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />nǝ̀ yia zuɓi shokali-soa-nyama aɓa nkenye, ko muna-nkwaring, ko kwangiri, ko nggea-nkwaring. Gìr mǝnana kat shokali-soa-nyama loasǝi ka, pǝris nǝ̀ twali ace ɓamurì. Mǝnia ka nda gìr mǝnana à kǝ pakki amǝ'Isǝrayila mǝnana kat à yiua pà gìr'nkila a Shilo ka. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Amur mǝno ka, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 3:5">Pǝris 3:5</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 3:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:23">7:23</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 7:25">25</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 7:31">31</ref></char></note>kaniama à nǝ̀ pisǝ mùrú-nyama ka, mǝtúró-ɓala mala pǝris nǝ̀ yiu sǝ nǝ̀ banggi ɓwa mǝnana pàkiyi gir'nkila ka ama, &lt;&lt;Pà nyama mǝnana à nǝ̀ twani ace pǝris ka, acemǝnana pà nǝ̀ ak nyama mǝnana à lambǝni ka ɗàng she mǝpwale.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Sǝ ɓǝ̀ ɓwê banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Kúndǝô ɓǝà pisǝ mùruí peatu, sǝ awu nǝ̀ twal gìr mǝnana a earce ka,&gt;&gt; nǝ̀ bang ama, &lt;&lt;Awo, dumǝna púp awu nǝ pà adyan! Ɓǝ̀ a pa raka, mǝ nǝ twali nǝ rǝcandǝa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Mǝnia yì cauɓikea mala alaggana mǝnia ka gul kǝ̀rkǝ́r a mǝsǝ Yahweh, acemǝnana pàgir aban Yahweh ka à pàkce-ɓà.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samuyila a Shilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />A bàkú mǝno ka Samuyila yì muna ka lidǝmba nǝ̀ pàkki Yahweh túró, kǝ oasǝ efot mala nggubyau linǝn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">efot mala nggubyau linǝn </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;adaura pǝris&gt;&gt;</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Koya pǝlǝa ka nggè nǝ̀ pàkki wi muna daura-múrɓì sǝ nǝ̀ yinǝi wi nǝi lang yiu atà burí ace pà gir'nkila mala koya pǝlǝa ka. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Pǝlǝa Eli nǝ̀ tsǝki Elkana andǝ māmí bù sǝ nǝ̀ bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ Yahweh loasǝò amuna nǝ bù ɓwama man a kúnì mǝnana zǝmba ace aban Yahweh ka.&gt;&gt; Anzǝm mǝno ka sǝ à nǝ̀ o a là.<verse eid="1SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Mǝsǝcau Yahweh ɓwamur Hana, sǝ kum ɓǝlmuna sǝ ɓǝl amuna-burana tàrú andǝ amuna-mamǝna ɓari. Sǝ muna yì Samuyila ka gulo a ɓadǝm Yahweh.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eli nunkir amuna-burana male</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />A bàkú mǝno ka Eli ena kutsuk, sǝ camarǝ ok cau mala gìr mǝnana kat amuna-burana male kǝ pakki Isǝrayila kat, andǝ mǝnana ama à kǝ nongginǝ amamǝna mana à kǝ yiu a pàktúró a kún Tara ban-kpapí ka. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Sǝ banggi amuna-burana male ama, &lt;&lt;Palang sǝ wu kǝ pakki agir kǝla amǝnia ka? Ən nggǝ oe a kún aɓwana mǝnia kat acau mala agir mǝɓike mǝnana wu kǝ pea ka. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Awo, amunem; cau mǝnana ǝn nggǝ oè kǝ mesǝe aɓalǝ aɓwana mala Yahweh ka, mǝɓoarne na ɗang. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Ɓǝ̀ ɓwa pàkkî ɓì cauɓikea ka, Ɓakuli nǝ̀ kùtí anrea ace gilǝki càu, sǝama ɓǝ̀ ɓwa pàkkî Yahweh cauɓikea ka, yana ɓwê nǝ̀ pwanzali aceì?&gt;&gt; Sǝ yià ka, à ginǝ kwakikiria arǝ cau mala tárria, acemǝnana kàne mala Yahweh na nǝ̀ wal-luia.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Aɓa mǝno anggo ka, muna yì Samuyila ka lidǝmba nǝ gulo aɓa nggūrǝu, sǝ aɓa earmúrú aban Yahweh andǝ aɓwana.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Pǝlǝa ɓè ɓwa mala Ɓakuli yiu aban Eli sǝ banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia ka nda cau mala Yahweh, &lt;Ən lǝmdǝ ɓamúràm bwāng aban ɓala mala keò, lang à nda a Masar aɓata Firona ka re? <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Ən tárì aɓalǝ atau mala Isǝrayila kat ɓǝ̀ duk pǝris mem, ace eauwe amur gyangŋan mem, ace paɓoro mala pisǝ muku-gìr loasǝ yele mǝ'rǝmɓoarne, sǝ ɓǝ̀ oasǝ efot aɓadǝmbam ngga re? Ən pê ɓala mala keò apagir kat mala bǝsa, mǝnana amǝ Isǝrayila kǝ yinǝia abanam ngga. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Sǝ palang sǝ wun kat wu ɓǝsǝkice agir'nkila mem andǝ apagir mem mǝnana ǝn tsǝk nzongcau nǝma ɓǝà yinǝia a mǝnia yì bando mem ngga? A gusǝlǝce amunio amuram nǝ earia wia ɓǝà twal amǝɓoarne kat aɓalǝ akoya pàgir mǝnana aɓwana mem amǝ Isǝrayila yinǝia ka, ace lǝsǝ ɓamuria ɓǝà nyange?&gt;<verse eid="1SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />&lt;&lt;Acemani ka, Yahweh, Ɓakuli mala Isǝrayila kǝ bang ama: &lt;Ən pacau nǝma ɓala mò andǝ nggurkwar mò ɓǝà lidǝmba nǝ kutio andǝ puro aɓadǝmbam tàtǝ́k.&gt; Sǝama, adyan ngga Yahweh kǝ na ama: &lt;Pà mǝ nǝ ɗeki ɓǝ̀ pàk anggo ɗǝm ɗàng. A kún mani ka, mǝ nǝ gusǝlǝ aɓwana mǝnana à gusǝlǝam ngga, sǝ aɓwana mǝnana à ɓǝsǝkiam ngga, mǝ nǝ pàkcea-ɓa. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Kwakikiro, anonggio na kǝ yiu mǝnana aɓalǝia ka, mǝ nǝ wal-lú koya lo-ɓwa muna-ɓwabura a ɓala mò andǝ nggurkwar mò, mǝnana nǝ̀ tsǝa à pà nǝ̀ kum jamgula ɗǝm a ɓala mò raka. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Sǝ mǝsǝo nǝ̀ sǝn tanni mǝkwanbanì mala ɓala peri mem. Mǝɓoarne nǝ̀ yiu amur Isǝrayila, sǝ a ɓala mò ka, kǝ ɓwa pà nǝ̀ bik apǝlǝa mala ě ɗǝm ɗàng, arǝ anza kat. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Ɓwa mwashat atà amǝkeo mǝnana mǝ nǝ ɗeki ɓǝ̀ lidǝmba nǝ túró pǝris amur gyangŋan mem ngga, nǝ̀ duk nte sǝ do male nǝ̀ pà aɓa tímúrû. Amǝkeo kat nǝ̀ wǔ a lo-ɓwa malea. <verse eid="1SA 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />Sǝ mǝnia yì gìr mǝnana nǝ̀ kum amuna-burana mô ɓari, yia Hofni andǝ Finehas ka, nǝ̀ dupô gìr'lǝmdǝa: yià kǝm à nǝ̀ wǔ aɓa pwari mǝ'mwashati.<verse eid="1SA 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Sǝ mǝ nǝ loasǝì ɓamúràm pǝris mǝ'mǝsǝcaunì, mǝnana nǝ̀ pàk gìr kǝla mana nda a bumam andǝ ɗenyicau mem ngga. Mǝ nǝ tamsǝ ɓala-pǝris male kàngkàng,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">tamsǝ ɓala-pǝris male kàngkàng </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;mǝ nǝ eari wi ɓǝ̀ kum amuna andǝ amǝ'kau mǝnana à nǝ̀ duk apǝris ka&gt;&gt;</char></note> sǝ nǝ̀ pàk túró-pǝris aɓadǝm ɓwa mem mana ǝn tárì ka tàtǝ́k.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ɓwa mem mana ǝn tárì ka tàtǝ́k; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 22:51">2Sam 22:51</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:50">Ang 18:50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:20">89:20</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Sǝ ɓwa mǝnana kat ueo nǝyilǝmu a nggurkwar mò ka, nǝ̀ ká aban pǝris mǝno ka ace zǝmbi wi gbatali bolo-azǝrfa andǝ ɗurǝo nɗǝmo, sǝ nǝ̀ bang ama: Ida, twalam a ɓè bantúró pǝris ace mǝnana mǝ kum girlina mana mǝ nǝ lì ka.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s">Yahweh tunǝ Samuyila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Adyan ngga muna, yì Samuyila ka, ndarǝ pakkì Yahweh túró a ɓadǝm Eli. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 74:9">Ang 74:9</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:11">Amo 8:11</ref></char>.</note>Arǝ abákú mǝno ka, Yahweh kǝ nacau nǝ aɓwana tùtù ɗang; sǝ sǝna ka làkkì ɗàng.<verse eid="1SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />A ɓè dù, Eli mǝnana amǝsǝì kǝ sǝnban ɗǝm pepè raka, ndaban nongŋo a ban mǝnana nonggiyi kam ngga, <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />sǝ pitǝla mala Ɓakuli ka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 27:21">Pur 27:21</ref></char>.</note> à malaká limi ɗàng. Sǝ Samuyila ka, ndaban nongŋo a ndà mala Yahweh, a ban mǝnana Akwati mala Ɓakuli pàk kàm ngga.<verse eid="1SA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Pǝlǝa Yahweh tunǝ Samuyila, sǝ Samuyila ear ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ ndya ka!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Pǝlǝa ɓangŋa wari aban Eli sǝ ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ ndya ka, a tunǝam.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">Sǝ Eli banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ən tunǝo ɗàng. Nyare kya nongnǝ-nongŋo.&gt;&gt; Nda nyare nongnǝ-nongŋo ka.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Yahweh nyare tunǝban ama, &lt;&lt;Samuyila!&gt;&gt; Sǝ Samuyila lo wari aban Eli sǝ ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ ndya ka, a tunǝam.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:6">Sǝ Eli banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ən tunǝo ɗàng, munem; nyare kya nongnǝ-nongŋo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Samuyila ka sǝlǝ ama Yahweh na kǝ tunǝi ka ɗàng, acemǝnana cau mala Yahweh malaká yiu a baní akǝ fara anggo ɗàng.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Pǝlǝa Yahweh tunǝ Samuyila ɗǝm tàruia tunǝban. Samuyila lo wari aban Eli sǝ ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ ndya ka, a tunǝam!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:8">Nda Eli yi sǝlǝa ama Yahweh na kǝ tunǝ munê ka. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Acemani ka, Eli banggi Samuyila ama, &lt;&lt;Nyare kya nongnǝ-nongŋo, sǝ ɓǝ̀ tunǝno ɗǝm ngga, ne wi ama, &lt;Nacau, Yahweh, guro mò na kǝ ueo ka.&gt; &gt;&gt; Nda Samuyila nyare wario kya nongnǝ-nongŋo a ban nongŋo male ka.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Sǝ Yahweh yiu yi came, sǝ tunǝban kǝla mana a dǝmbe ka, ama, &lt;&lt;Samuyila! Samuyila!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Samuyila pǝlǝa ear ama, &lt;&lt;Nacau, guro mò na kǝ ueo ka!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Pǝlǝa Yahweh banggi Samuyila ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, Mǝ ndo mǝ nǝ pàk ɓegìr a Isǝrayila; ɓwa mana kat okce ka, nǝ̀ gǝggǝli. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />A pwari mǝno ka, mǝ nǝ̀ lùmsǝ cau mǝnana ǝn ne amúr Eli andǝ ɓala male ka, twal a tite aban ká masǝlǝate. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Ən bangŋǝni wi nǝma mǝ ndo mǝ nǝ ɓashì ɓala male tàtǝ́k, ace cauɓikea mǝnana sǝlǝce ka, acemǝnana amuni <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 12:31-32">Mat 12:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk 12:10</ref></char>.</note>bang caukyauwikiban amur Ɓakuli, sǝ gimbia ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Acemani ka, ǝn kángìr aban ɓala mala Eli ama, &lt;Cauɓikea mala ɓala mala Eli ka, à pa nǝ̀ shawuɗi nǝ gìr'nkila ko pàɓoro ɗàng tàtǝ́k.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Nda Samuyila nongŋo bà dǝmbari. Pǝlǝa mǝngi akúnda mala ɓala mala Yahweh. Sǝ Samuyila ka ɓangciu pàkki wi arǝ ne Eli mǝno yì sǝna ka. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Sǝ Eli tunǝ Samuyila ama, &lt;&lt;Samuyila, munem!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Sǝ Samuyila eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ ndya ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Eli ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Mana Yahweh banggo? Ida, kǝa sǝmbǝ́rǝàmì ɗàng. Ɓakuli nǝ̀ ɓashio kǝ̀rkǝ́r yi mǝnana ɓǝ̀ a sǝmbǝ́rǝàm kǝcau mana banggo ka!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Nda Samuyila ne wi cê kat ka. Sǝmbǝrǝi wi kǝ cau ɗàng. Eli pǝlǝa bang ama, &lt;&lt;Yì nda Yahweh. Ɓǝ̀ pàk gìr mǝnana sǝni nda mǝɓoarne a mǝsǝì ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Samuyila lidǝmba nǝ̀ gulo, sǝ Yahweh na atè. Kǝ cau male kpa a nzali ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Amǝ Isǝrayila puppup, twal a Dan aban ká Biyasheba yi sǝlǝa ama, Samuyila ka, mǝɓangnǝa mala Yahweh na nǝ mǝsǝcau. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Yahweh lidǝmba nǝ pusǝrǝi a Shilo; lǝmdǝrǝì a Shilo aban Samuyila nǝ cau male.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Amǝ'Filisti ak Akwati Kùrcau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Sǝ cau mala [Yahweh nǝ kún] Samuyila yiu aban amǝ Isǝrayila kat. A bàkú mǝno ka, amǝ'Isǝrayila wari a munǝo arǝ amǝ'Filisti. À kya tsǝk kàttì malea a Ebeneza, sǝ amǝ'Filisti tsǝk kàttì malea a Afek. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Amǝ'Filisti tsaɗi a kúnarǝia a nzong ban-je munǝo ace ká arǝ Isǝrayila. Lang munǝo candǝ ka, amǝ'Filisti gandǝ amǝ'Isǝrayila, à wal-lú aburana mala amǝ'Isǝrayila kǝla aɓwana á-ine a ɓawan lwa.<verse eid="1SA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Lang amǝ'lwa nyarǝna a kàttì ka, aɓwana-mǝgule mala Isǝrayila bang ama, &lt;&lt;Palang sǝ Yahweh eari amǝ'Filisti sǝ à li sǝm a munǝo yalung? Ɓǝ̀ sǝm kyane ɓǝ̀ sǝm twal Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh a Shilo, ɓǝ̀ sǝm yinǝi kani, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ pà atà sǝm, sǝ ɓǝ̀ amsǝ sǝm a ɓabù aɓisǝm amǝbura.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Nda à tùr aburana a Shilo, sǝ à kya twal Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh Mǝtala Abangŋo, mǝnana do a buno-murǝm a nre ka <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Pur 25:22</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 6:2">2Sam 6:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 80:1">Ang 80:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 99:1">99:1</ref></char>.</note>acerup ka. Amuna-burana ɓari mala Eli, yià Hofni andǝ Finehas ka, à nda kano atà Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli. <verse eid="1SA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Lang à yinanǝ Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh aɓa kàttì ka, Isǝrayila kat ɓuà-gāwàn mǝcandǝe gandǝa nzali gǝggǝli. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Sǝ lang amǝ'Filisti ok gì ɓuà-gāwàn ngga, à bang ama, &lt;&lt;Mana nda ɓá mǝnia yi gāwàn mǝcandǝe aɓa kàttì mala amǝ'Ibǝru ka?&gt;&gt; Lang à yi sǝlǝa ama, Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh yina aɓa kàttì ka, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />ɓangciu pàkki amǝ'Filisti, acemǝnana à bang ama, &lt;&lt;Aɓakuli yina a kàttì malea! Caukwanban nǝ sǝm! Kǝgìr kǝla man kum sǝm a kǝ fara ɗàng! <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Caukwanban nǝ sǝm! Yana nǝ̀ amsǝ sǝm a ɓabù aɓakuli mǝ'rǝcandǝe man? Amǝnia ka, à nda ka aɓakuli mǝnana à wal amǝ'Masar nǝ koya ulang agir'murmwana a ɓabondo ka! <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Wu cam kàngkàng, wu duk aburana,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">wu duk aburana </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;cam wara kǝla aburana&gt;&gt;</char></note> wun amǝ'Filisti, ɓǝ̀ ana raka wun nǝ̀ duk aguro mala amǝ'Ibǝru, kǝla mana à duk aguro ma'wun ngga! Wu duk aburana sǝ wu munǝo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Nda amǝ'Filisti munǝo, sǝ à gandǝ Isǝrayila, sǝ koya ɓwabura ka, ɓangŋa nyare a gumli male. À wal-lú amǝ'Isǝrayila kǝ̀rkǝ́r: asoje-kusǝu á-lumi-tàrú (30,000) wù a kun-munǝo. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli ka, Amǝ'Filisti é à umnǝi, sǝ amuna-burana mala Eli ɓari, yià Hofni andǝ Finehas ka, à wal-luia.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lú mala Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Akǝ pwari mǝno ka, ɓè ɓwabura ɓwa'Benjami ɓangŋa a kun-munǝo sǝ yiu a Shilo nǝ gìr'nggūrǝu mǝsange arǝì nǝ tú a ɓamuri. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Lang yi bik ka, Eli naban do yak, amúr buno male a gírí kun-nda aban sǝn njar, ɓālǝi kǝ kasǝki atàcau mala Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli. Lang ɓwabure kùtí aɓa nggea-là sǝ bangce gìr mǝnana kumban ngga, nggea-là kat so ɓua gǝu. <verse eid="1SA 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eli ok ɓua-woi'woi sǝ ɗìban ama, &lt;&lt;Mana nda ɓá mǝnia yì zunggǝli mala ban ngga?&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa ɓwabure larri yiu, sǝ banggi Eli cê. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />(Eli ka ndanǝ apǝlǝa lumi-tongno-nong-ine-bwamdǝ-tongno-nong-tàrú (98), sǝ anggur-mǝsǝì wuna, acemani ka kǝ sǝnban pepè ɗàng.) <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Ɓwabure ne Eli ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nda ɓwa mǝnana ǝn pur a kun-munǝo ka; ǝn ɓangŋa a kun-munǝo yalung.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Eli ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Mana kumban, munem?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Ɓwabure eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Isǝrayila ɓangŋa a ɓadǝmba amǝ'Filisti, sǝ à wal-lú amǝ Isǝrayila nǝ nggea walban! Amuna-burana mô ɓari, Hofni andǝ Finehas ka à walnia, sǝ Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli ka, amǝ'Filisti angŋǝni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Lang bangcau mala Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli ka, kara Eli nyare kpa nǝtakwari amúr buno male a nkanggari bankutio, myali ɓunno, sǝ wǔ, acemǝnana enà sǝ dǝmbǝrya. Eli ka nda mǝɓashi amúr Isǝrayila mala apǝlǝa lumi-ine.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lú mala mālá Finehas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Nkil Eli, mālá Finehas ka ndanǝ muna a bumi, sǝ pwari gbashi male gbashìna tù. Lang ok cau ama Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli ka à angŋǝni, sǝ nkili-mǝɓwabure andǝ burí ka à wuna ka, kara kùndǝ a nzali sǝ gbashi. Sǝama kwanban mala gbashi ɓākì.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kara kùndǝ a nzali sǝ gbashi. Sǝama kwanban mala gbashi ɓākì. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;kara kùndǝ a nzali sǝ gbashi, acemǝnana kwanban mala gbashi ɓākì.&gt;&gt;</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Sǝ lang malanǝ̀ wù ka, amamǝna mǝnana à ndaban came amurí ka à ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Cè ɓangciu pàkkô ɗàng! A ɓǝlna muna-ɓwabura!&gt;&gt; Sǝ yì ka, nyesǝia wia kǝcau ko tsǝkiri ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Pǝlǝa tsǝki munê lullǝu ama Ikabot,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 14:3">1Sam 14:3</ref></char>.</note> ɓālǝi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓoarɓwa mala Ɓakuli nyìngŋǝ̀nà Isǝrayila.&gt;&gt; Pà mǝnia yi lullǝu ka acemǝnana à gbamina Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli arǝ amǝ'Isǝrayila, sǝ ace lú mala nkili-mǝɓwabure andǝ burí. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓoarɓwa mala Ɓakuli nyìngŋǝ̀nà Isǝrayila, acemǝnana Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli ka, à gbamini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli pè amǝ'Filisti tanni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Anzǝm mana amǝ'Filisti angŋǝna Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli ka, à twali a Ebeneza sǝ à warini a Ashdot. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Pǝlǝa amǝ'Filisti twal Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli sǝ à yinǝi a ndà mala <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 16:23">Akas 16:23</ref></char>.</note>Dagon, sǝ à kya tsǝi a nkanggari Dagon. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Lang banfana ka, amǝ Ashdot lo nǝ dǝmbari sǝ à yi sǝni ka, Dagon kpana nǝ ɓamǝsǝi a nzali aɓadǝm Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh. Nda à twal Dagon sǝ à tsǝi a bancame male. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Sǝ lang banfana ɗǝm ngga, à lo nǝ dǝmbari sǝ à yi sǝni ka, Dagon kpana nǝ ɓamǝsǝi a nzali aɓadǝm Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh, ɓamur Dagon andǝ abui kǝm na aban nongŋo a bankutio, à ɓungina. Kǝ nggunrǝ Dagon na ue ka. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Mǝnia ka nda gìr mǝnana tsǝa sǝ apǝris mala Dagon andǝ aɓwana mana kat à kǝ kútí a ndà mala Dagon a Ashdot ka, à kǝ tsǝk kusǝia amur bankutio a ndà mala Dagon raka bà yalung.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Bù Yahweh sulǝ nǝ-dǝmbǝrya amúr aɓwana mana à ndanǝdo a Ashdot ka, sǝ yinǝia wia gìr'mur'mwana amúrià, sǝ koea nǝ kwano rǝu-mwarkya, nggearǝ Ashdot andǝ amuna-là male. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Lang aɓwana mala Ashdot sǝn gìr mǝnana kǝ̀ kumia ka, à bang ama, &lt;&lt;Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli mala amǝ'Isǝrayila ɓǝ̀kǝa ue a ban sǝm ɗàng, acemǝnana buì sulǝna nǝ gìr'mur'mwana kǝ̀rkǝ́r amúr sǝm sǝ amúr Dagon, ɓakuli ma'sǝm!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Nda à túrban sǝ à ramba amǝ'yálmurû kat mala amǝ'Filisti abanɓwáná, sǝ à ɗia ama, &lt;&lt;Mana sǝm nǝ̀ pang nǝ Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli mala amǝ'Isǝrayila?&gt;&gt; À ear ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ sǝm yinǝ Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli mala amǝ'Isǝrayila a Gat.&gt;&gt; Nda à yinǝ Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli mala amǝ'Isǝrayila abanì ka. <verse eid="1SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Sǝama lang à warina nǝi kano ka, bù Yahweh sulǝ amúr nggea-là mǝno gbal, mǝnana turia aɓa nggea kàrmúrû ka. Rǝu-mwarkya sakki arǝ aɓwana mala nggea-lê, amuna andǝ aɓwamǝgule kat.<verse eid="1SA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Pǝlǝa à tasǝ Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli a Ekǝron. Sǝama lang Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli bwalǝna Ekǝron ngga, amǝ Ekǝron túr kunia a ɓua ama, &lt;&lt;À yinanǝ Akwati mala Ɓakuli mala amǝ'Isǝrayila aban sǝm ace wal-lú sǝm andǝ aɓwana ma'sǝm!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Nda à túrban sǝ à ramba amǝ'yálmurû mala amǝ'Filisti kat abanɓwáná sǝ à bang ama, &lt;&lt;Wu nyesǝ Akwati mala Ɓakuli mala amǝ'Isǝrayila ɓǝ̀ nyar a ban mǝnana pùr kam ngga, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ kǝa wal-lú sǝm andǝ aɓwana ma'sǝm ɗàng.&gt;&gt; Kàrmúrû mala lú yi sulǝ amur nggea-là mǝno puppup atàcau mala gir'murmwana mana yiu amúrià nǝ bù Ɓakuli ka. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Aɓwana mǝnana à wù raka, à bwal nǝ kwano rǝu-mwarkya, sǝ ɓua mala nggea-lê lo a kuli.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Amǝ'Filisti nyesǝ Akwati Kùrcau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Lang Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh pàngŋǝ́nà azongŋo tongno-nong-ɓari a nzali mala amǝ'Filisti ka, <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Amǝ'Filisti tunǝ apǝris andǝ amǝ'ɓángnǝ́-ɓángna sǝ à ɗia ama, &lt;&lt;Mana sǝm nǝ̀ pang nǝ Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh? Wu bangga sǝm lang sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ nyesǝ man yì Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh a ban mǝnana pùr kam ngga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />À ear ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ wun nǝ̀ nyesǝ Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli mala Isǝrayila ka, wu kǝa nyesǝi nǝ ɓālǝi atarǝì ɗàng; koɓǝ̀ lang le ka wu nyesǝi nǝ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 5:15-16">Pǝris 5:15-16</ref></char>.</note>pàgir mala mbwegìr ace kumcau. Anggo ka, sǝ wun nǝ̀ kum twalbanì, sǝ wun nǝ̀ bwalta gìr mana tsǝa sǝ buì loapi múr wun raka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Pǝlǝa à ɗìban ama, &lt;&lt;Ya ulang pàgir mala mbwegìr ace kumcau na sǝm nǝ̀ tasǝî wi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 6:4">Apǝris andǝ amǝ'ɓángnǝ́-ɓángna nyesǝia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Lakkì mala amǝ'yálmurû mala amǝ'Filisti ka, à nda tongno. Acemani ka, wu tasǝ aɓǝ̀nzál mala rǝu-mwarkya mala bolo-njengǝlan tongno andǝ aɓǝ̀nzál mala ankwam mala bolo-njengǝlan tongno, acemǝnana mǝno ka, nda mwashat andǝ gir'murmwana mana kum wun andǝ amǝ'yálmurû ma'wun ngga. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Acemani ka, dumǝna púp wun nǝ̀ pak aɓǝ̀nzál mala rǝu-mwarkya andǝ aɓǝ̀nzál mala ankwam mǝnana à kiɗiki nzali ka. Dumǝna púp wun nǝ̀ pè Ɓakuli mala amǝ'Isǝrayila gulo. Yakǝla buì nǝ̀ pàk halku amúr wun, sǝ amúr aɓakuli ma'wun, andǝ nzali ma'wun. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Palang sǝ wun nǝ̀ tǝr ɓabum wun kǝla mǝnana amǝ'Masar andǝ Firona tǝr ɓabumia ka? Anzǝm mana pàngŋǝ́nia wia gìr'kwanban arǝia ka, à nying amǝ'Isǝrayila ace mǝnana ɓǝà u ka re? <verse eid="1SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Ado ka, wu kyane, wu pàk bǝsa keke-ndá. Wu alta andá ɓari amǝ-pakiura, mǝnana à malaká tsǝkia wia nggun-rya a myalia raka. Wu kùrî andá mǝnia ka keke-ndá arǝ nggun-rya a myalia, sǝ wu pǝr amunia ɓǝà nyare a domwan malea. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Sǝ wu twal Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh, wu tsǝi amúr keke-ndá, sǝ aɓǝ̀nzál mala bolo-njengǝlan mǝnana wun nǝ̀ tasǝia kǝla pàgir mala mbwegìr ace kumcau ka, wu tsǝia aɓa ɓè akwati a nkanggari Akwati Kùrcau. Sǝ wu tasǝta keke-ndá ɓǝ̀ ukia o male. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Sǝama wu tsǝkmǝsǝ wun. Ɓǝ̀ umnǝ njar Bet-Shemesh aɓa nzali male ka, lǝmdǝ ama Ɓakuli mala amǝ Isǝrayila nda mǝnana pàkka sǝm mǝnia yi nggea gìr mǝɓike ka. Sǝ ɓǝ̀ pàk anggo raka, sǝm nǝ̀ sǝlǝa ama buì na mǝnana kok sǝm ngga ɗàng; múrɓikea na mǝnana kum sǝm ngga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Nda aburane pàk kǝla mana à banggia wia ka. À twal andá ɓari amǝ-pakiura, à tsǝkia wia nggun-rya a myalia sǝ à kùrrì arǝ keke-ndá; osso à kasǝkun amunia a là. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />À tsǝk Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh amúr keke-ndê, sǝ akwati mǝnana nǝ aɓǝ̀nzál mala bolo-njengǝlan mala ankwam andǝ rǝu-mwarkya malea ka, à tsǝì a nkanggari. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Pǝlǝa andê lo ò amur njargula ká Bet-Shemesh; à dǝshi kporong aban ká nǝ ɓua, sǝ ko à kyang a bu-mǝli ko bu-mǝnggare ɗàng. Amǝ'yálmurû mala amǝ'Filisti gya anzǝmia aban ká ɗār a nzong-nzali mala Bet-Shemesh.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />A bàkú mǝno ka aɓwana mala Bet-Shemesh na aban um mǝssa-alkama malea a ɓangŋaban ace pwan-gìrɓaban. Lang à loasǝ mǝsǝia sǝ à sǝn Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh ka, à pàk-banɓoarnado nǝ sǝne. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Keke-ndê yiu a ɓaban mala Jesǝwa ɓwa Bet-Shemesh, sǝ cam abanì a nkanggari ɓè tali mǝgule. Pǝlǝa aɓwana mana abanì ka, à arki akpamgbang mala keke-ndê sǝ à pàgir mala pisǝe kǝring nǝ andê aban Yahweh. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Pǝlǝa amǝ'Lawi twal Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh andǝ akwati mana a nkanggari, mǝnana ndanǝ aɓǝ̀nzál mala bolo-njengǝlan aɓalǝi ka, sǝ à tsǝia amúr nggea tali mǝno. Sǝ amǝ Bet-Shemesh pàgir mala pisǝe kǝring andǝ apagir mala gir'nkila aban Yahweh a pwari mǝno. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Amǝ'yálmurû tongno mala amǝ'Filisti came sǝ à sǝn gìr mǝno kat, pǝlǝa à nyar a Ekǝron akǝ pwari mǝno.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Amǝnia ka, à nda ka aɓǝ̀nzál mala rǝu-mwarkya mala bolo-njengǝlan, mǝnana amǝ'Filisti yinǝi kǝla pàgir mala mbwegìr ace kumcau aban Yahweh ka: mwashat ace cauɓikea mala Ashdot, mwashat ace cauɓikea mala Gaza, mwashat ace cauɓikea mala Ashkelon, mwashat ace cauɓikea mala Gat, mwashat ace cauɓikea mala Ekǝron; <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />sǝ aɓǝ̀nzál nkwam mala bolo-njengǝlan ngga, à nda akúnì nggea-là mala amúrû tongno mala amǝ'Filisti, tite arǝ anggea-là mǝnana à kària nǝ akanggǝrang sheran aban ká arǝ amuna-là malea mana a patal ka. Nggea tali mǝnana à tsǝk Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh amurí ka, ndakam bà yalung a ɓaban mala Jesǝwa ɓwa Bet-Shemesh, ace kasǝɓalǝu arǝ gìr mǝnana kumban ngga.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Sǝama Yahweh wal-lú aɓea aburana mala Bet-Shemesh, acemǝnana à sǝn ɓá Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh ka. Yahweh wal-lú aburana malea lumi-tongno-nong-ɓari. Amǝ Bet-Shemesh pak-bumkiɗikea acemǝnana Yahweh wal-lú aɓwana malea nǝ nggea walban ngga.<verse eid="1SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Pǝlǝa amǝ Bet-Shemesh bang ama, &lt;&lt;Yana nǝ̀ gandǝnǝ came aɓadǝm Yahweh, yì Ɓakuli mǝfele? Sǝ aban ayan sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ tasǝì ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ upi ban sǝm ngga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Nda à tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân a Kiriat-Jarim, nǝ cau ama, &lt;&lt;Amǝ'Filisti nyesǝna Akwati Kùrcau mala Yahweh. Wu yiu wu twali, wu umnǝi a ban wun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Pǝlǝa aburana mala Kiriat-Jarim yiu à yi twal Akwati kùrcau mala Yahweh; à wari nǝi a ɓala mala Aminadap mǝnana nda amúr mgbang-ban ngga. À twal muna-ɓwabura male Eleaza ɓǝ̀ do ndà mǝ'yál Akwati kùrcau mala Yahweh, ɓǝ̀ kǝ ɗenyinǝi. <verse eid="1SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Twal a pwari mǝno ka Akwati kùrcau mala Yahweh ue kano a Kiriat-Jarim banì sau kǝ̀rkǝ́r, pǝlǝa lumi-ɓari. Arǝ apǝlǝkia mǝno ka, amǝ Isǝrayila ɓua, ɓua keban mala alta Yahweh.<verse eid="1SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samuyila duk mǝɓashi amur Isǝrayila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Sǝ Samuyila banggi ɓala mala Isǝrayila kat ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ wun nǝ̀ nyar aban Yahweh nǝ ɓabum wun kat ka, dumǝna púp wun nǝ̀ vwakibu wun arǝ abǝri ɓakuli andǝ aɓǝ̀nzál Ashtarot, ɓǝà pùrî ɓalǝ wun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 24:23">Jes 24:23</ref></char>.</note> Wu pà ɓamur rǝ wun kat-kat aban Yahweh, sǝ wu peri abani nǝmurǝì, sǝ yì ka nǝ̀ amsǝ wun a ɓabu amǝ'Filisti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Nda amǝ Isǝrayila yi pusǝki ankúl mala Ba'al andǝ Ashtarot à sukkia, sǝ à peri aban Yahweh nǝmurǝì ka.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila bang ama, &lt;&lt;Wu ram Isǝrayila kat a Mizǝpa sǝ mǝ nǝ pakhiwi aban Yahweh ace wun.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Lang à yi ramna a Mizǝpa ka, à tò mùr sǝ à solǝi a nzali a ɓadǝm Yahweh. A pwari mǝno kat ka, à gilmùr sǝ à bang nǝ kunia ama &lt;&lt;Sǝm pàngŋǝ́nì Yahweh cauɓikea.&gt;&gt; Samuyila yi do nda mǝɓashi amúr Isǝrayila a Mizǝpa.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Lang amǝ'Filisti ok ama amǝ Isǝrayila ramna a Mizǝpa ka, amurǝma mala amǝ'Filisti lo à yiu ace kánǝ munǝo arǝia. Sǝ lang amǝ Isǝrayila okce ka, ɓangciu pakkia wia arǝ amǝ'Filisti. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Sǝ amǝ Isǝrayila zǝmbi Samuyila ama, &lt;&lt;Lidǝmba nǝ ɓua ace sǝm aban Yahweh Ɓakuli ma'sǝm, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ amsǝ sǝm a bu amǝ'Filisti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila twal muna-nzur mana nda a kúnkiura ka, pànà gir'nkila mala pisǝì kǝring nǝi a bǝsa aban Yahweh. Sǝ Samuyila ɓua aban Yahweh ɓǝ̀ bwalì amǝ Isǝrayila kàm, sǝ Yahweh ok ɓua male.<verse eid="1SA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Lang Samuyila na aban pa gir'nkila mala pisǝe a bǝsa ka, amǝ'lwa mala amǝ'Filisti soa aban yiu nǝ munǝo arǝ amǝ Isǝrayila. Sǝama a pwari mǝno ka, Yahweh ìm arǝ amǝ'lwa mala amǝ'Filisti a kùli nǝ giu mǝcandǝe kǝla sa mala mgbarangce. Yahweh túriá aɓa múrzurǝkya, nda à ɓangŋa a ɓadǝmba amǝ'lwa mala amǝ Isǝrayila ka. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Sǝ aburana mala amǝ Isǝrayila purî ɓá Mizǝpa nǝ mire, à pǝrta amǝ'Filisti sǝ à kǝ wal-luia amur njar aban ká ɗār a ɓangŋaban mala Bet-kar.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Anzǝm mǝno ka, Samuyila twal nggea-tali sǝ yi kwaki anre Mizǝpa andǝ Shen, sǝ tunǝ lullǝ banì ama Ebeneza,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ebeneza </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ka ɓālǝi ka nda &lt;&lt;tali mala gbasha.&gt;&gt;</char></note> acemǝnana bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ba ado ka, Yahweh na pakka sǝm gbasha ka!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Anggo sǝ amǝ'Filisti ka à paria, sǝ à nyare à kútí ɗǝm a nzong-nzali mala amǝ Isǝrayila ama à nǝ̀ yiu nǝ lwa ɗang. Aɓa do-yilǝmu kat mala Samuyila ka, bù Yahweh ɓìkî amǝ'Filisti. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Amǝ'lwa mala amǝ Isǝrayila ak anggea-là mǝnana amǝ'Filisti ea arǝ amǝ Isǝrayila ka, à nyesǝia a bu amǝ Isǝrayila, twal a Ekǝron aban ká Gat. Acili abân mana tù nǝ anggea-là mǝnana amǝ'Filisti ea ɗiɗyal ka, amǝ'lwa mala amǝ Isǝrayila nyesǝia a bu amǝ Isǝrayila. Ɗǝm ngga do-rǝpwala yi pa a nreka amǝ Isǝrayila andǝ amǝ'Amor.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Samuyila lidǝmba nǝ do mǝɓashi amur amǝ Isǝrayila bà lú male. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Koya pǝlǝa ka kǝ twal gya aban ká andǝ nyare arǝ anggea-là Betel, andǝ Gilgal sǝ Mizǝpa. Pàkkî Isǝrayila ɓashi arǝ abân mǝnia ka kat. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Anzǝm mana malna ka, nǝ̀ nyar a Rama, ban mǝnana ɓala male pàk kàm ngga. A Rama gbal ka nda mǝɓashi, sǝ ɓakkî Yahweh gyangŋan kàm.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Amǝ Isǝrayila alta kum murǝm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Lang yi bwalna arǝ apǝlǝkia mala e mala Samuyila ka, tsǝk amuni ɓǝà duk amǝ'ɓashi amur amǝ Isǝrayila. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Lullǝ muna-dǝmba male nda Joyel, sǝ ɓaria muni ka, lullǝi nda Abija. À duk amǝ'ɓashi a Biyasheba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Amuni ka, à twal kusǝi ɗàng, à kyanggî njar ace alta kume, à ak pàbunǝnzali sǝ à pūrǝ ɓashi.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Pǝlǝa aɓwana-mǝgule mala Isǝrayila kat, ram rǝia abanɓwáná sǝ à yiu aban Samuyila a Rama; <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />à yi ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, a ena, sǝ amunio twalkusǝo ɗàng. Ado ka, tsǝka sǝm murǝm mǝnana nǝ̀ yálmúr sǝm kǝla mala acili anzali kat ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Sǝama cau mǝnia à ne ama, &lt;&lt;Pà sǝm murǝm mǝnana nǝ̀ yálmúr sǝm&gt;&gt; ngga, pwasǝbum Samuyila ɗàng. Nda Samuyila pakhiwi aban Yahweh ka. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Osso Yahweh banggi Samuyila ama, &lt;&lt;Kpata gì aɓwana man, pàk gìr mǝnana kat à banggo ka, acemǝnana a nda mǝnana à ginǝo ka ɗàng, mǝ nda mǝnana à ginǝam ɓǝn nggá duk murǝm amúrià raka. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Kǝla mǝnana à pa, twal a pwari mǝnana ǝn pusǝia à purî ɓá Masar ba yalung ngga, à ginǝkiam, sǝ à peri aban aɓea aɓakuli ka, nda kǝgìr mǝnana à kǝ pakko gbal ka. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Acemani ka, kpata gia; sǝama awu nǝ nunkiria pepè, sǝ awu nǝ bǝlia wia lang sǝ murǝm mǝnana nǝ̀ yálmuria ka nǝ̀ pàngŋǝ́nǝia.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nunkiru mala Samuyila arǝ amurǝma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Anggo sǝ Samuyila bang acau mala Yahweh kat aban aɓwana mǝnana à alkiyita murǝm a baní ka. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ani sǝ murǝm mǝnana nǝ̀ yálmúr wun ngga, nǝ̀ pangnǝ wun: nǝ̀ twal amuna ma'wun nǝ̀ tsǝia à nǝ̀ duk amǝkok awaru-pǝr andǝ apǝr male mǝnana à nǝ̀ nggǝ ɓang aɓadǝm awaru-pǝr male ka. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Sǝ nǝ̀ tsǝkî ɓamurì amǝ'sàrǝ̀ban amur aɓwana á-á, andǝ amǝ'sàrǝ̀ban amur aɓwana á-lumi-tongno, sǝ aɓea ka à nǝ̀ duk amǝ'rya andǝ amǝ'pwan-gìrɓaban male, andǝ amǝ'tulki agirbura mala lwa andǝ agirtúró mala awaru-pǝr male. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Nǝ̀ twal amuna-mamǝna ma'wun ɓǝà pǝlǝ amǝ'pakki agir pà'rǝmban-mǝɓoarne, andǝ amǝ'lamggi agirlina, andǝ amǝ'lúrǝ́gir. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Nǝ̀ ak aɓaban mǝɓoarne ma'wun andǝ aɓaban-anap, andǝ aɓaban mala anggun-olif ma'wun sǝ nǝ̀ pè amǝ'túró male. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Nǝ ak kāmbe mwashat aɓa lum mala mǝsǝsa andǝ aɓǝla-anap ma'wun, sǝ nǝ̀ pè amǝgulo andǝ amǝ'túró male. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Nǝ̀ twal aguro ma'wun aburana andǝ amamǝna, andǝ alaggana mǝnana à nda dwat ka, andǝ amǝdambǝriso ma'wun, sǝ nǝ̀ tsǝia aɓa túró male. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Nǝ̀ ak kāmbe mwashat aɓa lum mala agirkusǝu ma'wun, sǝ wun nǝ̀ duk aguro male. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />A pwarì mǝno ka, wun nǝ̀ ɓua ace kum usǝlǝo a bù murǝm mǝnana wu tàrrî ɓamurǝ wun ngga, sǝ Yahweh pà nǝ̀ oka wun amǝno yì pwari ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahweh pè amǝ Isǝrayila zǝmba malea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Kat andǝ manì ka, aɓwe ginǝ okî Samuyila. À bang ama, &lt;&lt;Awo, ma'sǝm ngga sǝm nggǝ earce murǝm amur sǝm, <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm pa kǝla acili anzali kat, sǝ ɗǝm ngga ɓǝ̀ murǝm ma'sǝm ɓǝ̀ kǝ pakka sǝm ɓashi sǝ ɓǝ̀ dupa sǝm a dǝmba, sǝ nǝ̀ lwa-lwa ma'sǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Lang Samuyila ongŋǝna acau mala aɓwe ka, ɓǝsǝlǝia ɓǝ̀ Yahweh oea. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Sǝ Yahweh banggi Samuyila ama, &lt;&lt;Kpata gia sǝ wu pea wia murǝm.&gt;&gt; Samuyila pǝlǝa ne aburana mala Isǝrayila ama, &lt;&lt;Koyan ngga ɓǝ̀ nyare a nggea-là male.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s">À tàr Sawul ɓǝ̀ duk murǝm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Ɓè ɓwa'Benjami nakam mǝnana à tunǝki ama Kish ka, muna-ɓwabura mala Abiyel, muna-ɓwabura mala Zero, muna-ɓwabura mala Bekorat, muna-ɓwabura mala Afiya, ɓwa'Benjami, mǝgǝna na. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Ndanǝ muna-ɓwabura mǝnana à tunǝki ama Sawul ka, lagga mǝɓoarjami. Kǝ ɓwa pà kàm aɓa Isǝrayila mǝnana ɓoarjam kútì ka ɗàng. Twal a nkpamtari aban umnǝ kuli ka, dāh'rya kútì koyan atà aɓwe.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />A bàkú mǝno ka, aɓea mǝdambǝriso mala Kish, tár Sawul ɓwaro. Nda Kish banggi muni Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Twal mwashat atà alaggana atò, sǝ wu lo, wu kya alta amǝdambǝriso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Sǝ Sawul kùtí nǝɓa nzali múr ankono mala Ifǝrem sǝ yi kútí nǝɓa nzali Shalisha, sǝama à kumia ɗàng. Sǝ à kùtí nǝɓa nzali Sha'alim, sǝ à kumia ɗàng. Pǝlǝa à yi kútí nǝɓa nzali Benjami, sǝ à kumia ɗàng.<verse eid="1SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Lang à yina a nzali Zuf ka, Sawul banggi lagga male mǝnana nda atè ka ama, &lt;&lt;Yiu sǝm nǝ̀ nyare, ɓǝ̀ ana raka, tárrám nǝ̀ nying pàk ɗenyicau amur amǝdambǝriso, nǝ̀ kùtí a bumpina ace sǝm.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Sǝ lagga male ka banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, ɓwa mala Ɓakuli na a nggea-là man, ɓwa na à kǝ gusǝlǝce kǝ̀rkǝ́r; gir mǝnana kat ne ka kǝ lumsǝo. Ado ka, fa sǝm nǝ̀ ká abani, earka nǝ bangga sǝm njar mǝnana sǝm nǝ̀ ká kàm ngga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Pǝlǝa Sawul ne guro male ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ sǝm na ama sǝm nǝ̀ ká aban ɓwabure ka, mana sǝm nǝ̀ kánǝi wi? Bǝredi mǝnana aɓalǝ abuku ma'sǝm ngga malǝna. Sǝm pànǝ kǝ ɓoro mǝnana sǝm nǝ̀ kánǝi ɓwa mala Ɓakuli ka ɗàng. Mana sǝm ndani?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Laggè earî Sawul ɗǝm ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, akani ka, mǝ ndanǝ gauwe-ine mala shekel mala bolo-azǝrfa a buam, mǝ nǝ nggá pè ɓwa mala Ɓakuli ɓǝ̀ na sǝm njar mǝnana sǝm nǝ̀ ká kam ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />(Ɗiɗyal a Isǝrayila ka, lang ɓwa earce ɗìbancau aban Ɓakuli ka, nǝ̀ bang ama, &lt;&lt;Yiu, ɓǝ̀ sǝm kya aban mǝ'sǝna,&gt;&gt; acemǝnana &lt;&lt;mǝɓangnǝa&gt;&gt; yalung ngga à tunǝi ɗiɗyal ama mǝ'sǝna.) <verse eid="1SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Sǝ Sawul banggi lagga male ama, &lt;&lt;Cau mò na jik, fa sǝm nǝ̀ ká.&gt;&gt; Nda à wari a nggea-là mǝnana ɓwa mala Ɓakuli na kam ngga. <verse eid="1SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Lang à ndaban eau a mgbangban aban ká a nggea-lê ka, à je andǝ aɓea ansarina aban yiu ace ká to mùr, sǝ à ɗia ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ'sǝna na kani le?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />À earia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Nda kani; wu sǝni, nda kǝ ká a dǝm wun ngga. Wu fà rǝ wun. Ndo kǝ kùtí nǝ kutio a nggea-là ka, acemǝnana aɓwe nanǝ pa gìr'nkila yalung a ban-mǝdāhre. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Lang wu kutina ka, wun nǝ̀ kumi a kún nggea-là; kǝ umnǝ o a ban-mǝdāhre ace li girlina. Aɓwe pà nǝ̀ lìli ɗang sheɓǝ̀ yina ka, acemǝnana dumǝna púp nǝ̀ tsǝkî gìr'nkila bu; sǝ anzǝm mǝno ka, abǝri mǝnana à tunǝia ka, à nǝ̀ lìli. Ado ka, wu eau tu, wun nǝ̀ nggá kumi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Nda à eau aban ká nggea-lê ka. Lang à nǝ̀ nggǝ kùtí aɓa nggea-là ka, à sǝn Samuyila dǝshinia, nǝ̀ eau aban ká ban-mǝdāhre.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Nongŋo mwashat a dǝm yiu mala Sawul ka, Yahweh angŋa-dǝmba lǝmdǝni Samuyila ama: <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />&lt;&lt;Li ani ka, mǝ nǝ tasǝ ɓeɓwa mala nzali Benjami a bano, awu nǝ ɗārǝi ɓǝ̀ duk múrû mala aɓwana mem amǝ Isǝrayila. Nǝ̀ amsǝ aɓwana mem a bù amǝ'Filisti. Acemǝnana ǝn sǝnǝna tanni mala aɓwana mem, sǝ ɓua malea bwalǝna banam.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Lang Samuyila sǝn Sawul ka, Yahweh banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwa mǝnana ǝn nô ce ka ndya ka! Yi nda ɓwa mǝnana nǝ̀ yálmúr aɓwana mem ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Pǝlǝa Sawul gbàshìban Samuyila a tsùrú mala bankutio a nggea-là sǝ na ama, &lt;&lt;Ida banggam, ake sǝ ɓala mala mǝ'sǝna pa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samuyila earî wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nda mǝ'sǝnê. Fa aɓadǝmbam a ban-mǝdāhre. Wun kǝm ngga, wun nǝ̀ lìli atàm yalung, sǝ lí nǝ dǝmbari ka, mǝ nǝ nying wun, wun nǝ̀ o, sǝ gìr mǝnana kat a ɓabumo ka, mǝ nǝ nô. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Sǝ amur cau mala amǝdambǝriso mò mǝnana à ɓwaro nongŋo tàrú mǝnana à kùtí ka, kǝa tsǝk ɓalǝo arǝia ɗàng, acemǝnana à kumǝnia. Sǝ yana nda ɓwe mǝnana Isǝrayila kat earkiyice kǝ̀rkǝ́r ka? A nda andǝ ɓala mala tárró kat re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Sawul pa eare ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nda ɓwa'Benjami, aɓa rítǎu mala atau mala Isǝrayila re? Sǝ nggurkwar mem ngga nda mǝkyauwe aɓalǝ anggurkwar mala tàu mala Benjami re? Sǝ palang sǝ a nam cau ani?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila warinǝ Sawul andǝ lagga male a ndà-ramba sǝ kya tsǝia à do a ban mǝɓoarne aɓalǝ aɓwana mǝnana à tunǝia, mǝnana làkkì malea na kǝla lumi-tàrú ka. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Sǝ Samuyila banggi mǝlamli ama, &lt;&lt;Yinǝàm nǝ kāmbe nyama mǝnana ǝn pô, mǝnana ǝn banggo nǝma wu tsǝi ɗàng ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Nda mǝlamli twal byal nyama andǝ gir mǝnana amurí ka, sǝ tamsǝi a ɓadǝm Sawul. Sǝ Samuyila bang ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝnì, gìr mǝnana à tsǝì ka, nda à tamsǝo wi a ɓadǝmbo ka. Lì, acemǝnana à tsǝì aceo ace pwari mǝnia ka, twal a pwari mǝnana ǝn bang nǝma, &lt;Mǝ ndanǝ abǝri mǝnana ǝn tunǝia ka.&gt; &gt;&gt; Nda Sawul lìli atà Samuyila a pwari mǝno ka. <verse eid="1SA 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Sǝ lang à sùlǝ́nì ban-mǝdāhre sǝ à yina a nggea-là ka, à sárǝì Sawul kal-nongŋo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">à sárǝì Sawul kal-nongŋo;</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ɓè gilǝe nǝ kún Ibǝru bang ama </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nacau nǝ Sawul. </char></note> a múr-kurǝm,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">múr-kurǝm </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 22:8">Nggur 22:8</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 11:2">2Sam 11:2</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 16:22">16:22</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 8:16">Nehe 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:17">Mat 24:17</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:9">Atúró 10:9</ref></char>.</note> sǝ sarǝa nǝ̀ nong'ntullo. <verse eid="1SA 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Sǝ à lo ɗiɗyal, sǝ lang ban fana ka, Samuyila tunǝ Sawul a múr-kurǝm ama, &lt;&lt;Lo, ɓǝn pusǝbǝrio.&gt;&gt; Nda Sawul lo, sǝ yia kǝm, yì andǝ Samuyila ka, à pur amur njarɓala. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Lang à nda aban sulǝo à nǝ̀ ká a nzǝm-la ka, Samuyila banggi Sawul ama ɓǝ̀ banggi lagga male ɓǝ̀ kutio ɓǝ̀ fa a dǝmba. Sǝ lang kutina ka, Samuyila bang ama, &lt;&lt;Cam kani bǝti, ace mǝnana ɓǝn banggo cau mǝnana Ɓakuli bang ngga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="s">À ɗārǝ́ Sawul duk murǝm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila twal du mùrú sǝ solǝi a ɓamur Sawul, kùrrì zǝp sǝ banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Yahweh ɗārǝo wu duk yalu amur aɓwana male Isǝrayila re? <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Lang a nying banam yalung ngga, awu nǝ nggá je wunǝ aburana ɓari a ban ɓembe mala Rahila aɓa bù-nzali Benjami a Zelza; sǝ à nǝ̀ nô ama, &lt;Amǝdambǝriso mǝnana a wari altea ka, à kumǝnia, sǝ ado ka, cau mala amǝdambǝriso na tárró nakiyice ɗǝm ngga ɗàng, a nda mǝnana bumi kǝ pi aceo, kǝ na ama, &lt;&lt;Mana mǝ nǝ pa ace munem le ka?&gt;&gt; &gt; <verse eid="1SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Pǝlǝa awu nǝ lo a ban mǝno ka, awu nǝ lidǝmba aban ká sheɓǝ̀ a yina aban nggun mǝgule mala Tabo ka. Aɓwana tàrú mǝnana à nda njar aban ká [pà gir'nkila] aban Ɓakuli a Betel ka, à nǝ̀ kumǒ abanì, mwashat ka ndanǝ amuna-mbùl tàrú a buì, ɓè ka, ndanǝ agbatali bǝredi tàrú a buì, sǝ ɓè ka, ndanǝ bàng mùr-anap a buì. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />À nǝ makkòkun sǝ à nǝ po gbatali bǝredi ɓari, mǝnana awu nǝ e a buia ka. <verse eid="1SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />Anzǝm mǝno ka, awu nǝ ká a mǝ'nkono mala Ɓakuli a Gibiya, ban mǝnana ɓè kàttì mala amǝ'lwa mala amǝ'Filisti nakam ngga. Kutio mô aɓa nggea-là ka, awu nǝ je wunǝ nggǝsan mala amǝ'ɓangnǝa aban súlǝì ban-mǝdāhre, nǝ amǝ'walki azangŋan, andǝ akarata-bu, andǝ adànà, andǝ amǝ'twanggi ankori aɓadǝmbia; sǝ à nǝ̀ nggǝ naki acau ɓangnǝa. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Pǝlǝa Bangŋo mala Yahweh nǝ̀ sulǝ amuro nǝ rǝcandǝa, sǝ awu nǝ nacau ɓangnǝa ateà, sǝ awu nǝ pǝlǝ ɓè ɓwa ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Lang amǝnia yì agir-lǝmdǝa yi kumǒ ka, pàk gìr mǝnana buo kumo nǝ̀ pàk ka, acemǝnana Ɓakuli na atò. <verse eid="1SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />Pǝlǝa awu nǝ akàmdǝmba ká a Gilgal. Sǝ sǝni, mǝ ndo mǝ nǝ sulǝ aban ká a bano ace pa agir'nkila mala pisǝe kǝring andǝ apagir mala dotarǝu ka. Awu nǝ twal anongŋo tongno-nong-ɓari aban kúndǝô, she ɓǝn yina a bano sǝ ǝn nano gìr mǝnana awu nǝ pàk ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Lang Sawul pǝlǝna nzǝmi nǝ̀ nying Samuyila ka, Ɓakuli pe wi, yì Sawul ɓè ɓabum. Sǝ amǝnia yì agir-lǝmdǝa ka, à yi lumsǝ kat a pwari mǝno. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Lang Sawul andǝ guro male yi bwalǝna Gibiya ka, kara nggǝsan mala amǝ'ɓangnǝa yi kumi, sǝ Bangŋo mala Ɓakuli sulǝ amurí nǝ rǝcandǝa, sǝ nacau ɓangnǝ aɓalǝia. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Sǝ lang aɓwana mǝnana à súrǝì ɗiɗyal, sǝni aban nacau ɓangnǝa aɓalǝ amǝ'ɓangnǝa ka, à ɗiki rǝia ama, &lt;&lt;Mana pur arǝ muna-ɓwabura mala Kish? Sawul gbal ka nda aɓalǝ amǝ'ɓangnǝa le?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Sǝ ɓè ɓwabura mǝnana ndanǝdo abanì ka bang ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝ yana nda tárrià?&gt;&gt; Nda pǝlǝ caubangŋa ama, &lt;&lt;Sawul ka nda aɓalǝ amǝ'ɓangnǝa gbal le?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Lang malǝna nacau ɓangnǝa ka, sǝ wari a ban-mǝdāhre.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Kina Sawul ɗì andǝ lagga male ama, &lt;&lt;A ke sǝ wu wario?&gt;&gt; Sǝ bang ama, &lt;&lt;A ban alta amǝdambǝriso. Sǝ lang sǝm kumia raka, sǝm wari aban Samuyila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Pǝlǝa kina Sawul banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, wu banggam cau mǝnana Samuyila bangga wun ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Sǝ Sawul banggi kine ama, &lt;&lt;Bangga sǝm bwāng ama amǝdambǝriso ka, à kumǝnia.&gt;&gt; Sǝama amur cau mala domurǝm mǝnana Samuyila bang cè ka, banggi wi kǝ cau ɗàng.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">À hamnǝ cè duk murǝm mala Sawul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />A bàkú mǝno ka, Samuyila tunǝ aɓwe abanɓwáná aban Yahweh a Mizǝpa. <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />Sǝ banggia amǝ Isǝrayila ama, &lt;&lt;Yahweh, Ɓakuli mala amǝ Isǝrayila bang ama, &lt;Ən pusǝ wun Isǝrayila wu purî ɓá Masar, sǝ ǝn amsǝ wun a ɓabu amǝ'Masar sǝ a bu adomurǝm mǝnana kat à kǝ par wun aɓatea ka.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Sǝama yalung ngga wu ginǝkina Ɓakuli ma'wun, mǝnana amsǝyi wun aɓalǝ agir'mur'mwana ma'wun andǝ agir'zunggǝliban ma'wun, sǝ wu bangŋǝ́nì wi ama, &lt;Tsǝka sǝm murǝm amúr sǝm.&gt; Acemani ado ka, wu lǝmdǝ rǝwun aɓadǝm Yahweh arǝ atau ma'wun, sǝ arǝ anggurkwar ma'wun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila yinǝ atau mala Isǝrayila tù, sǝ à twal tau mala Benjami nǝ bwal-shishar. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Sǝ yinǝ tau mala Benjami tù arǝ anggurkwar male, sǝ à twal nggurkwar mala Matǝri nǝ bwal-shishar, sǝ à twal Sawul, muna-ɓwabura mala Kish nǝ bwal-shishar. Sǝ lang à sǝnbani ka, à kumi ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Sǝ à ɗì Yahweh ɗǝm ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝɓwa na kam piu nǝ̀ yiu le?&gt;&gt; Sǝ Yahweh bang ama, &lt;&lt;Wu sǝni, nda sǝmbǝrǝ ɓamurì aɓalǝ atwalo ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Pǝlǝa à ɓangŋa à twali a banì. Sǝ lang cam aɓalǝ aɓwe ka, dāh'rya-kuti koyan kat aɓalǝ aɓwe, twal a nkpamtari aban o a kuli. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Sǝ Samuyila banggi aɓwe kat ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwa mǝnana Yahweh twalo ɓǝ̀ duk murǝm amur wun ngga ndya ka. Aɓalǝ aɓwe kat ka, kǝ ɓwa pà kǝla yì ɗàng.&gt;&gt; Sǝ aɓwe kat loasǝ gia ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ yilǝmi murǝm sauwa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila bǝli aɓwe agir mǝnana gulo-murǝm nǝ̀ tsǝia púp ɓǝà pè, andǝ amǝnana twàló na amúr murǝm nǝ̀ pè ka. Gilǝia aɓa nggú-gilǝgir sǝ nongsǝi aɓadǝm Yahweh. Pǝlǝa Samuyila mesǝ aɓwe ɓǝà o arǝ aɓala malea. <verse eid="1SA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Sawul gbal ka, o a là male a Gibiya, sǝ akanggǝrang aburana mǝnana Ɓakuli je ɓabumia ka, à o atè. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Sǝama aɓea aɓwana mǝɓane bang ama, &lt;&lt;Làng sǝ ɓwa man nǝ̀ gandǝ amsǝ sǝm?&gt;&gt; À nyesǝce-ɓà, sǝ à ginǝ yinǝì nǝ kǝ ɓoro. Sǝama yi ka, kùr yinggǝli.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Sawul lì amǝ'Amon a lwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Nahash, ɓwa'Amon eauwe sǝ kya gumbǝli Jabesh-Gilǝyat, sǝ aburana mala amǝ Jabesh kat ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Kùrcau nǝ sǝm sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ do aɓato.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Pǝlǝa Nahash ɓwa'Amon ear ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ kùrcau nǝ wun amur cau mwashat, ama mǝ nǝ pusǝki amǝsǝ wun mǝli kat, sǝ anggo ka, nǝ̀ yinǝ kirsakya amur Isǝrayila kat.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Aɓwana-mǝgule mala amǝ Jabesh ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Nyingga sǝm anongŋo tongno-nong-ɓari ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân arǝ alá mala amǝ Isǝrayila kat. Ɓǝ̀ kǝɓwa pà kàm nǝ̀ amsǝ sǝm raka, sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ pà ɓamur rǝ sǝm aɓato.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Lang amǝ'na-túrbân bwalna Gibiya là mala Sawul ka, à kya ne aɓwana cê à kiria, sǝ yia kat ka, à túr kunia a ɓua.<verse eid="1SA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Kara à sǝn Sawul kǝ nyarî ɓaban aban gya atà andá-rya. Sǝ Sawul ɗiban ama, &lt;&lt;Mana kum aɓwe sǝ à kǝ ɓua?&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa à ne wi cau mala aburana mala amǝ Jabesh. <verse eid="1SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Lang Sawul okcau malea ka, kara Bangŋo mala Ɓakuli sulǝ amurí nǝ rǝcandǝa, sǝ bumlulla male earki-bǝsa kǝ̀rkǝ́r. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Twal andá-rya ɓari, kasǝkia nyak-nyak sǝ turaban nǝia aɓa nzong-nzali Isǝrayila ɗǝɗak nǝ bù amǝ'na-túrbân ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwa mǝnana kat puro yiu atà Sawul andǝ Samuyila raka, anggo sǝ à nǝ̀ pàkkî andá-rya male.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa ɓangciu mala Yahweh bwal amǝ Isǝrayila, sǝ à puro kǝla ɓwa mwashat. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Lang Sawul rambia a Bezek ka, làkkì mala amǝ Isǝrayila na á-gbǝman-tàrú (300,000) sǝ amǝ Yahuda ka à nda á-lumi-tàrú (30,000.) <verse eid="1SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Sǝ à ne amǝ'na-túrbân mana à yiu ka ama, &lt;&lt;Ani sǝ wun nǝ̀ ne amǝ Jabesh-Gilǝyat: &lt;Li ɓǝ̀ pwari zǝkina ka, wun nǝ̀ kum amsǝban ma'wun.&gt; &gt;&gt; Lang amǝ'na-túrbân yiu sǝ à banggi aburana mala Jabesh ka, banɓoaria wia. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Acemani ka, aburana mala Jabesh banggi Nahash ama, &lt;&lt;Li ka, sǝm nǝ̀ pur aban wun, sǝ wun nǝ̀ gandǝ pakka sǝm gìr mǝnana kat wu sǝni nda ɓoara wun ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Sǝ lang ban fana ka, Sawul gau aɓwe arǝ anggǝsan tàrú; sǝ à yi ar aɓa tsùrú mala kàttì mala amǝ'Amon nǝ ban mbul-mbul, sǝ à camarǝ wal amǝ'Amon ba zǝkya mala pwari. Aɓwana mǝnana à au ka à mesǝkì tàrǝia, yale à kum aɓwana ɓari atārǝia ɗàng.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Pǝlǝa aburana mala amǝ Isǝrayila ne Samuyila ama, &lt;&lt;Ya ɓwe na bang ama &lt;Sawul nǝ̀ duk murǝm amur sǝm le ka?&gt; Wu yinǝ aɓwe, ɓǝ̀ sǝm wal-luia.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Sǝama Sawul bang ama, &lt;&lt;À pà nǝ̀ wal-lú kǝɓwa a pwari mǝnia ka ɗàng, acemǝnana yalung ngga, Yahweh yina nǝ amsǝban a Isǝrayila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila ne aɓwana ama, &lt;&lt;Wu yiu, sǝm nǝ̀ o a Gilgal, sǝm nǝ̀ nggá basǝ domurǝm kano.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Osso aɓwe kat wari a Gilgal, akano sǝ à dumsǝ Sawul à murǝm aɓadǝm Yahweh a Gilgal. Akano sǝ à pà gir'nkila mala dorǝpwala aɓadǝm Yahweh, sǝ akano sǝ Sawul andǝ aburana mala amǝ Isǝrayila kat pàk-banɓoarnado kǝ̀rkǝ́r.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Nacau tsǝkban-andà mala Samuyila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila banggi Isǝrayila kat ama, &lt;&lt;Wu sǝni, ǝn kpanata gì wun aɓalǝ agir mǝnana kat wu nam ngga, sǝ ǝn tsǝ́ngŋǝ̀nà wun murǝm amur wun. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Sǝ adyan ngga, wu ndanǝ murǝm, mǝnana nda mǝdǝmba ma'wun ngga. Sǝ mim adyan ngga, ǝn ena, nǝ mbù amuram; sǝ amuna-burana mem ngga, á nda atà wun. Mim ngga, ǝn duk mǝdǝmba ma'wun, twal a lo-ɓwa mem, ba yalung.<verse eid="1SA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />&lt;&lt;Mǝ ndya ǝn cam ngga, wu nakun amuram aɓadǝm Yahweh sǝ ɓadǝm ɓwa male mana twali nda murǝm ngga. Jamnda mala yani ǝn twali? Ko mǝdambǝriso mala yani na, mana ǝn twali ka? Ko yana, mǝnana ǝn ɓǝmbǝri ka? Sǝ yana, mǝnana ǝn pari ka? Ko a bù yan sǝ ǝn ak pàbunǝnzali, mana gìrki amǝsǝam ngga? Ɓǝ̀ ndakam ama ǝn pak mwashat atà agir mǝnia ka, mǝ nǝ nyesǝa wuni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Pǝlǝa aɓwe pa eare ama, &lt;&lt;Awo, a ɓǝmbǝri ma, ko a par ma sǝm, ko a ak ma kǝgir a bù kǝɓwa ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Yahweh ka, nda mǝ'nakún amur gir mǝnana wu pàk ka; anggo gbal, murǝm mǝnana Yahweh twal ka, dumǝna mǝ'nakún yalung, ama, wu kum ɓè kǝgir a buam ɗàng.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa à ear ama, &lt;&lt;Yahweh nda mǝ'nakún.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila banggi aɓwe ama, &lt;&lt;Yahweh nda mǝnana twal Musa andǝ Haruna, sǝ pusǝ aká wun à purî ɓá nzali Masar ka. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Acemani ka, wu cam piu, sǝ mǝ nǝ kútí a ɓashi sǝnǝa wun aɓadǝm Yahweh, amur ɓealɓoarna mala Yahweh mǝnana pàkka wunia, sǝ pàkkî aká wun ngga. <verse eid="1SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />Lang Yakupu wari a Masar, sǝ aká wun wari nǝ ɓua malea aban Yahweh ka, Yahweh tasǝ Musa andǝ Haruna, mǝnana à pusǝ aká wun à purî ɓá Masar, sǝ tsǝia à yi do a mǝnia yì ban ngga.<verse eid="1SA 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />&lt;&lt;Sǝama, à lorǝ Yahweh, Ɓakuli malea; nda sǝ Yahweh mea a ɓabu Sǝsera,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 4:1-2">Akas 4:1-2</ref></char>.</note> yì mǝ'sàrǝ̀ban amur amǝ'lwa mala Hazo, sǝ a ɓabu amǝ'Filisti, sǝ a ɓabu murǝm mala Mowap. Sǝ à munǝ-munǝo arǝia. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Pǝlǝa à ɓua aban Yahweh, aban na ama, &lt;Sǝm pàngŋǝ̀nà cauɓikea acemǝnana sǝm nying Yahweh, sǝm kpanata aBa'al andǝ Ashtarot ka. Sǝama adyan ngga, amsǝ sǝm a bù aɓisǝm amǝbura, sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ kpato.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Pǝlǝa Yahweh tasǝ Jerub-ba'al, andǝ Barak, andǝ Jefta andǝ Samuyila, sǝ amsǝ wun, ak wun a ɓabu aɓiwun amǝbura mana à do, à kàrì wun a ɓalǝu ka; nda gìr mǝnana tsǝa sǝ wu duk jam ngga.<verse eid="1SA 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />&lt;&lt;Sǝ lang wu sǝn Nahash, murǝm mala amǝ'Amon, nǝ̀ nggǝ yiu nǝ munǝo arǝ wun ngga, nda wu banggam ama, &lt;Awo, sǝm nggǝ earce murǝm ɓǝ̀ yálmúr sǝm,&gt; kat andǝ amani ama, Yahweh Ɓakuli ma'wun, nda murǝm ma'wun ngga. <verse eid="1SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />Sǝ adyan ngga, murǝm ma'wun mana wu twal ka, ndya ka, yì mana wu zǝmbace ka. Wu sǝni, Yahweh ka, tsǝ̀ngŋǝ̀nà murǝm amur wun. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Ɓǝ̀ wun nǝ̀ ɓanggi Yahweh, sǝ wun nǝ̀ kpate, wun nǝ̀ oki wi, sǝ pà wu nǝ̀ mgbicau arǝ nzongcau mala Yahweh raka, ɓǝ̀ wun sǝ murǝm mana yálkiyi múr wun, wunia kat, wun nǝ̀ kpata Yahweh, Ɓakuli ma'wun ngga, gir mǝɓoarne na! <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Sǝama, ɓǝ̀ pa wun nǝ̀ okî Yahweh ɗàng, gandǝa wun nǝ̀ mgbicau, pà wun nǝ̀ kpata anzongcau mala Yahweh raka, bù Yahweh nǝ̀ pǝlǝa arǝ wun, kǝla mana buì pǝlǝa arǝ aká wun ngga.<verse eid="1SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />&lt;&lt;Ado ka, wu cam piu, wu sǝn mǝnia yì gìr mǝgule, mǝnana Yahweh nǝ̀ pè a ɓamǝsǝ wun ngga! <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Kún pwan mǝssa-alkama na ado re? Mǝ nǝ nacau nǝ Yahweh, ɓǝ̀ tasǝ sàkkya mala mgbarangce andǝ mbulo. Sǝ wun nǝ̀ sǝlǝa, wun nǝ̀ sǝni ama ɓealɓikea ma'wun mǝnana wu pè a mǝsǝ Yahweh, nǝ zǝmba ama ɓǝ̀ pa wun murǝm ngga, mǝgule na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila zǝmbi Yahweh, sǝ a kǝ pwari mǝno ka, Yahweh tasǝ sàkkya mala mgbarangce andǝ mbulo. Nda aɓwana kat ɓanggi Yahweh andǝ Samuyila kǝ̀rkǝ́r ka.<verse eid="1SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Pǝlǝa aɓwana kat banggi Samuyila ama, &lt;&lt;Pakhiwi aban Yahweh, Ɓakuli mò, ace aguro mò, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm nggá wu ɗàng; sǝm tsǝ̀ngŋǝ̀nà ɓè cauɓikea amur amǝnana sǝm peǎ ka, nǝ zǝmbace murǝm ace ɓamur rǝ sǝm.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Sǝ Samuyila ear ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓangciu ɓǝ̀ kǝa pakka wun ɗàng. Mǝsǝcau na ama wu pàngŋǝ̀nà mǝnia yì ɓealɓikea kat ka; sǝama, wu kǝa pǝlǝ nzǝm wun arǝ Yahweh ɗàng, wu kpate nǝ ɓabum wun kat. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Wu kǝa nyar aban kpata <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 16:19">Ir 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:18">Hab 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 8:4">1Kor 8:4</ref></char>.</note>agirɓana mǝnana à pà nǝ̀ pusǝ wun, ko à nǝ̀ amsǝ wun raka ɗàng, acemǝnana à nda ɓà. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Yahweh ka, pà nǝ̀ túr nzǝm aɓwana male ɗàng, atàcau mala lùllǝì mǝgule. Acemǝnana Yahweh ka, bumi kǝ pwasǝ arǝ nyesǝ wun, ɓǝ̀ wu duk aɓwana male. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Amur mǝno ka, ɓǝ̀ sappi banam, mǝnana ama mǝ nǝ pàkkî Yahweh cauɓikea nǝ tamsǝ pakhiwi ace wun ngga. Sǝama, mǝ nǝ nggǝ kània wun njar mǝnana ɓoaro, sǝ nda pepè ka. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Sǝ a dǝmba nǝ koman kat ka, wu ɓanggi Yahweh, sǝ wu kpate nǝ ɓabum wun mwashat andǝ mǝsǝcau. Wu ɗenyinǝ agir mǝgulke mǝnana peǎ ace wun ngga.<verse eid="1SA 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />&lt;&lt;Sǝama, ɓǝ̀ wu lidǝmba nǝ pak ɓealɓikea ka, wun, wunǝa murǝm ma'wun ngga, wun nǝ̀ kìɗikì.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Amǝ'Isǝrayila munǝ andǝ amǝ'Filisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Sawul ndanǝ apǝlǝa lumi-tàrú lang duk murǝm ngga, sǝ yálmúr amǝ'Isǝrayila mala apǝlǝa lumi-ine-nong-ɓari. <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Sawul tàr aburana á-tàrú (3,000) mala Isǝrayila; á-ɓari (2,000) aɓalǝia ka, à nda atè a Mikmash andǝ nzali múr ankono mala Betel, sǝ á-mwashat ka, à nda atà Jonatan a Gibiya, a bù-nzali mala Benjami. Sǝ acili aɓwe (1,000) ka, nyesǝia ɓǝà o a là, koyan ngga a ɓala male.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Jonatan gandǝ kàttì<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">gandǝ kàttì </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wal-lú mǝ'sàrǝ̀ban</char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 10:5">1Sam 10:5</ref></char>.</note> mala amǝ'lwa mala amǝ'Filisti mǝnana a Geba ka, sǝ amǝ'Filisti ok cè. Pǝlǝa Sawul twang njawe aɓa nzali kat ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ amǝ'Ibǝru ǒ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Sǝ Isǝrayila kat oè à bangŋi ama Sawul gandǝna kàttì mala amǝ'Filisti, sǝ ɗǝm ngga ama Isǝrayila pǝlǝna gìr mǝnana à nǝ̀ ɓinǝì ka aban amǝ'Filisti. Nda aɓwana ok tunǝbanì sǝ à puro à kya kpapi ɓamuria atà Sawul a Gilgal ka.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Amǝ'Filisti ram rǝia ace kánǝ munǝo arǝ amǝ'Isǝrayila; à ndanǝ awaru-pǝr á-lumi-tàrú (30,000), amǝ'pǝ̀r á-tongno-nong-mwashat (6,000), sǝ anggǝsan mala amǝ'lwa mǝ'làkke kǝla lakkì mala mǝsǝsala a kún nggeamùr. À eauwe sǝ à yi tsǝk kàttì malea a Mikmash nǝ takuli mala Bet-Aven <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Lang amǝ Isǝrayila sǝni ama tanni na amúrià, sǝ amǝ'lwa malea na aɓa nggikiban mǝcandǝe ka, à kya sǝmbǝrǝki rǝia aɓalǝ agumi andǝ akarwan, andǝ ɓong ankono, andǝ ɓalǝ afouroban a tà-nzali, andǝ ɓalǝ a'imna tūli-mùr. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Aɓea aɓwana atà amǝ'Ibǝru ka, à yàl a nkaring Nggeasala Jodan aban ká bu-nzali mala Gad andǝ Gilǝyat. Sǝ Sawul ka nda piu a Gilgal; amǝ'lwa puppup mǝnana atè ka, rǝia kǝ ɓǝla nǝ ɓangciu.<verse eid="1SA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Sawul twal anongŋo tongno-nong-ɓari, ndaban kúndǝô a Gilgal, kǝla mǝnana Samuyila tsǝki wi ka, sǝ Samuyila yiu ɗàng. Aɓwana tita mesǝ arǝ Sawul. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Nda Sawul bang ama, &lt;&lt;Wu yinǝam nǝ pàgir mala pisǝe kǝring andǝ apagir mala dotarǝu.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa Sawul pà gir'nkila mala pisǝe kǝring. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Sǝ lang Sawul nǝ̀ mal pà gir'nkila mala pisǝe kǝring ani ka, kara Samuyila yi tusǝo. Sawul puro wario nǝ nggá kumi sǝ nǝ̀ gingsǝi. <verse eid="1SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Sǝ Samuyila ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Mana a pa?&gt;&gt; Sawul eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Lang ǝn sǝni aɓwe na arǝ mǝsǝ arǝàm, sǝ a yiu aɓalǝ anonggio mǝnana a tsǝa ama awu nǝ yiu nǝi raka, sǝ ɗǝm ngga amǝ'Filisti ramǝna rǝia a Mikmash ka, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />nda ǝn bang nǝma, &lt;Amǝ'Filisti na à nǝ̀ sulǝ aban yiu arǝàm nǝ munǝo kani a Gilgal, sǝ ǝn malaká zǝm earmúrú aban Yahweh ɗàng.&gt; Acemani ka, ǝn tsǝk ɓamúràm púp ǝn pà gir'nkila mala pisǝe kǝring.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Samuyila banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;A pángŋǝ̀nà ɓwaɓana. A kpata nzongcau mǝnana Yahweh Ɓakuli mô tsǝko ka ɗàng. Ɓǝ̀ a kpanatà nzongcau mala Yahweh mǝni ka, ɓǝ́ Yahweh nǝ̀ tamsǝkusǝ domurǝm mò amur Isǝrayila tàtǝ́k!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 15:11">1Sam 15:11</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Sǝama adyan ngga, domurǝm mò pà nǝ̀ lidǝmba ɗàng. Yahweh alǝnata ɓwa mǝnana ndanǝ ulang ɓabum male ka, sǝ tsǝ̀ngŋǝ́nì wi nzongcau ɓǝ̀ yálmúr aɓwana male, acemǝnana a kpata nzongcau mala Yahweh ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:22">Atúró 13:22</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila loapi Gilgal ka, wari a Gibiya a bu-nzali Benjami, sǝ acili aɓwana ka, à o atà Sawul ace kpapi ɓamuria andǝ amǝ'lwa. À loapi Gilgal ka, à wari a Gibiya a bu-nzali Benjami. Pǝlǝa Sawul ram aɓwana mǝnana à nda atè piu ka, sǝ ɓallia. Làkkì malea na kǝla gbǝman-tongno-nong-mwashat. <verse eid="1SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Sawul, andǝ muna-ɓwabura male Jonatan, andǝ amǝ'lwa mǝnana à nda atè ka, à ue a Geba a bu-nzali mala Benjami; sǝ amǝ'Filisti ka à tsǝk kàttì malea a Mikmash. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Pǝlǝa amǝ'tǝllìban purì ɓá kàttì mala amǝ'Filisti arǝ anggǝsan tàrú. Nggǝsan mwashat ka, pǝlǝ nǝ Ofǝra, aban ká a bu-nzali Shuwal; <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />ɓè nggǝsan dǝshi Bet-Horon; sǝ ɓè nggǝsan ngga pǝlǝ nǝ nzong-nzali mǝnana kǝ sǝn ɓamǝsǝarǝia andǝ Ɓangŋaban mala Zeboyim andǝ ɓabondo ka.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />A bàkú mǝno ka, à kum kǝ mǝ'ntùl aɓa nzali Isǝrayila kat ɗàng, acemǝnana amǝ'Filisti bangŋǝna ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ ana raka amǝ'Ibǝru nǝ̀ pàkkî ɓamuria anggeabyau andǝ ankongŋo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Nda koyan a Isǝrayila ka kǝ wari aban amǝ'Filisti ace kolǝ kún soro-gwam-nzali, andǝ adá, andǝ bero, andǝ nshiri male. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />À mbwe gauwe ɓari aɓa tàrú mala shekel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">gauwe ɓari aɓa tàrú mala shekel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko mǝsǝ bolo-azǝrfa ɓari.</char></note> ace kolǝ kún asoro-gwam-nzali, andǝa adá, sǝ à mbwe mwashat aɓa gauwe tàrú mala shekel ace kolǝ kún abero, andǝ kún agir pǝ̀r anda-rya. <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Acemani ka, a pwari mala munǝo ka, à kum nggeabyau andǝ nzo a bú kǝɓwa aɓalǝ amǝ'lwa mǝnana à nda atà Sawul andǝ Jonatan ngga ɗàng; sǝama Sawul andǝ muna-ɓwabura male Jonatan ngga, à ndanǝia. <verse eid="1SA 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Amǝ'Filisti tasǝ ɓè nggǝsan mala amǝ'lwa malea ace yál njar nre ka ankono mala Mikmash.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Jonatan gandǝ amǝ'Filisti nǝ munǝo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Ɓè pwari ka Jonatan, muna-ɓwabura mala Sawul banggi mǝ-bwali-wi agirmunǝo male ama, &lt;&lt;Yiu ɓǝ̀ sǝm yàl aban ká a kàttì mala amǝ'Filisti mǝnana a nkaring ngga.&gt;&gt; Sǝama yì ka ne tárrí ɗàng.<verse eid="1SA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Sawul ka, nda a gumli male a tǝrta nggun mɓǝring a Migǝron, anzǝm là Gibiya. Amǝ'lwa mǝnana à nda atè ka, à nda kǝla ɓwa gbǝman-tongno-nong-mwashat (600). <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Ahija muna-ɓwabura mala Ahitup, mǝ'eam Ikabod, muna-ɓwabura mala Finehas, mǝkà Eli, yì pǝris mala Yahweh a Shilo ka, ndakam ateà nǝ efot, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a buì </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">arǝì</char></note>a buì. Aɓwana sǝlǝ ama Jonatan umǝna ɗàng.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Nreban mǝnana Jonatan nǝ kùtí kam aban ká a kàttì mala amǝ'Filisti ka, atali mǝ'dāh'rike nakam a koya nkanggari. Ɓè talî ka, à tunǝi ama Bozez, sǝ ɓè man ngga à tunǝi ama Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Tali mǝ'dāhre mana nǝ njar-nza ka, nda aɓadǝm Mikmash, sǝ mǝnana nǝ njar-kunmur ka, nda aɓadǝm Geba.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Jonatan banggi mǝ-bwali-wi agirmunǝo male ama, &lt;&lt;Yiu, ɓǝ̀ sǝm yàl aban ká a kàttì mala amǝ'ɗwanyi-kasǝ-ɓatau man. Earka Yahweh nǝ̀ pàktúró ace sǝm; kǝgir pà kàm nǝ̀ tamsǝ Yahweh arǝ amsǝban, ko nǝ aɓwana pas ko nǝ aɓwana kpokyak ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Mǝ-bwali-wi agirmunǝo male ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Pàk gìr mǝnana nda a ɓabumo ka. Kyane, sǝ sǝni, mǝ nda atò, kǝla mǝnana ɓabumo twali ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Jonatan banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, sǝm nǝ̀ yàlé ace ká a ban amǝ'Filisti, sǝ sǝm nǝ̀ pusǝ rǝ sǝm ɓǝà sǝn sǝm. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Ɓǝ̀ à bangga sǝm ama, &lt;Wu kúndǝô sheɓǝ̀ sǝm yina aban wun ngga,&gt; pǝlǝa sǝm nǝ̀ cam pikǝr abanì, pà sǝm nǝ̀ ká abania ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Sǝama ɓǝ̀ à bangga sǝm ama, &lt;Wu yiu aban sǝm ngga,&gt; pǝlǝa sǝm nǝ̀ ká, acemǝnana Yahweh pània a ɓabù sǝm. Mǝno ka nda gìr'lǝmdǝa aban sǝm ama Yahweh pània a ɓabù sǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Lang à lǝmdǝ ɓamuria yià kǝm aban amǝ'lwa a kàttì mala amǝ'Filisti ka, amǝ'Filisti bang ama, &lt;&lt;Wu sǝni, amǝ'Ibǝru nako à kǝ purki aɓalǝ atūli mǝnana à sǝmbǝrǝki kam ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Pǝlǝa à tunǝ Jonatan andǝ mǝ-bwali-wi agirmunǝo ama, &lt;&lt;Wu yiu kani, sǝm nǝ̀ lǝmdǝa wun gìr arǝ wun.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa Jonatan ne mǝ-bwali-wi agirmunǝo ama, &lt;&lt;Yiu atàm. Yahweh túrnia a ɓabù Isǝrayila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Pǝlǝa Jonatan kundǝkio amur abui andǝ akusǝi, eau aban ká aban amǝ'Filisti, sǝ mǝ-bwali-wi agirmunǝo ka nda atè. Jonatan wal-lú amǝ'Filisti mǝnana à nda aɓadǝmbi ka, sǝ mǝ-bwali-wi agirmunǝo gbal ka, wal-lú amana àkǝ yiu nǝ nzǝmia ka. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Aɓa je-munǝo mǝdǝmbe man ngga, Jonatan andǝ mǝ-bwali-wi agirmunǝo wal-lú aburana kǝla lumi-ɓari, a patal mǝnana tangŋa male na kǝla mita lumi-ɓari ka.<verse eid="1SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Sǝ ɓangciu bwal amǝ'Filisti mǝnana kat à nda a kàttì ka, andǝ amǝnana à nda a patal ka, andǝ amǝ'lwa malea mǝnana kat à tamsǝia ace yalban ngga, andǝ anggǝsan mala amǝ'tǝllìban; rǝia ɓǝla atàcau mala ɓangciu, sǝ nzali gǝggǝli. Mǝnia yì ɓangciu ka pur nǝban Ɓakuli.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Amǝ'yalban mala Sawul a Gibiya, a bu-nzali Benjami soa-mǝsǝia, sǝ à sǝni ka, ɓwabundǝa mala amǝ'lwa mala amǝ'Filisti na aban mesǝki arǝ abuban ɗàngɗáng. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Pǝlǝa Sawul banggi aɓwana mǝnana à nda atè ka ama, &lt;&lt;Wu ɓal amǝ'lwa ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm súrǝ̀ ɓwa mǝnana pa kani raka.&gt;&gt; Lang à ɓalkiban ngga, Jonatan andǝ mǝ-bwali-wi agirmunǝo male ka à pà abanì ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Osso Sawul ne Ahija ama, &lt;&lt;Yinǝ Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli kani.&gt;&gt; A pwari mǝno ka, Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli ka, nda aban amǝ'Isǝrayila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">&lt;&lt;Yinǝ Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli kani.&gt;&gt; A pwari mǝno ka, Akwati Kùrcau mala Ɓakuli ka, nda aban amǝ'Isǝrayila. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Osso Sawul ne Ahija ama, &lt;&lt;Yinǝ efot, ace ɗibancau aban Ɓakuli amur gìr mǝnana sǝm nǝ̀ pàk.&gt;&gt; A pwari mǝno ka, Ahija oasǝna efot arǝì, sǝ nda aban came aɓadǝm amǝ'Isǝrayila. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Lang Sawul na aban nacau nǝ pǝris ka, zùrǝì mǝnana aɓa kàttì mala amǝ'Filisti ka lidǝmba arǝ gulkio. Nda Sawul ne pǝris ama, &lt;&lt;Nying buo.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">&lt;&lt;Nying buo.&gt;&gt; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko </char><char style="fq">&lt;&lt;Nying buo</char> arǝ efot (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 28:6-30">Pur 28:6-30</ref></char>.) Kǝa lidǝmba nǝ jeki amǝsǝtali-gǝna mǝnana arǝ efot, yì muna daura-múrɓì mǝfele mala Pǝris Mǝgule ka, ace súrǝ̀ nê mala Ɓakuli ɗàng.&gt;&gt; </note><verse eid="1SA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Pǝlǝa Sawul andǝ amǝ'lwa mǝnana kat à nda atè ka ramba abanɓwáná, sǝ à pur ace munǝo. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 7:22">Akas 7:22</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:23">2Acau 20:23</ref></char>.</note>À kya kum amǝ'Filisti aɓa zùrǝì mǝgule, aban wal-lú rǝarǝia nǝ anggeabyau malea. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Amǝ'Ibǝru mǝnana à sanna à o atà amǝ'Filisti a kàttì malea ɗiɗyal ka, à nyare à yi kpapi ɓamúrià atà amǝ'Isǝrayila mǝnana à nda atà Sawul andǝ Jonatan ngga. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Lang amǝ'Isǝrayila mǝnana à sǝmbǝrǝki rǝia aɓa nzali múr ankono mala Ifǝrem ok ama amǝ'Filisti ɓangŋǝna ka, yìa gbal ka à lo pǝrtea nǝ munǝo. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Nda Yahweh amsǝ Isǝrayila a pwari mǝno, sǝ munǝo mesǝe kya kútí aban ká dǝmba nǝ Bet-Aven ngga.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Amǝ'Isǝrayila kùtí aɓa gandǝrǝu a pwari mǝno ka, acemǝnana Sawul tsǝ̀ngŋǝ̀nà aɓwe aɓata kángìr ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ suban sulǝ amur ɓwa mǝnana lì girlina yalung bà pwarikpǝra ka, she ɓǝ̀n mbwena aɓiam-mǝbura akúnì ka.&gt;&gt;Acemani ka, kǝ ɓwa ateà tsǝk kǝ girlina a kúní ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Lang amǝ'lwa puppup yiu aɓa ɓè ndà-nggun ngga, à kum mur-nyi kàm arǝ abân amur nzali. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Sǝ lang à kùtí aɓalǝ anggunì ka, à sǝn mur-nyi aban surkio, sǝ kǝɓwa lǝmdǝ buì je ama nǝ̀ kánǝi a kúni ɗàng, acemǝnana aɓwana ɓanggi súbanì.<verse eid="1SA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Jonatan ngga, ok cau mala kángir mǝnana tárrí tsǝk aɓwana à kán ngga ɗàng. Acemani ka, lǝmdǝ kún gara male mana a buì ka, oasǝi aɓa ntòngŋò-nyì, ɗàrǝ́ mur-nyi sǝ lì. Anzǝm mana lìnì ka, kum bǝsa rǝcandǝa. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Pǝlǝa ɓeɓwa atà amǝ'lwa banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Tárró tsǝk amǝ'lwa à kángìr nǝ nggea kána mǝcandǝe ama, &lt;Ɓǝ̀ suban sulǝ amur ɓwa mǝnana lì girlina aɓa pwari man yalung ngga.&gt; Nda gìr mǝnana tsǝa sǝ amǝ'lwa yauwiki nǝ nzala ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Jonatan ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Tárrám tsǝ̀ngŋǝ̀nà aɓwana aɓa tanni. Ida, wu sǝn rǝcandǝa mǝno nyar arǝàm atàcau mala mur-nyi mǝnia bǝti ǝn oê a kunam ngga. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Ɓǝ́ gìrnî ɓoarna kutini man ɓǝ̀ amǝ'lwa lina gìr mǝnana nǝ̀ karǝia yalung aɓa girlina mana à kum aɓalǝ agǝna-lwa mala aɓia-mǝbura ka. Ɓǝ́ alú mǝnana à wal atà amǝ'Filisti ka kutini man.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />A pwari mǝno ka, amǝ'Isǝrayila wal amǝ'Filisti tite a Mikmash kya pur a Aijalon. Sǝ à yauwiki kǝ̀rkǝ́r nǝ nzala. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Nda amǝ'lwa fàkìfákya amúr gǝna-lwa, sǝ à bwalki anzur, andǝ andá, andǝ amuna-ndá, à pwangi-myalia akǝ banì sǝ à <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 3:17">Pǝris 3:17</ref></char>.</note>shak nyamia andǝapwale. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Pǝlǝa ɓeɓwa banggi Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, aɓwana nia à kǝ̀ pàkkî Yahweh cauɓikea nǝ shak nyama nǝ nkila arǝì ka.&gt;&gt; Sǝ Sawul na ama, &lt;&lt;Wun kat wu lǝmdǝna ɗwanyi domǝsǝcau; wu ɗǝnggǝliki tali mǝgule kani abanam.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Pǝlǝa nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu mesǝ aɓalǝ aɓwana, wu banggia wia ama, &lt;Koyan atà wun ngga, wu yinǝàmnǝ andá andǝ anzur ma'wun kani. Wu pwangi-myalia kani sǝ wu shea; sǝama wu kǝa pàkkî Yahweh cauɓikea nǝ shak nyama nǝ nkila arǝì ɗàng.&gt; &gt;&gt; Nda yià kat à yinǝ andá andǝ anzur malea a buia nǝ dù mǝno, sǝ à pwangi-myalia abanì.<verse eid="1SA 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Pǝlǝa Sawul ɓakkî Yahweh gyangŋan. Mǝnia ka nda gyangŋan mǝdǝmbe mana ɓakkî Yahweh ka.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Pǝlǝa Sawul banggi amǝ'lwa male ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ sǝm kya loasǝtà amǝ'Filisti nǝ du sǝ ɓǝ̀ sǝm pwan gǝna-lwa ba kwaro mala bân; ɓǝ̀ sǝm wal-luia kat.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa à eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Pàk gìr mǝnana a sǝni nda ɓoaro kutibanì ka.&gt;&gt; Sǝama pǝris ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Came ɓǝ̀ sǝm ɗì Yahweh peatu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Nda Sawul ɗì Ɓakuli ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ kyan nǝ munǝo arǝ amǝ'Filisti le? Awu nǝ túriá a ɓabu Isǝrayila le?&gt;&gt; Sǝama Ɓakuli pe wi eare a pwari mǝno ka ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Pǝlǝa Sawul banggi amúrû mala amǝ'lwa ama, &lt;&lt;Wu yiu kani kat, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm súrǝ̀ cauɓikea mǝnana à pè yalung ngga. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Mbak-kàngkàng Yahweh, mǝ'akmúr Isǝrayila nakam ngga, ɓwa mǝnana kat à kumi nǝ cau ka, dumǝna púp nǝ̀ wú, ko ɓǝ̀ muna-ɓwabura mem Jonatan na ka.&gt;&gt; Sǝama kǝɓwa atà aɓwana kat na kǝ cau ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Pǝlǝa Sawul banggi amǝ'Isǝrayila ama, &lt;&lt;Wun kat ka, wu cam kanó sǝ mim sǝnǝ Jonatan ngga, sǝm nǝ̀ cam kani.&gt;&gt; À eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Pàk gìr mǝnana a sǝni nda ɓoarô ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Pǝlǝa Sawul na ama, &lt;&lt;We Yahweh, Ɓakuli mala Isǝrayila, palang sǝ a pè guro mò eare yalung ɗàng? <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 27:21">Ɓal 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:6">1Sam 28:6</ref></char>.</note>Ɓǝ̀ mim ko muna-ɓwabura mem Jonatan, nda mǝnana pàk man yì cauɓikea ka, pa eare nǝ Urim; sǝ ɓǝ̀ aɓwana mô, amǝ'Isǝrayila na à pàk man yì cauɓikea ka, pa eare nǝ Thummim.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa bwal-shishar kpa amur Sawul andǝ Jonatan, sǝ aɓwana ka à auwa. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Pǝlǝa Sawul bang ama, &lt;&lt;Wu bwal-shishar anrem sǝnǝ muna-ɓwabura mem Jonatan.&gt;&gt; Sǝ bwal-shishar kpa amur Jonatan.<verse eid="1SA 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Pǝlǝa Sawul ɗì Jonatan ama, &lt;&lt;Banggam gìr mǝnana a pàk ka!&gt;&gt; Jonatan ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ən oasǝ kún gara mana nda a buam ngga aɓa mur-nyi sǝ ǝn oê a kunam. Mǝ ndya ka; mǝ nǝ wǔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Pǝlǝa Sawul banggi Jonatan ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ Ɓakuli wal-luim, ɓǝ̀ à wal-luio raka!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Sǝama amǝ'lwa ne Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Palang sǝ à nǝ̀ wal-lú Jonatan, mǝnana Ɓakuli paktúró nǝi sǝ sǝm kum mǝnia yì limurǝm mǝgule a Isǝrayila ka? Pà nǝ̀ pa anggo ɗàng! Mbak-kàngkàng Yahweh nakam ngga, ko nyang mwashat a ɓamur Jonatan pà nǝ̀ kpa a nzali ɗang. Gìr mǝnana pè yalung ngga, Ɓakuli na mǝnana bwali wi kam ngga.&gt;&gt; Nda amǝ'lwa man amsǝ Jonatan, à wal-luí raka.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Pǝlǝa Sawul nying pǝrta amǝ'Filisti, sǝ amǝ'Filisti nyar a bu-nzali malea ka.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Anzǝm mǝnana Sawul dumǝna murǝm mala Isǝrayila ka, lwa-lwa arǝ aɓi-mǝbura a koya buì: amǝ'Mowap, andǝ amǝ'Amon, andǝ amǝ'Edom andǝ amurǝma mala Zoba, andǝ amǝ'Filisti. Koya ban na Sawul wari a munǝo ka, kǝ kum limurǝm. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Sawul munǝ munǝo mala ɓwaburaɓwa, sǝ gandǝ amǝ'Amalek. Amsǝ amǝ'Isǝrayila a bù aɓwana mana à yinǝ munǝo arǝia ka.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amǝɓala mala Sawul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Amuna-burana mala Sawul ka, à nda ka Jonatan, andǝ Ishvi, sǝ Malkishuwa; sǝ ndanǝ amuna-mamǝna ɓari; mǝgule atea ka nda Merap, sǝ mǝkyauwe nda Mikal. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Mālá Sawul nda Ahinowam, ɓoarnsarile Ahima'az. Mǝ'sàrǝ̀ban amur amǝ'lwa mala Sawul ka, nda Abǝna muna-ɓwabura mala Ner, kina Sawul. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Tár Sawul ka nda Kish; sǝ Ner yì tár Abǝna ka, nda muna-ɓwabura mala Abiyel.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Sawul munǝ munǝo mǝcandǝe arǝ amǝ'Filisti aɓa do-yilǝmu male kat. Nda gìr mana tsǝa sǝ akoya pwari sǝ kum ɓwabura mǝnana ndanǝ rǝcandǝa andǝ mǝsǝkàng-kàngŋa ka, nǝ̀ oasǝ ɓwe aɓalǝ amǝ'lwa male.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Yahweh ɓinǝ Sawul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Samuyila banggi Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 9:16">1Sam 9:16</ref></char>.</note>Mǝ nda ɓwa mǝnana Yahweh tasǝam ɓǝ̀n ɗārǝo ace mǝnana wu duk murǝm amúr aɓwana male amǝ'Isǝrayila ka. Adyan ngga, kwakikiro arǝ cau mǝnana Yahweh kǝ na ka. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Yahweh mana Karban nǝ Gulo kat ka, bang ama, &lt;Ən sǝnǝna gìr mǝɓane mǝnana amǝ'Amalek pàkkî amǝ Isǝrayila amur njar, lang amǝ Isǝrayila purî nzali Masar ka. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Adyan ngga, wu kyane wu kya wal amǝ'Amalek, sǝ gìr mǝnana kat à ndanǝi ka, wu tàrì ace Ɓakuli. Wu kǝa sǝn-mǝsǝswatǝr malea ɗàng. Wu wal-lú aburana, andǝ amamǝna, andǝ amuna, andǝ amuna-mǝkeke, andǝ andá, andǝ anzur, andǝ akalakadambi, sǝ amǝdambǝriso.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Pǝlǝa Sawul ramba amǝ'lwa, sǝ ɓallia a Telem. Asoje-kusǝu na á-gbǝman-ɓari (200,000), sǝ aburana mala tàu mala Yahuda ka à nda á-lum (10,000). <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Pǝlǝa Sawul andǝ aburana male wari a nggea-là mala amǝ'Amalek, sǝ à kya kumsǝ a ɓangŋaban. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Pǝlǝa Sawul banggi amǝ'Ken<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 1:16">Akas 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:11">4:11</ref></char>.</note> ama, &lt;&lt;Wu o, wu nying amǝ'Amalek, ace mǝnana mǝ nggá kiɗiki wun wunǝia raka. Wun ngga, wu lǝmdǝ pěmǝɓoarne aban amǝ Isǝrayila kat lang à purî ɓá nzali Masar ka.&gt;&gt; Nda amǝ'Ken purî ɓalǝ amǝ'Amalek ka.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Pǝlǝa Sawul wal amǝ'Amalek kat twal a Havila aban ká ɗār a Shur, mǝnana nda a takuli mala Masar ka. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Sǝ gbami Agag murǝm mala amǝ'Amalek andǝamǝsǝi, sǝ aɓwana mala Agag ka, tària nǝ twaltea kat-kat nǝ kún nggeabyau. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Sǝama, Sawul andǝ amǝ'lwa male ka, à nying Agag nǝyilǝmu, sǝ à nying amǝɓoarne-katkat atà ambul andǝ anzur, andǝ andá, andǝ amuna-ndá mǝ'nyange, andǝ amuna-nzur, andǝ koya gir mǝnana mǝɓoarne na ka. À earce ama à nǝ̀ kiɗiki amǝnia yì agir ka ɗàng. Sǝ acili agirkusǝu mǝnana à ɓǝsǝkia sǝ amǝɓane na ka, à wal-luia kat.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Pǝlǝa cau mala Yahweh yiu aban Samuyila ama: <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />&lt;&lt;Ən pàk-ɓǝnsǝlǝma <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pàk-ɓǝnsǝlǝma </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 6:6">Tite 6:6</ref></char>.</note> nǝ tsǝk Sawul ɓǝ̀ duk murǝm, acemǝnana pǝlǝna nzǝmi arǝ kpatam, sǝ ɓinǝ pàk gìr mǝnana ǝn tsǝki wi nzongcau arǝì nǝma ɓǝ̀ pè ka.&gt;&gt; Bum Samuyila lúllô, sǝ ɓua aban Yahweh aɓa dù mǝno kat.<verse eid="1SA 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Ban fana ka, Samuyila lo nǝ dǝmbari ace ká aban Sawul. Sǝama ɓeɓwa banggi Samuyila ama, &lt;&lt;Sawul wari a Kamel a bân ɓakkì ɓamúrì gìr mana aɓwana nǝ̀ nggǝ ɗenyinǝi ace ka, sǝ wulina umǝna a Gilgal.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Lang Samuyila yina aban Sawul ka, Sawul ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ Yahweh tsǝko bù! Ən pàngŋǝ́nà gìr mǝnana Yahweh bang ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Sǝ Samuyila ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ nda anggo ka, sǝ gi mana ǝn nggǝ oè a kiram kǝla ɓua mala anzur andǝ andá?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Sawul ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Amǝ'lwa pwania arǝ amǝ'Amalek sǝ à yinǝia; à nying anzur andǝ andá amǝɓoarne-katkat nǝyilǝmu ace pà gìr'nkila nǝia aban Yahweh Ɓakuli mô; sǝ acilia ka sǝm kiɗikinia kat-kat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila banggi Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Came ɓǝ̀n banggo gìr mǝnana Yahweh banggam yilung nǝ du ka.&gt;&gt; Sawul ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Banggam.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Samuyila banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Kat andǝ mani ama, a sǝn ɓamuro ka a pa kún kǝgir raka, a nda múrû mala atau mala Isǝrayila re? Yahweh ɗārǝo a duk murǝm amúr amǝ'Isǝrayila. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Yahweh tasǝo kya pakki wi túrô, banggo ama, &lt;Kyane, tària ace kiɗikia kat-kat, yià amǝ'Amalek amǝ'cauɓikea mǝno, sǝ wu munǝ-munǝo arǝia sheɓǝ̀ a twalnatea kang ngga.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Palang sǝ a kpata gi Yahweh ɗàng? Palang sǝ a rufi atà gǝna-lwa, sǝ a pàk gìr mǝnana mǝɓike na ka, a sǝne mala Yahweh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Pǝlǝa Sawul ne Samuyila ama, &lt;&lt;Ən kpanatà gi Yahweh. Ən warina ǝn pangŋǝ̀nà túró mǝnana Yahweh túrǎm ace ka. Ən yinanǝ Agag murǝm mala amǝ'Amalek, sǝ ǝn twalnata amǝ'Amalek kat-kat. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Sǝama amǝ'lwa mem pwan gǝna-lwa atà anzur andǝ andá; yià agir mǝɓoarne-katkat aɓalǝ amǝnana à tària ace kiɗikia ka; à yinǝia kani a Gilgal ace pà gìr'nkila aban Yahweh, Ɓakuli mô.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Samuyila bang ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">&lt;&lt;Mǝye nda mǝnana kǝ pwasǝbum Yahweh ka:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">Okiru na le ko apagir mala pisǝe kǝring andǝ pà agir'nkila na?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">Sǝni, okiru ka ɓoaro-kuti pà gìr'nkila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">sǝ kwakikiru ka ɓoaro-kuti mùrú agam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Ang 40:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:8-9">50:8-9</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 21:3">Pas 21:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:11-13">Isha 1:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:16-17">1:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:22-23">Ir 7:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:6-8">Mik 6:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:6-9">Ib 10:6-9</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Mgbicau ka nda kǝla cauɓikea mala monzǝo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">sǝ twalkicau ka nda kǝla ɓealɓikea mala peri atà ankúl.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:23">Acemǝnana a ɓinǝ cau mala Yahweh ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">Yì gbal ka ɓinǝno arǝ duk murǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Sawul ne Samuyila ama, &lt;&lt;Ən pángŋǝ̀nà cauɓikea, acemǝnana ǝn kpata nzongcau mala Yahweh andǝ cau mò ɗàng. Gìr mǝnana tsǝk ka ɓangciu na pàkkam arǝ aɓwana, sǝ ǝn kpata già ka. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Sǝama adyan ngga, ida twàlâm-ban cauɓikea mem, sǝ wu yiu atam, ace mǝnana mǝ peri aban Yahweh ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Samuyila banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Pà mǝ nǝ ká atò ɗàng. A ginǝ kpata nzongcau mala Yahweh, sǝ Yahweh ɓinǝno arǝ duk murǝm amúr Isǝrayila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Lang Samuyila wulio nǝ̀ u ka, Sawul gbami kún nggea-daura male, kara sana. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Samuyila ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Yahweh sanǝna domurǝm mala Isǝrayila arǝò yalung sǝ pànî ɓio ɓwa-Isǝrayila mana ɓoaro kútiǒ ka. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Ɓakuli mǝɓoarɓwe mala Isǝrayila ka, kǝ na nyir ɗàng, sǝ kǝ nggaɗi ɗenyicau male ɗàng. Yì ka, ɓwapǝndǝa na mǝnana kǝ nggaɗi ɗenyicau male ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Pǝlǝa Sawul bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ən pàngŋǝ́nà cauɓikea. Sǝama, ida lǝmdǝam gulo aɓadǝm aɓwana-mǝgule mala aɓwana mem sǝ aɓadǝm amǝ'Isǝrayila. Nyare atàm ace mǝnana mǝ peri aban Yahweh Ɓakuli mô ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Nda Samuyila nyar atè, sǝ Sawul peri aban Yahweh.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila bang ama, &lt;&lt;Wu yinǝam nǝ Agag, yì murǝm mala amǝ'Amalek kani.&gt;&gt; Agag pǝlǝa yiu abani aɓalǝ ansolo, sǝ kǝ ne ɓamúrì ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝsǝcau, lúllô mala lú ka umǝna.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Samuyila ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝla mǝnana nggeabyau mô tsǝk amamǝna à ɗwanyi amuna ka, anggo gbal nggò nǝ̀ ɗwanyi munì.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa Samuyila kwarki Agag, kasǝki mgbeatuk-mgbeatuk akano a Gilgal aɓadǝm Yahweh.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila o a Rama, sǝ Sawul nyar a ɓala male a Gibiya. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Samuyila nyare sǝn Sawul ɗǝm ɗàng bà lú male. Sǝama Samuyila pàk bumkiɗikea ace Sawul. Sǝ Yahweh ka banɓiki wi mǝnana tsǝk Sawul ɓǝ̀ duk murǝm amur Isǝrayila ka.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Samuyila ɗārǝ́ Dauda ɓǝ̀ duk murǝm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />A ɓè fara ka, Yahweh banggi Samuyila ama, &lt;&lt;Baniò nǝ̀ sau lang sǝ awu nǝ lidǝmba nǝ pak-bumkiɗikea ace Sawul. Ən ɓinǝnace duk murǝm male amur amǝ Isǝrayila. Acemani ka, lùmsǝ njawe mò nǝ mùrú olif sǝ wu o a Betalami. A mǝno yì là ka, ɗice ɓwa mǝnana à tunǝki ama Jeshi ka, acemǝnana ǝn tarna mwashat aɓalǝ amuna-burana male ɓǝ̀ duk murǝm mem.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Sǝ Samuyila bang ama, &lt;&lt;Lang sǝ mǝ nǝ ká? Ɓǝ̀ Sawul okce ka, nǝ̀ wal-luem.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Pǝlǝa Yahweh banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Bwal muna-ndǎ abuo sǝ wu bang ama, &lt;Ən yiu ace pà gìr'nkila aban Yahweh.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Tunǝ Jeshi ɓǝ̀ yiu a ban pa gìr'nkilè, sǝ mǝ nǝ lǝmdǝo gìr mǝnana awu nǝ pàk ka. Awu nǝ ɗārǝàm ɓwa mǝnana mǝ nǝ banggo ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Anggo sǝ Samuyila pa kǝla mǝnana Yahweh ne wi ka. Lang yi bwalǝna Betalami ka, aɓwana-mǝgule mala là pur nǝ rǝɓǝla à yi kúllì. À ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Mana kumban le? A yiu jam le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Samuyila earia wia ama, &lt;&lt;E, ǝn yiu aɓa rǝpwala, ace pà gìr'nkila aban Yahweh. Wu lak ɓamur rǝ wun sǝ wu yiu atàm a ban pâ gìr'nkilè.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa Samuyila lak Jeshi andǝ amuni, sǝ tunǝia ɓǝà yiu gbal ace pà mǝno yì gìr'nkila ka.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Lang Jeshi andǝ amuni yi bwalǝna ka, Samuyila soa mǝsǝi arǝ Eliyap sǝ na ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓafo, mǝnia ka nda kǝ ɓwa mǝnana Yahweh tàrì ɓǝ̀ duk murǝm ngga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Sǝ Yahweh ka ne Samuyila ama, &lt;&lt;Cè ɓabumo o arǝ puro male a nggūrǝu ko dāh'rya male ɗàng. Yì ka ǝn ɓinǝni. Yahweh kǝ sǝngìr a sǝne mala ɓwapǝndǝa ɗang. Ɓwapǝndǝa kǝ sǝn pǎ mala ɓwa a nggūrǝu, sǝ Yahweh ka ɓabum na sǝngiyi ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Pǝlǝa Jeshi ne muni Abinadap ɓǝ̀ puro ɓǝ̀ gya a ɓadǝm Samuyila. Sǝ Samuyila ka na ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia nda ɓwa mǝnana Yahweh twal ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Anzǝmi ka Jeshi tasǝ Shama. Samuyila na ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia gbal ka, nda ɓwa mǝnana Yahweh twal ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Anggo sǝ Jeshi lǝmdǝì Samuyila amuni tongno-nong-ɓari. Sǝ Samuyila ne Jeshi ama, &lt;&lt;Yahweh twal kǝ ɓwa atà amǝnia yì amuna ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila ɗì Jeshi ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝ amunio nia ka le?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Jeshi eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtankwang malea nakam, sǝ nda a bondo aban yál anzur andǝ ambul.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Samuyila na ama, &lt;&lt;Turban atè adyan ɓǝà kya yinǝi; pà sǝm nǝ̀ dumnǝdo ɗang sheɓǝ̀ yina ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Jeshi pǝlǝa túrban atè sǝ yiu. Yì mǝlagga Dauda ka, pǝndǝa a nggūrǝu, ɓoarjam sǝ amǝsǝì ɓoar sǝna.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:12">Yahweh ne Samuyila ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia nda ɓwê; lo ɗārǝí.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Lang Dauda na aban came aɓalǝ amǝ'eambi ka, Samuyila twal mùrú olif mana aɓa njawe mǝnana yinǝi ka, sǝ ɗārǝ́ Dauda nǝi. Twal amǝno yì pwari aban o a dǝmba ka, Bangŋo mala Yahweh sulǝo amur Dauda nǝ rǝcandǝa. Samuyila pǝlǝa nyare o a Rama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dauda walî Sawul zangŋan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />A bàkú mǝno ka, Bangŋo mala Yahweh nyìngŋǝ̀nà Sawul, sǝ ɓè bangŋo mǝɓike mǝnana pur nǝban Yahweh ka, yinǝi wi nǝ banɓikea. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Amǝ'túró male yì Sawul banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, ɓè bangŋo mǝɓike mǝnana pur nǝban Yahweh ka nda mǝnana kǝ po banɓikea ka. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Eara sǝm, ɓwamǝgule, ɓǝ̀ sǝm alota ɓwa mǝnana mǝ'sǝlǝ wal zangŋan na ka; sǝ lang yì bangŋo mǝɓike nǝban Ɓakuli yina amuro ka, ɓwê nǝ̀ walô zangŋan sǝ hakkilo mô nǝ̀ nongŋo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Nda Sawul banggi amǝ'túró male ama, &lt;&lt;Wu alamta ɓwa mǝnana sǝlǝ wal zangŋan pepè ka sǝ wu yinǝi abanam.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Mwashat atà alaggana male eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ən sǝnǝna ɓè muna-ɓwabura mala Jeshi ɓwa Betalami, mǝnana mǝ'sǝlǝ wal zangŋan na ka. Yì ɗǝm ngga ɓwabura mǝ'ɓabum-candǝa na sǝ mǝ'lwa na. Kǝ nacau pepè sǝ ɓoarjam. Sǝ Yahweh na atè.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Pǝlǝa Sawul tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân aban Jeshi nǝ cau ama, &lt;&lt;Tàsǝâm muna-ɓwabura mô Dauda, mǝnana nda atà ambul andǝ anzur ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Pǝlǝa Jeshi twal mǝdambǝriso sǝ tsǝki wi twalo mala bǝredi andǝ mùr-anap aɓa sambǝram a nzǝmi, andǝ muna-mbul sǝ tasǝia nǝ bú Dauda aban Sawul. <verse eid="1SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Dauda yiu aban Sawul sǝ yi duk mǝtúró male. Sawul earce Dauda kǝ̀rkǝ́r sǝ twali ɓǝ̀ duk mǝ'twali wi agirmunǝo male. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Pǝlǝa Sawul tasǝ mǝ'na-túrbân aban Jeshi nǝ cau ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, ɗeki Dauda ɓǝ̀ ueo aɓa túró mem, acemǝnana kumǝna earmúrú a mǝsǝam.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Twal a pwari mǝno, lang yì bangŋo mǝɓike nǝban Ɓakuli yina amur Sawul ka, Dauda nǝ̀ twal zangŋan male nǝ̀ wali. Sǝ yì bangŋo mǝɓike ka nǝ̀ o, hakkilo mala Sawul nǝ̀ nongŋo, sǝ nǝ̀ kum rǝpwala.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Golaya soabum amǝ'Isǝrayila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />A bàkú mǝno ka amǝ'Filisti ramba amǝ'lwa malea ace munǝo a Soko, ɓè là a bu-nzali Yahuda; à tsǝk kàttì malea a ban mǝnana à tunǝi ama Efes-Damim ngga, anre Soko andǝ Azeka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Sawul andǝ aburana mala Isǝrayila ramba, sǝ à tsǝk kàttì malea a Ɓangŋaban Ela, a ban mǝnana à gilǝrǝia a nzong ban-je munǝo arǝ amǝ'Filisti ka. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Amǝ'Filisti cam amur ɓè mgbangban, sǝ amǝ Isǝrayila cam amur ɓè mǝnana soa mǝno, sǝ ɓangŋaban na gau nrea ka.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Pǝlǝa gbani mala amǝ'Filisti, purî ɓá kàttì mala amǝ'Filisti. Lullǝì nda Golaya; ɓwa nggea-là Gat na. Dāh'rya male bik kǝla mita tàrú. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Oasǝ sukuru-bolo mala bolo-bángŋá a ɓamúrí, sǝ daura-bolo mǝnana oasǝ arǝì ka, dǝmbǝrya male bik kǝla tyang lumi-tongno-bwamdǝ-tongno-nong-ɓari (57). <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Yì ɗǝm ngga oasǝa oamsǝkan mala bolo-bángŋá arǝ akusǝì, sǝ bwal nkongŋo a mkpamtari. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Tondong kaɗa male nyane kǝla muna-nggun-so. Dǝmbǝrya mala mǝsǝ kaɗa male mala bolo-candǝa ka, tyang tongno-nong-ɓari na. Ɓè mǝ'lwa bwalì wi ntongŋo male sǝ kǝ gya a ɓadǝmbi.<verse eid="1SA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Golaya came sǝ loasǝ gì arǝ amǝ Isǝrayila ama, &lt;&lt;Mana tsǝa sǝ wu pur kat ama wun nǝ̀ munǝo? Mǝ nda ɓwa'Filisti re, sǝ wun ngga, wu nda ka aguro mala Sawul re? Wu pusǝ ɓwa mwashat aɓalǝ wun, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sulǝ abanam. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Ɓǝ̀ ɓwê gandǝ munǝ arǝàm sǝ wal-luem ngga, sǝm nǝ̀ duk aguro ma'wun; sǝ ɓǝ̀n gandǝì, sǝ ǝn wal-luí ka, wun nǝ̀ duk aguro ma'sǝm, wun nǝ̀ pàkka sǝm túró. <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Yalung ngga ǝn ɓǝsǝki wun kat, wun amǝ'lwa mala Isǝrayila. Wu tasǝ ɓwa mwashat ɓǝ̀ pur atàm, mǝnana nǝ̀ munǝ arǝàm ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Lang Sawul andǝ Isǝrayila kat ok amǝnia yì acau mala ɓwa'Filisti ka, ǝn'ò pakkia wia sǝ à dǝurǝ kǝ̀rkǝ́r.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeshi túr Dauda a kàttì mala Sawul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />A bàkú mǝno ka, ɓè ɓwabura na kam lùllǝì ama Jeshi, ɓwa'Efǝrat a Betalami, mana nda tár Dauda ka; ndanǝ amuna-burana tongno-nong-tàrú. A nza mala Sawul ka, ɓwabure enà kutsuk. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Amuna-burana amǝdǝmbe male tàrú ka, à o atà Sawul a munǝo. Alullǝia nda ka Eliyap muna-dǝmba, andǝ Aminadap ɓaria, sǝ tàruia nda Shama. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Dauda ka nda mǝtankwang. Amǝgule mǝnia tàrú ka, à o atà Sawul, <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />sǝ Dauda ka camarǝ ká aban Sawul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 16:21-23">1Sam 16:21-23</ref></char>.</note> sǝ nǝ̀ nyare ace ɗenyinǝ ambul andǝ anzur mala tárrí a Betalami.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Twal anongŋo lumi-ine ɓwa'Filisti mǝno camarǝ puro sǝ nǝ̀ yia came a bancame male, dǝmbari andǝ pwarikpǝra. <verse eid="1SA 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Ɓè pwari ka, Jeshi banggi muna-ɓwabura male Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Kyan nǝì amǝ'eambo buku mǝssa mǝnia à kàngŋì ka, andǝ agbatali bǝredi mǝnia lum ngga; kyan nǝia akaurǝa aban amǝ'eambo a kàttì. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Sǝ wu twal adú kiura mǝnia lum ngga a buo wu kya pê mǝ'sàrǝ̀ban amur nggǝsan mala amǝ'lwa á-mwashat malea. Kya sǝni ko amǝ'eambo na jam, sǝ wu yinǝam nǝ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kún-bǝri </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;cautera&gt;&gt;</char></note>kún-bǝri nǝbania mǝnana nǝ̀ lǝmdǝ ama mbak-kàngkàng à nda kam ngga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Anggo ka, Sawul andǝ amǝ'eambu mǝnia andǝ amǝ'lwa mala Isǝrayila puppup ka, à nda aɓa Ɓangŋaban Ela, a ban munǝo andǝ amǝ'Filisti. <verse eid="1SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Nda Dauda lo nǝ dǝmbari ɗiɗyal sǝ nying ambul andǝ anzur a bù ɓeɓwa ɓǝ̀ tsǝkiria, pǝlǝa twal agirlina mǝno sǝ bwal-njar, kǝla mǝnana Jeshi banggi wi ka. Yi bik kàttì lang amǝ'lwa na arǝ puro à nǝ̀ ká nzong ban-je munǝo, sǝ à kǝ̀ ɓua gāwàn lwa ka. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Amǝ'Isǝrayila tsaɗi-akunarǝia ace munǝo, sǝ à soa ka amǝ'Filisti; sǝ amǝ'Filisti gbal ka, à tsaɗi-akunarǝia ace munǝo, sǝ à soa ka amǝ'Isǝrayila. À came sǝ à soa ɓamǝsǝarǝia, amǝ'lwa arǝ amǝ'lwa. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Pǝlǝa Dauda nying atwalo male a bù mǝ'tsǝkir atwalo, sǝ ɓangŋa wari a nzong ban-je munǝo sǝ makkì-amǝ'eambi-kún. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Lang ndarǝ nacau nǝia ka, kara sǝni ka, Golaya, gbani mala amǝ'Filisti, ɓwa'Gat, purnì nzong ban-je munǝo mala amǝ'Filisti. Nacau mǝ'mwashati kǝla mana nakiyi pwari-pwari ka, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni a: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 17:8">17:8</ref></char>.</note> sǝ Dauda oè. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Pwari mǝnana kat aburana mala Isǝrayila sǝni ka, yià kat à ɓanggi wi nǝ ɓangciu mǝkǝ̀rkǝ́rnì.<verse eid="1SA 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />À hamnanǝi aban aburana mala Isǝrayila ama, &lt;&lt;Wu sǝn mǝnia yì ɓwabura mǝnana camarǝ puro ka re? Kǝ pur ace nabura<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nabura </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;soabum,&gt;&gt; ko &lt;&lt;ɓǝsǝki&gt;&gt; ko &lt;&lt;sanggi&gt;&gt;</char></note> arǝ Isǝrayila. Murǝm nǝ̀ pa gǝna mǝgule aban ɓwa mǝnana nǝ̀ wal-luí ka; nǝ̀ pe wi ɓoarnsarile ɓǝ̀ duk māmí, sǝ nǝ̀ pusǝ ɓala mala tárrí arǝ mbwe boalo-cemi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Dauda ɗì amǝ'lwa mǝnana a baní tù ka ama, &lt;&lt;Mana à nǝ̀ pè ɓwa mǝnana wal-lú ɓwa'Filisti mǝnia, nǝ̀ pusǝ mǝnia yì gìr kǝsǝkya arǝ Isǝrayila ka? Yana ɗe nda mǝnia yì ɓwa'Filisti mǝ'ɗwanyi kasǝ-ɓatau, mǝnana nǝ̀ sanggi amǝ'lwa mala Ɓakuli mǝ'yilǝmui ka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Pǝlǝa aburana mǝnia eari Dauda nǝ ɓǝsǝlǝi wi cau mǝnana à nani a dǝmba ka ama, &lt;&lt;E, mǝno ka nda gìr mǝnana à nǝ̀ pè ace ɓwa mǝnana wal-lú mǝno yì ɓwabura ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Lang Eliyap, mǝgula Dauda ok cau mǝno Dauda nakiyi aburana mǝno ka, pǝlǝa ɗì Dauda nǝ bumlulla ama, &lt;&lt;Mana ɗe a yiua pě kani? Amǝno yì anzur kpokyak ka yana a nyinggi wi ɓǝ̀ yália a ɓabondo? Ən súrǝ́nà rǝ twàlɓamúrû mô andǝ twalkicau mò. A yiu nǝ yiu ace sǝn amǝ'lwa a kún munǝo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Dauda ɗiban ama, &lt;&lt;Mana ǝn pa ado? Mim ngga ǝn ɗiban nǝ ɗi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Pǝlǝa nying baní kutio o aban aɓea aɓwana, sǝ ɗia kǝ ɗiban mǝ'mwashati. À nyesǝi wi eare mǝ'mwashati kǝla mǝnana a dǝmba ka. <verse eid="1SA 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Aɓea amǝ'lwa ok cau mǝno Dauda nakiyi ka, pǝlǝa à warinǝ ɗiban male aban murǝm Sawul. Pǝlǝa Sawul túrban atè ɓǝ̀ yiu.<verse eid="1SA 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Sǝ Dauda ne Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Cè ɓabum kǝɓwa ɓungi atàcau mala mǝnia yì ɓwa'Filisti ka ɗàng. Mim guro mò, mǝ nǝ nggá munǝ arǝì.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Sawul ne Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;A pà wunǝ gandǝ ká arǝ ɓwa'Filisti man ace munǝo arǝì ɗàng, acemǝnana we ka, a nda muntulo, sǝ yì ka nggea kanggǝrang mǝ'lwa na twal a lo male ba yalung.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Sǝ Dauda ka banggi Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Mim guro mò ka mǝ nda yálgír mala anzur andǝ ambul mala tárrám. A pwari mǝnana im ko biya yiu yi bwal atà anzur a domwan nǝ̀ um nǝi ka, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />ǝn ɓang atè, ǝn wali kum, sǝ ǝn ak nzurnì a kúni. Lang pǝlǝ arǝàm ngga, ǝn gbami arǝ ankpakò-kúni, ǝn walki, sǝ ǝn wal-luí. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Ən wal im sǝ ǝn wal biya, anggo gbal sǝ mǝ nǝ pang nǝ ɓwa'Filisti mǝnia à kasǝ ɓate raka, acemǝnana ɓǝsǝki amǝ'lwa mala Ɓakuli mǝyilǝmui. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Ɓakuli mǝnana amsǝam aɓalǝ ankaulakusǝ im andǝ ankaulakusǝ biya ka, nǝ̀ amsǝam a bu mǝnia yì ɓwa'Filisti ka!&gt;&gt; Sǝ Sawul banggi Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Kyane! Yahweh nǝ̀ pà atò!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Pǝlǝa Sawul nyesǝ agirmunǝo male pè Dauda. Oasǝi wi sukuru mala bolo-bángŋá amurí, sǝ oasǝi wi daura-bolo arǝì. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Dauda gyar nggeabyau mala Sawul amur agirmunǝo mǝno arǝì ka, sǝ mwam gya kàrìban nǝ̀ sǝn pǎ malea, acemǝnana yì ka malaká oasǝ a'ulang agir mǝno ka a kǝ pwari ɗàng. Pǝlǝa Dauda ne Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Pà mǝ nǝ gandǝ ká aɓalǝ amǝnia yì agir ka ɗàng, acemǝnana ǝn bwalta paktúró nǝia ɗàng.&gt;&gt; Dauda pǝlǝa swáriǎ. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Twal gara-yálgìr male a buì sǝ kya tàrki amǝsǝtali tongno, amǝnana rǝia ɓùlɓùl ka, a muna-myalmur, oasǝia aɓa sambǝram-yálgìr male. Nǝ ntamso male a buì, gya aban ká, gbàshìban ɓwa'Filisti.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dauda wal-lú Golaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Golaya pur aban yiu arǝ Dauda, mǝ'bwali wi ntongŋo male na a ɓadǝmbi sǝ kǝ gya atè. Gya kǝ sungŋo aban Dauda. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Lang soa mǝsǝi pèlǝ Dauda ka, ɓǝsǝki, acemǝnana sǝn Dauda ka lo-ɓwa na, ɓamǝsǝ muntulo na arǝì, pǝndǝa sǝ ɓoarjam. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Ne Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;A yiu arǝàm nǝ gara ka, mǝ nda nvwa le?&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa sú Dauda aɓa lullǝ ankúl malea yià amǝ'Filisti. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Ne Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Yiu kani, mǝ nǝ pè anyal andǝ anyam-ɓabondo nyamo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Dauda ne yì ɓwa'Filisti ama, &lt;&lt;A yiu arǝàm nǝ nggeabyau, andǝ kaɗa, andǝ nkongŋo, sǝ mim ngga, mǝ ndarǝ ká arǝò aɓa lullǝ Yahweh Mǝtala Abangŋo, yì Ɓakuli mala amǝ'lwa mala Isǝrayila, mǝnana a nabura arǝì ka. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />A pwari man yalung ngga, Yahweh nǝ̀ tasǝo a ɓabuam! Mǝ nǝ walo sǝ mǝ nǝ kasǝ ɓamuro. Yalung ngga mǝ nǝ pè anyal mǝnana a kuli ka, andǝ anyam-ɓabondo mala nzali man alú ka amǝ'lwa mala amǝ'Filisti. Sǝ ɓanza kat nǝ̀ sǝlǝ ama Ɓakuli na a Isǝrayila. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Sǝ koya ɓwa mǝnana a ban ramba kani ka, nǝ̀ sǝlǝ ama pà nǝ nggeabyau ko nkongŋo sǝ Yahweh kǝ amsǝ aɓwana male ɗàng. Lwa mǝnia ka mala Yahweh na, sǝ yì ka nǝ̀ tasǝ wun kat a ɓabù sǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Lang yì ɓwa'Filisti lo kǝ gbàshìban je andǝ Dauda ka, Dauda tù nǝ mire aban ká a nzong ban-je munǝo ace je andǝ ɓwa'Filisti. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Dauda oasǝ buì aɓa sambǝram male sǝ pusǝ tali mwashat, wúlì aɓa ntamso sǝ ɓungŋǝna ɓwa'Filisti nǝi a kundǝmbi kum! Tali ar mu kundǝmbi kò aɓalǝi, kara kasǝa kpa nǝ ɓamǝsǝì a nzali.<verse eid="1SA 17:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Anggo sǝ Dauda limurǝm amur ɓwa'Filisti nǝ ntamso andǝ tali; kat andǝ amani ama Dauda pànǝ kǝ nggeabyau a buì raka, ɓù ɓwa'Filisti túrí a nzali wali màk.<verse eid="1SA 17:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Pǝlǝa Dauda ɓangŋa yi cam amur ɓwa'Filisti. Gbami nggeabyau mala ɓwa'Filisti, kwetǝi a ndè, sǝ masǝlǝi kasǝ ɓamúrí. Lang amǝ'Filisti sǝni ama gbani malea wuna ka, à pǝlǝ nǝ mire aban o.<verse eid="1SA 17:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Pǝlǝa aburana mala Isǝrayila lo nǝ gāwàn lwa, sǝ à pǝrta amǝ'Filisti aban ká ɗār a ɓangŋaban andǝ akún nggea-là Ekǝron. Alú ka amǝ'Filisti nonggi amur njargula Sharayim aban ká Gat andǝ Ekǝron. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Sǝ lang amǝ Isǝrayila nyarî pǝrta amǝ'Filisti ka, à kya pwan gǝna-lwa a kàttì mala amǝ'Filisti. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Dauda twal ɓamur Golaya, yì ɓwa'Filisti sǝ yinǝi a Urǝshalima, sǝ agirmunǝo male ka tsǝia aɓa gumli male.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="s">À yinǝ Dauda aɓadǝm Sawul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Lang Sawul sǝn Dauda pur aban ká munǝo arǝ Golaya ka, ɗì Abǝna, mǝ'sàrǝ̀ban mala amǝ'lwa ama, &lt;&lt;Abǝna, muna mala yan nda mǝno yì lagga ka wo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Abǝna eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ yilǝmo sauwa, Murǝm, ǝn sǝlǝ ɗang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Sǝ murǝm bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ɗiban, yana nda tár munê.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Lang Dauda nyarǝnì wal-lú Golaya, ɓwa'Filisti ka, Abǝna twali, yinǝi aɓadǝm Sawul nǝ ɓamur Golaya a buì. <verse eid="1SA 17:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Sǝ Sawul ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Lagga, a nda muna mala yana?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:58">Sǝ Dauda eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nda muna mala guro mò, Jeshi ɓwa'Betalami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Gyajam mala Dauda andǝ Jonatan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Lang Dauda malǝna nacau andǝ Sawul ka, kara ɓabum Jonatan o arǝ Dauda. Sǝ Jonatan earce Dauda kǝla mǝnana earce yilǝmi ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 20:17">1Sam 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 13:6">Nggur 13:6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Tite a pwari mǝno ka, Sawul twal Dauda ɓǝ̀ do atè, sǝ eari wi nyar a ɓala mala tárrí ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Pǝlǝa Jonatan kùrcau nǝ Dauda, acemǝnana earce Dauda kǝla mǝnana earce yilǝmi ka. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Jonatan swár nggea-daura mana arǝì ka, sǝ pè Dauda, andǝ nggeabyau male, andǝ nta male, sǝ nggur-ɓunu male.<verse eid="1SA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Dauda ka, kǝ kum lidǝmba a koya puro male andǝ amǝ'lwa aban ká a koya ban mǝnana kat Sawul túrí kàm ngga; acemani ka, Sawul tsǝk Dauda a bancame mǝgule amur amǝ'lwa. Sǝ mǝnia ka, pwasǝbum amǝ'lwa kat andǝ amǝgulo mala Sawul.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawul pàk mɓali arǝ Dauda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Lang amǝ'lwa na aban nyare a là, anzǝm mana Dauda walna ɓwa'Filisti ka, amamǝna purki arǝ alá mala Isǝrayila kat ace ká kúllí Murǝm Sawul nǝ nggyal andǝ nggwam. Banɓoaria wia sǝ à kǝ wal akarata-bu andǝ agir jerang malea. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Amamǝne kǝ pakkiɗire, sǝ à kǝ tu'nggyal ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 18:7">&lt;&lt;Sawul walna aá male,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 18:7">sǝ Dauda walna aá lum male!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Mǝnia ka tsǝk Sawul bumi lul kǝ̀rkǝ́r, sǝ earce mǝno yì nggyal ka ɗàng. Na ama, &lt;&lt;À ɓwangsǝ Dauda nǝ aá lum, sǝ mim ngga, kǝ aá na à ɓwangsǝam nǝi ka. Mana ue ɗǝm nǝ̀ kumô ɓǝ̀ domurǝm na raka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Twal a pwari mǝno aban ká dǝmba ka, Sawul tsǝk mǝsǝi arǝ Dauda nǝ mɓali andǝ nusǝban.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Ban fana ka, bangŋo mǝɓike pùr nǝban Ɓakuli, sǝ sulǝ amúr Sawul nǝ rǝcandǝa. Sǝ kútí a pàkkiagir kǝla mǝɓanggya aɓa ɓala male, sǝ Dauda na aban wal jerang male kǝla mana pàkkiyi pwari-pwari ka. Sawul ka ndanǝ nzo male a bui. <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />Sawul pakɗenyicau a bumi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ tǝm Dauda nǝ nzo, mǝ nǝ laptǝi arǝ bum-sheran,&gt;&gt; pǝlǝa túr nzo arǝ Dauda. Sǝama Dauda vwaki, api wi kusǝ ɓari.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Sawul ɓanggi Dauda, acemǝnana Yahweh na atà Dauda, sǝ Yahweh ka nyìngŋǝ̀nà Sawul.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 16:18">1Sam 16:18</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Acemani ka, Sawul pusǝ Dauda arǝ came a ɓadǝmbi, sǝ tsǝi pǝlǝ mǝ'sàrǝ̀ban amúr amǝ'lwa á-mwashat. Sǝ Dauda gingnǝ amǝ'lwa arǝ amunǝo. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Dauda kum lidǝmba aɓa koya gìr mǝnana pàkkiyi ka, acemǝnana Yahweh na atè. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Lang Sawul sǝni ama Dauda kǝ kum lidǝmba kǝ̀rkǝ́r ka, ɓangciu pàkki wi arǝì kǝ̀rkǝ́r. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Sǝama Isǝrayila andǝ aɓwana mala Yahuda kat earce Dauda, acemǝnana yì nda mǝnana kǝ̀ cambia wia a dǝmba sǝ kǝ gingnǝia ace pur ká lwa andǝ nyare ka.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dauda al Mikal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Pǝlǝa Sawul banggi Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, ɓoarnsarilem, Merap nia ka. Ən nggǝ earce nǝma mǝ nǝ po wi wu ali;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 17:25">1Sam 17:25</ref></char>.</note> kǝ gìr mana ǝn earkiyice nǝ we ka, nda mana ama wu dum nǝ mǝsǝkang-kangŋa acem, sǝ wu lwa-lwa mala Yahweh.&gt;&gt; Sawul bang anggo acemǝnana nana a ɓabumi ama, &lt;&lt;Pà mǝ nǝ wal-lú Dauda nǝ nggearam ɗàng. Ɓǝ̀ bù amǝ'Filisti pàk mǝno!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Sǝ Dauda banggi Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nda yana? Ayana nda ka aɓǝla mem ko nggurkwar mala tárrám a Isǝrayila, mǝnana mǝ nǝ duk nkil murǝm ngga?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Lang pwari pàngŋǝ́nà mǝnana à nǝ̀ pa Merap, ɓoarnsarile Sawul aban Dauda ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ ali ka, Sawul twal ɓoarnsarile pè Adǝriyel ɓwa Mehola.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Adyan ngga, Mikal ɓoarnsarile Sawul kǝ earce Dauda. Lang à banggi Sawul cê ka, banɓoari wi. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Sawul pàk ɗenyicau ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ pè Dauda ɓoarnsarilem Mikal, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ duk gbǝli a baní, sǝ ɓǝ̀ bù amǝ'Filisti pǝlǝa arǝì ka.&gt;&gt; Nda Sawul banggi Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Adyan ngga, a ndanǝ ɓaria dǝmbu mala duk nkilam.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Pǝlǝa Sawul ne amǝtúró male ama, &lt;&lt;Wu banggi Dauda aɓa sǝmbǝrǝa ama, &lt;Sǝni, Murǝm ngga banɓoari wi arǝò, sǝ amǝtúró male kat ka, à kǝ̀ earceo. Adyan ngga, duk nkil murǝm.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Sǝ amǝtúró mala Sawul wario à kya ne Dauda amǝnia yì acau ka aɓa sǝmbǝrǝa. Dauda banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu kǝ sǝni ama gìr mǝkyauwe na ɓǝ̀ ɓwa duk nkil murǝm le? Mim ngga, mǝ nda mǝtǝ̀r, sǝ aɓwe kǝ twalam nǝ gulo ɗàng!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Sǝ amǝtúró mala Sawul nyare, à yi ne Sawul cau mǝnana Dauda bang ngga. <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Pǝlǝa Sawul na ama, &lt;&lt;Wu banggi Dauda ama, &lt;Murǝm kǝ earce kǝ gǝna ɗang. Gìr mana murǝm earkiyice ka, nda nggú-ɓata amǝ'Filisti gbǝman-mwashat, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ duk mbweban akúnì arǝ aɓi-mǝbura mala murǝm.&gt; &gt;&gt; Adyan ngga, Sawul kǝ twali ama nǝ̀ gandǝ wal-lú Dauda nǝ bù amǝ'Filisti.<verse eid="1SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Lang amǝtúró mala Sawul banggi Dauda amǝnia yì acau ka, banɓoari wi, sǝ ear ama nǝ̀ duk nkil murǝm. Sǝ kaniama pwari mǝnana à tsǝkî Dauda nǝ̀ yia bik ka, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Dauda lo wario, atārǝia andǝ aburana male, sǝ à kya wal-lú amǝ'Filisti gbǝman-ɓari. Dauda yinǝ aggú-ɓatea, sǝ yi pè murǝm, kǝla mana làkkì malea pàk ka, ace mǝnana nǝ̀ duk bura ɓoarnsarile murǝm ngga. Pǝlǝa Sawul twal ɓoarnsarile, yì Mikal, pè Dauda ɓǝ̀ duk māmí.<verse eid="1SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Lang Sawul sǝni sǝ sǝlǝ ama Yahweh na atà Dauda, sǝ ɗǝm ngga ɓoarnsarile Mikal earce Dauda ka, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />ɓangciu mǝnana Sawul ndanǝi arǝ Dauda ka, yi gul kàm kpǝm; sǝ twal a pwari mǝno ka, pǝlǝ ɓibura mala Dauda aɓalǝ anonggio kat.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Sǝ amǝ'sàrǝ̀ban mala amǝ'lwa mala amǝ'Filisti camarǝ pur lwa arǝ Isǝrayila; sǝ a koya munǝo ka, Dauda kum lidǝmba kútì acili amǝgulo mala amǝ'lwa mala Sawul kat. Sǝ mǝnia ka, tsǝa lullǝ Dauda zǝ́kí.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Sawul ɓariki nǝ̀ wal-lú Dauda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Pǝlǝa Sawul banggi muna-ɓwabura male Jonatan andǝ amǝtúró male kat, ama ɓǝà wal-lú Dauda. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa kúrè 18 mǝsǝi 1 mala malǝmce man.</char></note>Sǝama Jonatan ngga kǝ̀ earce Dauda kǝ̀rkǝ́r. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Sǝ Jonatan ne Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Tárrám Sawul kǝ alte nǝ̀ wal-luio. Acemani ka, ida tsǝkiro liwi nǝ dǝmbari. Alta ban sǝmbǝrǝa, do a banì. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Mǝ nǝ puro, sǝ mǝ nǝ cam a nkanggari tárrám a patal, a ban mǝnana a nda kam ngga. Mǝ nǝ banggi tárrám cau amuro. Sǝ cau mǝnana kat ǝn ok ka, mǝ nǝ banggo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Nda Jonatan ne tárrí cau mǝɓoarne amúr Dauda ka. Banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ murǝm ɓǝ̀kǝa pàkki guro male Dauda cauɓikea ɗàng, acemǝnana pàkkô cauɓikea ɗàng. A kún mani ka, agir mǝnana peǎ ka à yinanǝ mǝɓoarne a bano. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Twal yilǝmi a kún bui lang wal-lú ɓwa'Filisti, sǝ Yahweh pè Isǝrayila kat nggea limurǝm ngga. We nǝ nggearǝo ka a sǝni sǝ banɓoaro. Palang sǝ awu nǝ pàk cauɓikea arǝ nkila mala mǝ'kunpwasǝa, nǝ wal-lú Dauda mǝnana pàkkô kǝ mǝɓane raka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Pǝlǝa Sawul kwakikiri arǝ cau mala Jonatan, sǝ kángir ama, &lt;&lt;Mbak-kàngkàng Yahweh nakam ngga, à pà nǝ̀ wal-lú Dauda ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Nda Jonatan tunǝ Dauda sǝ ne wi acau mǝnia kat ka. Pǝlǝa Jonatan yinǝ Dauda aban Sawul, sǝ Dauda lidǝmba nǝ pàkkî Sawul túró kǝla mǝnana a dǝmbe ka.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Munǝo lo ɗǝm anre ka amǝ'Filisti andǝ amǝ'Isǝrayila. Sǝ Dauda puro oa munǝo arǝ amǝ'Filisti, sǝ walia nǝ nggea walban, gandǝa amǝ'Filisti ɓanggi wi. <verse eid="1SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Pǝlǝa ɓè bangŋo mǝɓike<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bangŋo mǝɓike </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni gbal aɓa kúrè 16 mǝsǝi 14 mala malǝmce man.</char></note> pùr nǝban Yahweh sǝ sulǝ amúr Sawul. Sawul naban dumnǝdo a ɓala male nǝ nzo male a buì, sǝ Dauda ka ndaban wal jerang. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Pǝlǝa Sawul ɓariki ama nǝ̀ tǝm Dauda nǝ nzo, nǝ̀ laptǝi arǝ bumkurǝm, sǝama Dauda vwaki, sǝ putǝlì ɓadǝm Sawul, sǝ nzo wario kya tǝm bumkurǝm. Nǝ du mala pwari mǝno ka, Dauda ɓangŋa auwa.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Sawul tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân a ɓala mala Dauda ace mǝnana ɓǝà tsǝkmǝsǝia arǝì, sǝ ɓǝà wal-lui nǝ dǝmbari. Pǝlǝa Mikal mālá Dauda, banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ a ɓangŋa a amsǝ yilǝmo nǝ dù man raka, liwi ka, à nǝ̀ wal-luio!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Nda Mikal sulǝ Dauda a nzali nǝban mǝsǝkurǝm, pǝlǝa ɓangŋa o auwa.<verse eid="1SA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Pǝlǝa Mikal twal ɓǝ̀nzál,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ɓǝ̀nzál </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;nkúl ɓala&gt;&gt;</char></note> sǝ nongsǝi amúr kpamgbang-nongŋo. Sǝ tsǝki wi gìr-loasǝmúrû mala nyang mbul a ban ɓamuri, sǝ kumsǝi wi nggubyau. <verse eid="1SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Lang Sawul tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân ɓǝà kya bwal Dauda ka, Mikal nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Dauda pà jam ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Pǝlǝa Sawul nyesǝ amǝ'na-túrbân ama ɓǝà kya sǝn Dauda nǝ nggearǝia. Banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu twali wu yinǝam nǝi amúr kpamgbang-nongŋo male, ace mǝnana mǝ wal-luí ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Lang amǝ'na-túrbân wari ka, à kum ɓǝ̀nzál na aban nongŋo amúr kpamgbang-nongŋo andǝ gìr-loasǝmúrû mala nyang mbul a ban ɓamuri.<verse eid="1SA 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Sawul banggi Mikal ama, &lt;&lt;Palang sǝ a swarkiam anggo, sǝ a nying ɓiam-mǝbura ɓangŋa o?&gt;&gt; Mikal eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Dauda banggam ama ɓǝ̀n bwali wi purî ɓala raka, nǝ̀ wal-luem.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Lang Dauda ɓangŋǝna sǝ auna ka, wari aban Samuyila a Rama, sǝ ne wi gìr mǝnana kat Sawul pàkki wi ka. Pǝlǝa yì andǝ Samuyila o, sǝ à kya do a Nayot.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nayot </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko muna-là mala amǝ'ɓangnǝa.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Cau yiu aban Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, Dauda na a Nayot a Rama.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Nda Sawul tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân ɓǝ̀ à kya bwal Dauda. Sǝama lang à wari ka, à kya kum nggǝsan mala amǝ'ɓangnǝa aban nakiacau ɓangnǝa, sǝ Samuyila nakam aban came abanì kǝla ɓwamǝgule amúrià. Bangŋo mala Ɓakuli sulǝ amúr amǝ'na-túrbân mala Sawul mǝno, sǝ à nacau ɓangnǝa gbal. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Lang à banggi Sawul gìr mǝnana kum amǝ'na-túrbân male ka, nyare Sawul tasǝ aɓea amǝ'na-túrbân, sǝ yià gbal ka à nacau ɓangnǝa. Sawul tasǝ tàruia amǝ'na-túrbân ɗǝm, sǝ yià gbal ka à kya kútí a nacau ɓangnǝa. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />A masǝlǝate ka, Sawul lo nǝ nggearǝì wari a Rama. Lang yi bingŋǝna ban tūli-mùr mǝgule mǝnana a Seku ka, ɗìban ama, &lt;&lt;Samuyila andǝ Dauda na ke?&gt;&gt; À eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;À nda a Nayot, a Rama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Pǝlǝa Sawul wari a Nayot a Rama. Bangŋo mala Ɓakuli sulǝ amurí gbal; kǝ nacau ɓangnǝa sǝ kǝ gya aban ká she lang yina a Nayot a Rama ka. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Yale swárki agir-nggūrǝì, sǝ nacau ɓangnǝa aɓadǝm Samuyila. Sawul nong gbǝrangtang aɓa pwari mǝno kat andǝ dù mǝno kat. Acemani ka, aɓwana ɗiban ama, &lt;&lt;Sawul gbal ka, nda aɓalǝ amǝ'ɓangnǝa le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Dauda andǝ Jonatan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Pǝlǝa Dauda ɓangŋa nying Nayot a Rama. Wari aban Jonatan sǝ ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Mana ǝn pàk le? Ya cauɓikea na ǝn pa? A ya njar sǝ ǝn pàkki tárró cauɓikea mǝnana tsǝa sǝ ndaban alte ama nǝ̀ twal yilǝmem ngga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Jonatan eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓakuli twalbani; a pà nǝ wù ɗàng! Tárrám kǝ banggam koya gìr mǝnana nǝ̀ pàk ka, ko mǝgule ko mǝkyauwe. Sǝ palang sǝ tárrám nǝ̀ sǝmbǝ́rǝàm cau mǝnia ka? Mǝnia yì cau ka, pa anggo ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Sǝ Dauda na ama: &lt;&lt;Mǝsǝtacau ǝn kánbo, Tárró sǝlǝna ama, ǝn kumǝna earmúrú a bano, acemani ka pà nǝ̀ banggo cê ɗàng, acemǝnana ɓǝ̀ kǝa lulbumo raka. Sǝama ǝn nggǝ banggo, mbak-kàngkàng Yahweh nakam, sǝ a nda nǝyilǝmu ka, twalkusǝu mwashat na anrem sǝnǝ lú!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Jonatan ne Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Gìr mǝnana a banggam ngga, mǝ nǝ̀ pàkkô wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Dauda banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Liwi ka lamsan mala <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 10:10">Ɓal 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:11">28:11</ref></char>.</note>Bǝsa Zongŋo na, sǝ dumǝnam púp mǝ nǝ do aban ligirlina atà murǝm a kpamgbang-lǐ male; sǝama ǝn nggǝ earce nǝma wu nyem mǝ kya sǝmbǝrǝ a patal, twal ado aban ká pwarikpǝra mala tàruia nongŋo. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Ɓǝ̀ tárró ɗiban amuram ngga, awu nǝ banggi wi ama, &lt;Dauda zǝm njar abanam tsuk-tsuk ama mǝ ɗeki nǝ̀ ɓangŋa nǝ̀ ká a nggea-là male a Betalami, acemǝnana pà gìr'nkila mala koya pǝlǝa na kam ace amǝ'ɓala malea puppup.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Ɓǝ̀ bang ama, &lt;Mǝɓoarne na&gt; ka, lǝmdǝ ama guro mo pà aɓa ká-mǝɓane ɗàng. Sǝama ɓǝ̀ bumi lul kǝ̀rkǝ́r ka, sǝlǝ ama shamna nǝ̀ pàkkam mǝɓane. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Ace mani ka, awu nǝ̀ lǝmdǝam, mim guro mò, pěmǝɓoarne, acemǝnana a yina nǝi aɓa kùrcau nǝ we aɓadǝm Yahweh. Ɓǝ̀ mǝ ndanǝ cauɓikea amuram ngga, we nǝ nggearǝo ka wal-luim, kǝa kyan nǝ mim aban tárró ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Jonatan ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ Ɓakuli twalbani! Ɓǝ̀ ǝn sǝlǝ ama tárrám shamna nǝ̀ wal-luio ka, pà mǝ nǝ banggo re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Osso Dauda ɗì Jonatan ama, &lt;&lt;Yana nǝ̀ banggam, ɓǝ̀ tárró nyesǝô cau nǝ bumlulla ka?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Jonatan banggi Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Yiu ɓǝ̀ sǝm o a patal.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 20:11">Lang à warina a patal ka, <verse eid="1SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Jonatan banggi Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Yahweh Ɓakuli mala Isǝrayila nǝ̀ duk mǝ'nakún mem. Liwi nǝ bu-pwari kǝla man ko liawo ka, mǝ nǝ nacau nǝ tárrám ace súrǝ̀ mana nda ɗenyicau male amuro. Ɓǝ̀ tárrám ngga ndanǝ ɓabum mala lǝmdǝo earmúrú ka, mǝ nǝ túrban nǝ cau ɓǝà banggo. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Sǝ ɓǝ̀ tárrám nanǝ ɓabum mala pakko mǝɓane ka, ɓǝ̀ Yahweh ɓashiam, yì mǝnana ɓǝ̀ ǝn banggo cè, sǝ ǝn tasǝo a o aɓa dorǝpwala raka. Ɓǝ̀ Yahweh pa atò kǝla mǝnana pà atà tárrám ngga. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Ado mǝnana mǝ ndanǝ yilǝmu piu ka, lǝmdǝam pěmǝɓoarne aɓa earcearǝu mala Yahweh; sǝ ɓǝ̀ ǝn wú ka, <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />a pà wunǝ tamsǝ lǝmdǝì ɓala mem mǝnia yì pěmǝɓoarne ka ɗàng tàtǝ́k; awo, ko anzǝm mǝnana Yahweh twalnata aɓio-mǝbura kàng a ɓanza ka, ɓǝ̀ lidǝmba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Nda Jonatan kùrcau nǝ ɓala mala Dauda, sǝ bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ Yahweh sulǝ ɓashi male amur aɓiu-mǝbura mala Dauda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Jonatan nyare kùrcau ɗǝm nǝ Dauda atàcau mala earcearǝu mǝnana ndanǝi arǝì ka. Yale Jonatan earce Dauda kǝla mǝnana earce yilǝmi ka. <verse eid="1SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Jonatan ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Liwi ka nda lamsan mala Bǝsa Zongŋo; à nǝ̀ alto sǝ à pà nǝ̀ sǝno ɗàng, acemǝnana buno mô ka nǝ̀ nong atàrǝì. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Liawo ka, awu nǝ̀ nyar akaurǝa awu nǝ yiu a ban mǝnana a sǝmbǝrǝ kam, a pwari mǝnana gìr mǝnia kat ka tite nǝi ka. Awu nǝ sǝmbǝrǝ a nkanggari tali Ezel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a nkanggari tali Ezel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;a ban mǝnana à ramba atali ka.&gt;&gt;</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Mǝ nǝ̀ túr amundi tàrú a ban talî, kǝla ɓè gìr na ǝn nggǝ earce tè ka. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Pǝlǝa mǝ nǝ túr muna ɓǝ̀ kya alamta amundinì. Ɓǝ̀ ǝn banggi wi ama, &lt;Sǝni, amundinì na kana atà buo man ngga, pwania, sǝ wu nyare wu yiu&gt; ka, ndaban lǝmdǝ ama awu nǝ auwa, sǝ kǝgìr mǝɓane pà nǝ̀ peo ɗang, mbak-kàngkàng Yahweh nakam ngga. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Sǝama ɓǝ̀ ǝn banggi muna ama, &lt;Sǝni, amundinì ndako a dǝmba nǝ we&gt; ka, lo o. Mǝno ka ndaban lǝmdǝ ama Yahweh tasǝnato wu o. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Amúr cau mǝnana sǝm bangŋi sǝnǝ we ka, Yahweh nda mǝ'nakún anre sǝm tàtǝ́k.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Nda Dauda sǝmbǝrǝ a patal ka. Lang lamsan mala Bǝsa Zongŋo yina ka, murǝm yi dumnǝdo ace ligirlina. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Murǝm do a bando male mǝnana dukiyi kam pwari-pwari ka, a ban mǝnana nda arǝ bumkurǝm sǝ kǝ sǝn ɓamǝsǝarǝia andǝ bando mala Jonatan ngga; sǝ Abǝna ka nda a bando male a nkanggari Murǝm. Sǝama bando mala Dauda ka, kǝɓwa pà kàm ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Kat andǝ amani ka, Sawul na kǝ cau a pwari mǝno ɗàng, acemǝnana pàk ɗenyicau ama, &lt;&lt;Earka ɓè gìr kumǝnaban mǝnana tsǝ̀ngŋǝ́nà Dauda nda aɓa ɓeami ka, ɓafo nda aɓa ɓeami.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Sǝama lang ban fana, a ɓaria nongŋo mala lamsan mala Bǝsa Zongŋo ka, bando mala Dauda ka ndakam piu atàrǝì. Sǝ Sawul ɗì muna-ɓwabura male Jonatan ama, &lt;&lt;Mana tsǝa sǝ muna-ɓwabura mala Jeshi yiu a ligirlina yilung andǝ yalung ɗàng?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Jonatan earî Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Dauda zǝmbam tsuk-tsuk ama mǝ pe wi njar nǝ̀ ká Betalami. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Banggam ama, &lt;Earâm mǝ kyane, acemǝnana amǝ'ɓala ma'sǝm ndanǝ pà gìr'nkila a nggea-là ma'sǝm, sǝ mǝ'eambǝam ɓuaki arǝàm ama mǝ kyane. Adyan ngga, ɓǝ̀ ǝn kumǝna earmúrú a bano ka, nyem mǝ kyane, ace mǝnana mǝ kya sǝn amǝ'eambǝam ngga.&gt; Mǝnia ka, nda gìr mǝnana tsǝa sǝ Dauda yiu a ligirlina mala murǝm raka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Bum Sawul lul arǝ Jonatan, sǝ ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;We muna mala mā-bwena sǝ mā-gandǝban! Ən sǝlǝ mbak ama a twalna pù'atà muna-ɓwabura mala Jeshi, ace pè nggó andǝ ɓamuro kǝsǝkya re? <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Ɓǝ̀ muna-ɓwabura mala Jeshi lidǝmba nǝdo nǝyilǝmu a ɓanza ka, a pà wunǝ duk murǝm ko awu nǝ yálmúr kǝ domurǝm ɗàng. Ado ka, tasǝ aburana ɓǝà kya yinǝam nǝi. Acemǝnana dumǝna púp à nǝ̀ wal-lui!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Jonatan nyesǝi tárrí cau ama, &lt;&lt;Man tsǝa sǝ à nǝ̀ wal-lui? Mana pàk le?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Pǝlǝa Sawul túr nzo arǝ Jonatan ama nǝ̀ tǝmi. Nda Jonatan sǝlǝa ama ɓafo tárrí shamna bumi ama nǝ̀ wal-lú Dauda ka. <verse eid="1SA 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Jonatan loapi ban ligirlina nǝ bumlulla. Li girlina a ɓaria pwari mala lamsan mala Bǝsa Zongŋo mǝno ɗàng, acemǝnana bumikiɗiki ace gìr kǝsǝkya mǝnana tárrí pàk arǝ Dauda ka.<verse eid="1SA 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Nǝ dǝmbari ka, Jonatan puro andǝ muna atè, sǝ à o patal ace je male andǝ Dauda. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Banggi muna ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓangŋa, kya alta amundi mǝnana ǝn túriá ka.&gt;&gt; Lang muna ɓangŋa nǝ̀ ká ka, Jonatan túr ɓè mundi a dǝmba nǝ munê. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Lang muna bingŋǝna ban mǝnana Jonatan túr mundi sǝ mundi kpa kam ngga, Jonatan loasǝ gì ne muna ama, &lt;&lt;Mundinì pà a dǝmba a ɓadǝmbo re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Jonatan loasǝ gì banggi muna ama, &lt;&lt;Farǝo! Kya akaurǝa! Kǝa cam ɗàng!&gt;&gt; Muna mala Jonatan tàrki amundinì, sǝ nyar aban mǝtala-ɓala male. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />(Sǝama muna súrǝ̀ kǝ cau amur gìr mǝnia ka ɗàng. Kǝ Jonatan andǝ Dauda na à súrǝ̀ gìr mana kǝ u ka.) <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Pǝlǝa Jonatan pè muna nta andǝ amundi male, sǝ ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Kyane, nyesǝ agir mǝnia ka a là.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Anzǝm mǝnana munê umna ka, Dauda purî ban mǝnana sǝmbǝrǝ kam a nkanggari ban ramba mala atali ka, kūndǝ nǝ ɓamǝsǝi a nzali, sǝ timuri kusǝ tàrú. Pǝlǝa à kùr rǝarǝia zǝp, sǝ à ɓua. Ɓua mala Dauda kútì mala Jonatan. <verse eid="1SA 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Jonatan banggi Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;O aɓa dorǝpwala, acemǝnana sǝm kǝm ngga, sǝm kánagìr aɓa lullǝ Yahweh ama, &lt;Yahweh nǝ̀ duk mǝ'nakún anrem sǝnǝ we, sǝ anre ka amuna sǝm andǝ amǝ'kà sǝm.&gt; &gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa Dauda lo o, sǝ Jonatan nyar a là.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Dauda andǝ bǝredi mǝfele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Pǝlǝa Dauda wari aban Ahimelek pǝris mǝnana ndanǝdo a Nop ka. Ahimelek pur nǝ rǝɓǝla ace kum Dauda, sǝ ɗi ama, &lt;&lt;Mana tsǝa sǝ a nda nǝmurǝo, sǝ kǝɓwa pà atò ɗàng?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Sǝ Dauda eari Ahimelek, pǝris ama, &lt;&lt;Murǝm tasǝam ace túrô mǝnana ama mǝ pak ka, sǝ nam ama, &lt;Kǝɓwa ɓǝ̀ kǝa sǝlǝce kǝ gìr amur túrô mǝnana ǝn tasǝo ace, sǝ ǝn no wu pak ka ɗàng. Alaggana mem ngga, ǝn bangŋǝnia wia ban mǝnana ɓǝà kyan kàm ngga.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Ado ka, mana à ndanǝi a buo? Pam agbatali bǝredi tongno, ko gìr mǝnana kat a ndanǝi ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Pǝlǝa pǝris pè Dauda eare ama, &lt;&lt;Ən panǝ bǝredi mǝnana nda ace koyan ngga ɗàng, shekǝ bǝredi mǝnana nda ace Ɓakuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bǝredi mǝnana nda ace Ɓakuli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;bǝredi mǝfele&gt;&gt;</char></note> ka. Mǝ nǝ gandǝ po, ɓǝ̀ alaggana mô nong nǝ amamǝna adyan-tù raka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Dauda eari pǝris ama, &lt;&lt;Aɓa mǝsǝcau, à tamsǝ sǝm arǝ amamǝna, aɓalǝ anongŋo tàrú mǝnia ka, kǝla mǝnana sǝm pakkiyi ka. A koya pwari sǝ ǝn pur ka, alaggana mem kǝ pǝndǝki rǝia nǝ amamǝna ɗang, ko ɓǝ̀ twalbǝri ma'sǝm ngga, mǝfele na raka. Sǝ mǝnia yalung mǝnana twalbǝri ma'sǝm ngga, mala túrô mǝfele na ka, à pà nǝ̀ pǝndǝki rǝia ɗàng!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Nda pǝris pe wi bǝredi mǝfele ka, acemǝnana kǝ ɓè bǝredi pà kàm abanì ɗàng, shekǝ bǝredi mala Ɓadǝm Yahweh,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bǝredi mala Ɓadǝm Yahweh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 24:8">Pǝris 24:8</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 24:9">9</ref></char>.</note> mǝnana à pusǝì a ɓadǝm Yahweh, a pwari mǝnana à twali sǝ à nggaɗi nǝ bǝredi mǝnana bǝsa na arǝì ka.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Ɓè ɓwabura aɓalǝ aguro mala Sawul na kam a banì a mǝno yì pwari ka; à kasǝkuni aɓadǝm Yahweh. Lùllǝì nda Dowe ɓwa'Edom. Nda múr ayálgír mala Sawul. <verse eid="1SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Dauda banggi Ahimelek ama, &lt;&lt;A ndanǝ nzo ko nggeabyau kani a buo le? Ən yinǝ nggeabyau mem ko ɓè kǝ girbura mem ɗang, acemǝnana túrô mǝnana murǝm túrǎm ɓǝn pe ka, kǝ earce ama ɓǝà pè tsuk-tsuk.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Pǝlǝa pǝris ear ama, &lt;&lt;Nggeabyau mala Golaya ɓwa'Filisti mana a wal-luí a Ɓangŋaban Ela ka, ndakani; à marǝki nǝ nggurbyau sǝ à tsǝi anzǝm efot. Ɓǝ̀ a kǝ earce ka, twali, acemǝnana ɓè kǝ nggeabyau pa akani ɗang shekǝ mǝno.&gt;&gt; Sǝ Dauda bang ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ɓè pa kǝla yì ɗang, pami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dauda ɓangŋa o a Gat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Pǝlǝa Dauda lo, ɓanggi ban Sawul a mǝno yi pwari ka. O aban Akish murǝm Gat. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Amǝ'túró mala Akish ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia ka nda Dauda, murǝm mala nzalinì re? Yì nda ɓwa mǝnana à <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 18:7">1Sam 18:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 29:5">29:5</ref></char>.</note>tu'nggyal nǝ akiarǝia aɓa nggwam, à kǝ na ama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 21:11">&lt;&lt;Sawul walna á-á male,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 21:11">sǝ Dauda walna á-á lum male ka re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Sǝ Dauda tsǝk acau mǝnia ka a ɓabumi, sǝ ɓangciu bwali kǝ̀rkǝ́r arǝ Akish, murǝm Gat. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Nggaɗi ɓeali aɓadǝmbia, sǝ acemǝnana nda a ɓabuia ka, ɓosǝki rǝì kǝla mǝmúrpǝlǝa, kǝ cangi rǝ akún bankutio, sǝ nying ntāra kúni kǝ solǝ a mbotakuni. <verse eid="1SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Pǝlǝa Akish ne amǝ'túró male ama, &lt;&lt;Wu sǝni, ɓwabure ka ɓanggina! Mana tsǝa sǝ wu yinǝi abanam? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Ən ɗwanyi amǝɓanggya sǝ wu yinǝam nǝ mǝnia yì ɓwa ka ɓǝ̀ kǝ pakki agir kǝla mǝɓanggya aɓadǝmbam le? Dumǝna púp ama mǝnia yì ɓwa ka nǝ̀ yiu a ɓala mem le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Dauda o a Adulam andǝ Mizpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Pǝlǝa Dauda nying Gat, sǝ ɓangŋa o a npu mala Adullam. Lang amǝ'eambi andǝ amǝ'ɓala mala tárrí kat ok cè ka, à wari kano a baní. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Aɓwana mana kat à nda aɓata parban, ko nǝ tangna amúrià, ko amana bumia pwasǝ raka, à wario, à ram rǝia a baní, sǝ duk mǝ'sàrǝ̀ban amúrià. Ndanǝ aburana kǝla gbǝman-ine atè.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Sǝ Dauda loapi ban mǝno ka, o a Mizpa a nzali Mowap. Akano ka, banggi murǝm Mowap ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, earâm ɓǝ ǝn nying tárrám andǝ nggem ɓǝà duk kani atò, she ɓǝ̀n súrǝ́nà rǝ gir mǝnana Ɓakuli nǝ pa acem ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Nda Dauda nyia à do atà murǝm mala Mowap ka; à do atè arǝ apwari mǝnana kat Dauda na aban sǝmbǝrǝ a ban-mǝcandǝe ka.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Pǝlǝa mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli, mana à tunǝki ama Gad ka, banggi Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝa duk kani a ban-mǝcandǝe ɗàng. Lo o aɓa nzali Yahuda.&gt;&gt; Nda Dauda nying banì, sǝ o a ndà-nggun a Heret ka.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawul wal-lú apǝris a Nop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Adyan ngga, Sawul yi ok ama, ban mǝnana Dauda andǝ aɓwana male na kam ngga, à kumǝni. A pwari mǝno ka Sawul na aban dumnǝdo, nǝ nkongŋo a buì, a tǝr nggun zāmbo, amur ɓè mgbangban a Gibiya, atārǝia andǝ amǝgulo male kat, aban came a nkanggari. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Pǝlǝa Sawul banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu kwakikir wun, wun aburana mala Benjami! Wu kǝ sǝni kǝla muna-ɓwabura mala Jeshi nǝ̀ pè koyan atà wun ngga aɓaban-rya andǝ aɓaban mala anggun-anap le? Wu kǝ sǝni kǝla nǝ̀ tsǝk wun kat, wun nǝ̀ duk amǝdǝmba mala aɓwana á-pas andǝ amǝdǝmba mala aɓwana gbǝman-pas le? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Mǝnia ka, nda gìr mǝnana tsǝa sǝ wu kpapikunarǝ wun amuram ngga re? Ko kǝ ɓwa mwashat banggam, lang muna-ɓwabura mem kurkunarǝia andǝ muna-ɓwabura mala Jeshi ka ɗàng. Yale kǝ ɓwa pà kàm atà wun mana kǝ ɗenyinǝ mim, ko nǝ̀ banggam ama, muna-ɓwabura mem soakita mǝturo mem ɓǝ̀ kùmsǝ arǝàm, amur njar, kǝla mana kǝ pàk yalung ngga ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Pǝlǝa Dowe, ɓwa'Edom, mana nda aban came atà amǝgulo mala Sawul ka, bang ama: &lt;&lt;Ən sǝn muna-ɓwabura mala Jeshi, yiu aban Ahimelek, muna-ɓwabura mala Ahitup mana a Nop ka. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Pǝlǝa Ahimelek ɗì Yahweh ace súrǝ̀ gir mǝnana Dauda nǝ̀ pàk ka; ɗǝm ngga pè wi girlina, andǝ nggeabyau mala Golaya, ɓwa'Filisti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Pǝlǝa murǝm túrban ɓǝà tunǝ pǝris Ahimelek, muna-ɓwabura mala Ahitup, andǝ aburana mǝnana kat amǝɓala male na, sǝ à nda ka apǝris a Nop ka. Sǝ yia kat ka, à yiu aban murǝm. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Pǝlǝa Sawul bang ama, &lt;&lt;Kwakikiro ado, we muna-ɓwabura mala Ahitup.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa yì ka, pa eare ma, &lt;&lt;E, ɓwamǝgule mem.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Sawul banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Palang sǝ wu kpapikunarǝ wun amuram, we, wunǝ mǝno yì muna-ɓwabura mala Jeshi ka. A pe wi girlina andǝ nggeabyau, sǝ a ɗì Ɓakuli aceì, mǝnana tsǝa longŋǝna arǝàm ace kùmsǝâm, kǝla mǝno kǝ pàk yalung ngga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Pǝlǝa Ahimelek pe murǝm eare ama, &lt;&lt;Yana atà amǝtúró mô kat, mǝnana ndanǝ mǝsǝcau kǝla Dauda, mana nda nkil murǝm, sǝ nda ɓwamǝgule amur amǝ'yáltò, sǝ à kǝ twali nǝ gulo a ɓala mò ka? <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Sǝ mǝno yi pwari ka, nda pwari mana ǝn tita ɗì Ɓakuli aceì ka le? Awo, ɓǝ̀ murǝm ɓǝkǝa tsǝki guro male cau arǝì ko arǝ kǝ ɓwa atà amǝɓala mala tárrí ɗàng. Mim guro mò ka, ǝn súrǝ̀ kǝgir amur mǝnia yì gìr kat ka ɗàng, ko bǝti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Sǝ murǝm ngga, bang ama, &lt;&lt;Dumǝna púp, awu nǝ wǔ, we Ahimelek, andǝ amǝɓala mala tárró kat!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Osso murǝm banggi amǝ'yáltè mana à cam a nkanggari ka, ama, &lt;&lt;Wu pǝlǝ rǝ wun, wu wal-luia, yia apǝris mala Yahweh, acemǝnana yia gbal ka, buia na atà Dauda! À sǝlǝna ama, kǝ ɓang nǝ ɓangŋa, sǝ à banggam ɗàng.&gt;&gt; Sǝama, amǝtúró mala murǝm ear ama, à nǝ̀ loasǝ buia, à nǝ̀ wal apǝris mala Yahweh ɗàng.<verse eid="1SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Pǝlǝa murǝm banggi Dowe ama, &lt;&lt;Pǝlǝ rǝo, wal apǝris.&gt;&gt; Nda Dowe, ɓwa'Edom, pǝlǝa sǝ wal apǝris. Wal-lú aburana lumi-tongno-nong-tàrú-bwamdǝ-tongno (85), mana à oasǝ efot mala nggubyau linǝn arǝia ka. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Ɗǝm ngga Sawul wal-lú aɓwana mǝnana à ndanǝdo a Nop, nggea-là mala apǝris ka, nǝ kún nggeabyau: aburana andǝ amamǝna, amuna andǝ abangna-muna, andǝ andá, andǝ amǝdambǝriso, andǝ anzur andǝ ambul; yià kat ka, wal-luia nǝ kún nggeabyau.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Sǝama, mwashat atà amuna-burana mala Ahimelek, muna-ɓwabura mala Ahitup mana à tunǝki ama Abiyata ka, ɓangŋa auwa, o atà Dauda. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Sǝ Abiyata kya banggi Dauda ama, Sawul walna-lú apǝris mala Yahweh. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Pǝlǝa Dauda banggi Abiyata ama, &lt;&lt;Lang ǝn sǝn Dowe, ɓwa'Edom, a mǝno yì ban a pwari mǝno ka, ǝn sǝlǝa nǝma mbak-kàngkàng, nǝ̀ nggá ne Sawul. Ado ka, mǝ nda ǝn tsǝa, sǝ à wal-lú aɓwana kat a ɓala mala tárró ka. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Duk kani atàm; cè ɓangciu pàkkô ɗàng. Ɓwa mǝnana kǝ earce ama nǝ̀ wal-luio ka, ndaban ɓariki nǝ̀ wal-luem gbal. We ka, awu nǝ kum auwa abanam.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Dauda amsǝ nggea-là Keyila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Aɓwana banggi Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, amǝ'Filisti naban munǝo arǝ nggea-là Keyila,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 15:44">Jes 15:44</ref></char>.</note> sǝ à ndaban iu mǝssa arǝ akatǝra.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Nda Dauda ɗì Yahweh ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ kya munǝ arǝ amǝ'Filisti le?&gt;&gt; Sǝ Yahweh ne Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Kyane, wal amǝ'Filisti, sǝ wu amsǝ Keyila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Sǝama aburana mala Dauda ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, akani aɓa Yahuda ka, sǝm nda aɓa ɓangciu. Gìrnî nǝ̀ ɓikipa ɓǝ̀ sǝm o a Keyila nǝ munǝo arǝ amǝ'lwa mala amǝ'Filisti ka!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Pǝlǝa Dauda nyar ɗǝm alta nê mala Yahweh amúr cê. Sǝ Yahweh nyare banggi Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Lo, kya a Keyila, acemǝnana Mǝ nǝ túr amǝ'Filisti a ɓabuo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Nda Dauda andǝ aburana male wari a Keyila, sǝ à munǝ-munǝo andǝ amǝ'Filisti. Dauda wal amǝ'Filisti nǝ walban mǝgule, sǝ à pwan agirkusǝu malea. Anggo sǝ Dauda amsǝ aɓwana mana à ndanǝdo a Keyila ka.<verse eid="1SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />(Adyan ngga Abiyata muna-ɓwabura mala Ahimelek ka ɓangŋǝna yina aban Dauda a Keyila; yina nǝ efot a bui.) <verse eid="1SA 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Aɓwana banggi Sawul ama Dauda yina a Keyila. Pǝlǝa Sawul na ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓakuli túrnì a ɓabuam; acemǝnana kasǝnakun ɓamúrì nǝ kutio male a nggea-là mǝnana ndanǝ akúnla mana à peǎ nǝ agara-bolo ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Acemani ka, Sawul tunǝ amǝ'lwa male kat, sǝ banggia wia ama, ɓǝà kya a Keyila, ɓǝà gumbǝli Dauda andǝ aburana male.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Lang Dauda ok ama Sawul naban kanì mǝɓike arǝì ka, ne Abiyata pǝris ama, &lt;&lt;Yinǝ efot kani!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Pǝlǝa Dauda pakhiwi ama, &lt;&lt;We Yahweh, Ɓakuli mala Isǝrayila, mim guro mò ka, ǝn ongŋǝna ama mbak-kàngkàng Sawul naban alte nǝ̀ yiu a Keyila ace kiɗiki nggea-lê, atàcau mem. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Aɓwana mala Keyila nǝ̀ túrǎm a ɓabui le? Sawul nǝ̀ yiu kǝla mana mim guro mò ok ka le? We Yahweh Ɓakuli mala Isǝrayila, ida banggam mim guro mò!&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa Yahweh pe wi eare ama, &lt;&lt;Sawul nǝ̀ yiu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Dauda ɗì Yahweh ama, &lt;&lt;Aɓwana mala Keyila nǝ̀ túrǎm sǝnǝ aburana mem a ɓabù Sawul le?&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa Yahweh eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;À nǝ̀ túr wun a ɓabui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Nda Dauda andǝ aburana male mǝnana lakkì malea na kǝla gbǝman-tongno-nong-mwashat (600) ka, à lo sǝ à nying Keyila; à gali arǝ abân mǝnana kat à gandǝ wari kam ngga. Lang à banggi Sawul ama Dauda ɓangŋǝna nyingŋǝna Keyila ka, tamsǝ ká male abanì.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Dauda do aɓalǝ ampù a ɓabondo, sǝ ueo aɓa nzali múr ankono a ɓabondo Zif.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 15:24">Jes 15:24</ref></char>.</note> Sawul camarǝ alta Dauda koya pwari, sǝ Ɓakuli ka, túr Dauda a ɓabuì ɗàng.<verse eid="1SA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawul pǝrta Dauda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Lang Dauda na a Horesh a ɓabondo Zif ka, ok ama Sawul purna ace alte nǝ̀ twal yilǝmi. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Sǝ Jonatan muna-ɓwabura mala Sawul lo wari aban Dauda a Horesh, sǝ ɓakɓabum Dauda ɓǝ̀ kum rǝcandǝa nǝban Ɓakuli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 30:6">1Sam 30:6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ ɓangciu ɓǝkǝa pakko ɗàng! Acemǝnana bù tárrám Sawul pà nǝ̀ kumo ɗang. Awu nǝ yálmúr Isǝrayila, sǝ mǝ nǝ duk mǝkwaɗito. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 24:20">1Sam 24:20</ref></char>.</note>Ko tárrám Sawul nǝnggearǝì ka, sǝlǝna mǝnia ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Sǝ yià mǝnia ɓari ka, à kùrcau aɓadǝm Yahweh; Dauda ueo a Horesh, sǝ Jonatan o a là.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Pǝlǝa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 26:1">1Sam 26:1</ref></char>.</note>amǝ'Zif wari aban Sawul a Gibiya sǝ à ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Dauda pà aban sǝmbǝrǝa aɓalǝ sǝm aɓa mpù a Horesh, a mgbangban mala Hakila nǝ njar-kunmur mala Jeshimon re? <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Adyan ngga, sulǝo yiu, we murǝm. A pwari mǝnana kat a earce ka, sulǝo yiu, sǝ sǝm ngga, sǝm nǝ̀ pàk gìr mǝnana sǝm nǝ̀ pàk ka, sǝm nǝ̀ tasǝì a ɓabuo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Sawul nyesǝia wia cau ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ Yahweh tsǝka wun bù, acemǝnana wu lǝ́mdǝ́nàm pěmǝɓoarne. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Ida, wu kyane, wu ɓǝltacê pepè. Wu súrǝ̀, sǝ wu sǝn ban mǝnana kǝ wari kam ngga, andǝ yana sǝni abanì, acemana à bangŋǝ́nàm ama yì ka, mǝkutan na kǝ̀rkǝ́r. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Wu sǝni, sǝ wu súrǝ̀ abân-sǝmbǝrǝa mǝnana kat kǝ sǝmbǝrǝ kam ngga; sǝ wu nyar abanam nǝ mǝsǝrǝ cau. Pǝlǝa mǝ nǝ ká sǝnǝa wun. Ɓǝ̀ nda aɓa bu-nzali man ngga, mǝ nǝ bǝlkusǝi aɓalǝ anggurkwar mala Yahuda kat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Nda aɓwana mǝno lo, sǝ à aki Sawul dǝmba aban ká a Zif ka. Adyan ngga, Dauda andǝ aburana male na a ɓabondo Mawon, a ɓawanban nǝ njar-kunmur mala Jeshimon. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Sawul andǝ aburana male wari a alta Dauda. Sǝ lang Dauda okce ka, ɓunno wari a ban mbisong, sǝ kya do a ɓabondo Mawon. Lang Sawul ok anggo ka, wari a ɓabondo Mawon ace pǝrta Dauda. <verse eid="1SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Sawul wari a buì mwashat mala nkono mana Dauda nakam ngga, sǝ Dauda andǝ aburana male ka, à nda a ɓè buì mala nkonoe. Dauda na aban farǝì nǝ̀ apî Sawul, acemǝnana Sawul andǝ aburana male ka, à ndaban ɓariki à nǝ̀ gumbǝli Dauda andǝ aburana male, ace mǝnana à nǝ̀ bwalia ka. <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />Sǝama ɓè mǝ'na-túrbân yiu aban Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Yiu akaurǝa, acemǝnana amǝ'Filisti warina nǝ munǝo arǝ aɓwana aɓa nzali ma'sǝm!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Nda Sawul nying pǝ̀rta Dauda, sǝ nyare o aban munǝo arǝ amǝ'Filisti ka. Acemani ka, à tunǝ ban mǝno ama Sela Hamalekot.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sela Hamalekot </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ka nda Mbisong mala Gauwa ko Àwá.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Pǝlǝa Dauda loapi ban mǝno ka, sǝ o kya do aɓalǝ ampù a Engedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Dauda ɓinǝ twal yilǝmi Sawul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Lang Sawul nyàrǝ́nì pǝ̀rta amǝ'Filisti a munǝo ka, aɓwana banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, Dauda na a ɓabondo Engedi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Pǝlǝa Sawul twal aburana á-tàrú mǝnana tarkia aɓa Isǝrayila kat ka, sǝ o andǝ aburana male aban alta Dauda tù a ban atali mala ambul bondo. <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Amur njar ka, yiu a ban adomwan mala anzur, sǝ abanì ka, ɓè gumi-ɓa'tali nakam. Sawul kùtí aɓalǝi ace mǝnana nǝ̀ nongŋo ace usǝlǝ aulǝa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">usǝlǝ aulǝa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibǝru bang ama ace &lt;&lt;kùmsǝ akusǝi&gt;&gt; sǝ ɓālǝi ka nda &lt;&lt;doagung.&gt;&gt;</char></note> ka. Sǝ a ɓaɓalǝu mala mǝno yì gumi-ɓa'tali ka, Dauda andǝ aburana male na kam aban sǝmbǝrǝa. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Sǝ aburana mala Dauda ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, man ngga nda pwari mǝnana Yahweh banggo ama, &lt;Mǝ nǝ tasǝ ɓio-mǝbura a ɓabuo, sǝ awu nǝ pàkki wi gìr mana a sǝni nda ɓoarô ka.&gt; &gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa Dauda lo eamdikiban sǝ kasǝ kún nggea-daura mala Sawul. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Nǝnzǝ́mò ka, ɓabum Dauda tùllì, acemǝnana kasǝ kún nggea-daura mala Sawul ka. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Dauda banggi aburana male ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ Yahweh twalbani ɓǝ̀ mǝ nǝ pàkki ɓwamǝgule mem, mana Yahweh ɗārǝi ka, mǝnia yì gìr, ama mǝ nǝ loasǝ buam arǝì ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Anggo sǝ Dauda pwanɓabum aburana male nǝ amǝnia yì acau ka, sǝ earia wia à lo arǝ Sawul nǝ munǝo ɗàng. Pǝlǝa Sawul lo, purî gumi-ɓa'tali mǝno, sǝ bwal njar o.<verse eid="1SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Anzǝm mǝno ka, Dauda lo sǝ purî gumi-ɓa'tali. Loasǝ gì tunǝ Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule mem, murǝm!&gt;&gt; Lang Sawul pǝlǝ mǝsǝi a nzǝmi ka, Dauda ɓun amúr ankūnǝi sǝ ti múrí a nzali. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Dauda banggi Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Palang sǝ a kǝ kwakikiro arǝ acau mala aɓwana ama, &lt;Dauda naban alte nǝ̀ pàkkô mǝɓane?&gt; <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />A pwari mǝnia ka, a sǝnǝni nǝ mǝsǝo ama Yahweh tasǝo yalung a ɓabuam a gumi-ɓa'tali; aɓea aɓwana bang ama ɓǝ̀n wal-luio, sǝama ǝn nyio nǝyilǝmu. Ən bang nǝma, &lt;Pà mǝ nǝ loasǝ buam arǝ ɓwamǝgule mem ɗàng, acemǝnana yì ka Yahweh ɗārǝi.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Sǝni, tárrám, kún nggea-daura mô mana ǝn kasǝi ka, ndya a buam ngga! Lang ǝn kasǝ kún nggea-daura mô ka, ǝn wal-luio ɗàng. Acemani ka, sǝlǝa sǝ ɓǝ̀ kpako ama, ǝn pà aban kanì mǝɓane ko mgbicau ɗàng. Kat andǝ amani ama ǝn pakko cauɓikea raka, a ndaban kùmsǝâm ace twal yilǝmem. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Ɓǝ̀ Yahweh pàk ɓashi anrem sǝnǝ we, sǝ ɓǝ̀ Yahweh mbweo akúnì amǝɓane mǝnana a pakkam ngga, sǝama mim ngga buam pà nǝ̀ jeo nǝ mǝɓane ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Nda kǝla cau pasǝlǝe mǝnana ɓara-ɓara ka ama, &lt;Ɓealɓikea kǝ pur nǝban amǝ'ɓealɓikea.&gt; Sǝama mim ngga, buam pà nǝ̀ jeo nǝ mǝɓane ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />Arǝ yana sǝ murǝm mala amǝ'Isǝrayila puro nǝ̀ ká munǝo? Ya ɓwa na a kǝ pǝrte? Atà luna nvwa! Atà nkungga! <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Ɓǝ̀ Yahweh duk mǝɓashi sǝ ɓǝ̀ kasǝcau anrem sǝnǝ we. Ɓǝ̀ Yahweh sǝngi ɓá cau mem sǝ ɓǝ̀ bǝlkunam, sǝ ɓǝ̀ amsǝam a ɓabuo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Lang Dauda mal ne Sawul acau man ngga, Sawul na ama, &lt;&lt;Gio nda man le, munem Dauda?&gt;&gt; Kara Sawul loasǝ gì ɓua. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Sǝ banggi Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Cauɓoarna mô kútí mem, acemǝnana a pàngŋǝ́nàm mǝɓoarne, kat andǝ amani ama ǝn pakko mǝɓike ka. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />A bangŋǝna gìr mǝɓoarne mǝnana a pàkkam a pwari mǝnia yalung ngga; Yahweh túrǎm a ɓabuo, sǝama a wal-luim ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Ɓǝ̀ ɓwa kum ɓimǝbura ka, nǝ̀ nying ɓimǝbura ɓǝ̀ u jam le? Ɓǝ̀ Yahweh mbweo akúnì nǝ mǝɓoarne ace gìr mǝɓoarne mǝnana a pàkkam, a pwari man yalung ngga. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Sǝni, adyan ngga ǝn sǝlǝna ama mbak-kàngkàng awu nǝ̀ duk murǝm, sǝ domurǝm mala Isǝrayila ka, nǝ̀ kum kusǝ came pepè a ɓabuo. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Ado ka, kánbam aɓa lullǝ Yahweh ama a pà wu nǝ̀ wal-lú amunem andǝ amǝ'kem ɗàng, sǝ a pà wu nǝ esǝki lullǝam a ɓala mala tárrám ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Nda Dauda kánbì Sawul ka. Pǝlǝa Sawul nyare o a là, sǝ Dauda andǝ aburana male nyare à o a ban sǝmbǝrǝa malea, a mpù.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s">Lú mala Samuyila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Samuyila paklú sǝ Isǝrayila kat ramba abanɓwáná, à pak-bumkiɗikea aceì, sǝ à tsǝì a ɓala male a Rama. Pǝlǝa Dauda lo wari a ɓabondo Paran.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ɓabondo Paran </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ngga nda ɓabondo Mawon.</char></note><verse eid="1SA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dauda andǝ Nabal sǝ Abigiyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Ɓè ɓwabura nakam a Mawon mǝnana nggaliki male na a Kamel ka; ɓwabure ka mǝgǝna na kǝ̀rkǝ́r. Ndanǝ anzur á-tàrú andǝ ambul á-mwashat. A bàkú mǝno ka ndaban mwa nyang anzur male a Kamel. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Lullǝ ɓwabure nda Nabal, sǝ lullǝ māmí nda Abigiyel. Mǝnia yì ɓwama ka kwaro sǝ ɓoarnsari; sǝ ɓwabure ka mǝ'lullô na sǝ mǝ'ɓealɓana na. Yì ka mǝ'kà Kalip na.<verse eid="1SA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Dauda ka nda a ɓabondo lang ok ama Nabal naban mwa nyang anzur male ka. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Pǝlǝa tasǝ alaggana lum, sǝ banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu kya a Kamel aban Nabal, sǝ wu makkìkun nǝ lullǝàm. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Pǝlǝa wun nǝ̀ banggi wi ama, &lt;Ɓǝ̀ yilǝmo sauwa, sǝ ɓǝ̀ dorǝpwala pa atò, andǝ ɓala mò andǝ koman mǝnana kat a ndanǝi ka! <verse eid="1SA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Ən ok ama aburana mò naban mwako nyang anzur mô. Mǝnana ayálgír mò na atà sǝm ngga, sǝm pàkkia wia mǝɓane ɗàng, sǝ aɓalǝ anonggio mǝnana kat à nda a Kamel ka, kǝgìr malea ɓwar ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Ɗì ka alaggana mô, sǝ yià ka, à nǝ̀ banggo. Acemani ka, eare ɓǝ̀ alaggana mem kum earmúrú a mǝsǝo, acemǝnana sǝm yiu a pwari mala lilí-banɓoarnado. Ida, pè aguro mò andǝ munio Dauda gìr mǝnana a ndanǝi ado awu nǝ gandǝnǝ pea wia ka.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Nda alaggana mala Dauda wario, sǝ à banggi Nabal acau mǝnia ka, aɓa lullǝ Dauda. Pǝlǝa à kúndǝô. <verse eid="1SA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Sǝ Nabal earî alaggana mala Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Yana nda Dauda, sǝ yana nda mǝnia yì muna-ɓwabura mala Jeshi ka? Aɓalǝ anonggio mǝnia ka, amuna-ɓala nakam pas mǝnana à ɓangŋa à nying amǝtala-ɓala malea ka. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Palang sǝ mǝ nǝ twal bǝredi mem, andǝ mùr mem, andǝ nyama mem mǝnana ǝn wal ace amǝ'mwa nyang nzur mem, sǝ mǝ nǝ pè aburana mǝnana ǝn súrǝ̀ ban mana à pùr kam raka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Nda alaggana mala Dauda wulio, à o sǝ à nyare à yi banggi wi acau mǝnia ka kat. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Pǝlǝa Dauda banggi aburana male ama, &lt;&lt;Koya ɓwabura ka ɓǝ̀ kùr rǝi nǝ nggeabyau male!&gt;&gt; Nda sǝ koya ɓwabura ateà ka, kùr rǝi nǝ nggeabyau male. Dauda gbal ka kùr rǝi nǝ nggeabyau male. Aburana kǝla gbǝman-ine o atà Dauda, sǝ aburana gbǝman-ɓari ue ace ɗenyinǝ atwalo malea.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Sǝama mwashat aɓalǝ alaggana mala Nabal ne Abigiyel, mālá Nabal ama, &lt;&lt;Dauda tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân mǝnana à pur a ɓabondo ka ace makki mǝtala-ɓala ma'sǝm kún, sǝ mǝtala-ɓala ma'sǝm ngga sanggia. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Amǝnia yì aburana ka, à pàkka sǝm mǝɓoarne kǝ̀rkǝ́r; kǝgìr mǝɓane kum sǝm ɗàng, sǝ kǝgìr ma'sǝm ɓwàr ɗàng a bàkú mǝno kat à nda atà sǝm a bondo ka. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Dù andǝ pwari, à dupa sǝm sheran, a bàkú mǝno kat sǝm nda atarǝ sǝm sǝnǝia aban yál anzur ka. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Ado ka sǝlǝa, sǝ wu pakɗenyicau amur gìr mǝnana nda ɓoaro wu pàk ka, acemǝnana gir'murmwana nakam amúr mǝtala-ɓala ma'sǝm andǝ ɓala male puppup. Sǝ yì mǝtala-ɓala ma'sǝm ngga, mǝ'ɓealɓana na, mǝnana ɓwa pà nǝ̀ gandǝnǝ nacau nǝi raka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Nda Abigiyel farǝì, sǝ twal agbatali bǝredi gbǝman-ɓari, andǝ mùr-anap bàng ɓari, andǝ nyam anzur tongno mǝnana à lambi ka, andǝ mǝssa mǝnana à kàngŋì ka tasau tongno, andǝ dangŋanshi ɓǝla-anap mǝ'ime gbǝman-mwashat, andǝ kyak mala ɓǝla vwari gbǝman-ɓari, sǝ nongsǝia a nzǝm amǝdambǝriso. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Pǝlǝa ne amǝtúró male ama, &lt;&lt;Wu akàm dǝmba wu kyane. Mǝ nǝ kpata wun.&gt;&gt; Sǝama banggi burí, Nabal ɗàng.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Lang Abigiyel naban o a nzǝm mǝdambǝriso male sǝ yi sulǝ a ɓangŋaban anre ka ankono ka, kara sǝn Dauda andǝ aburana male ndya à kǝ sulǝ aban yiu nǝbani ka, sǝ à yi je. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Dauda ka bangŋǝni aburana male ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝsǝcau, nda ɓà sǝ ǝn yál gìr mǝnana kat mala ɓwabura mǝnia na ka a ɓabondo. Kǝɓwa iu kǝgir mǝnana male na ka ɗàng, sǝ ado ka, nyesǝnàm mǝɓike a kúnì mǝɓoarne. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Ɓǝ̀ Ɓakuli ɓashiam kǝ̀rkǝ́r, mim Dauda, ɓǝ̀ li nǝ dǝmbari, ǝn nying ko ɓwabura mwashat nǝyilǝmu piu, atà aɓwana mǝnana amale na ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Lang Abigiyel sǝn Dauda ka, sulǝî nzǝm mǝdambǝriso akaurǝa, sǝ ɓunno sǝ ti múrí a nzali aɓadǝm Dauda. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Kpa a kusǝ Dauda, sǝ bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule mem, ɓǝ̀ cauɓikê pa amuram! Sǝama ida earâm, mim guro mò, mǝ nacau nǝ we! Kwakikiro arǝ cau mem, mim guro mò! <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Ida, ɓwamǝgule mem, kǝa tsǝkiro arǝ mǝnia yì mǝ'ɓealɓana, yì Nabal ka ɗàng, acemǝnana kǝla mǝnana lùllǝì pàk ka, anggo sǝ yì gbal ka pa. Lùllǝì nda Nabal,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nabal </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ka ɓālǝi nda gǝmi.</char></note> sǝ gǝm ɓwa na; sǝama mim, guro mò ka, ǝn sǝn alaggana mǝnana we ɓwamǝgule mem, a tasǝ ka ɗàng.<verse eid="1SA 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />&lt;&lt;Adyan ngga, ɓwamǝgule mem, mbak-kàngkàng Yahweh nakam, sǝ a nda kam nǝyilǝmu ka, Yahweh nda mǝnana tamsǝo arǝ sukki nkila andǝ mbweban akúnì gìr mǝnana à pàkkô ka. Acemani ka, ɓǝ̀ aɓiomǝbura andǝ aɓwana mana à kǝ alta pàkkô mǝɓane ka, pà kǝla Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Adyan ngga, ɓwamǝgule mem, ak mǝnia yì ɓoro, mim guro mò ǝn yinǝi ka, ace mǝnana wu pè alaggana mǝnana à nda atò ka. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Ida twalî guro mò ban cauɓikea male. Mǝnia ka nda acemǝnana mbak-kàngkàng Yahweh ka, nǝ̀ tamsǝkusǝ ɓala mala ɓwamǝgule mem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nǝ̀ tamsǝkusǝ ɓala mala ɓwamǝgule mem </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;nǝ̀ yál ɓwamǝgule mem andǝ amǝ'ɓala male tàtǝ́k&gt;&gt;</char></note> Sǝ acemǝnana ɓwamǝgule mem na arǝ munǝ amunǝo mala Yahweh ka, ɓǝà kǝa kum kǝ mǝɓike aɓalǝo ɗàng aɓa do-yilǝmu mô kat. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Ɓǝ̀ kǝɓwa lo ama nǝ̀ pǝrto ace twal yilǝmo ka, Yahweh Ɓakuli mô nǝ̀ mbuɓi yilǝmo aɓa luru yilǝmu male a baní. Sǝ yilǝmi aɓiomǝbura ka, nǝ̀ túrí kǝla túr tali nǝ ntamso. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Sǝ lang Yahweh pàngŋǝ́nì ɓwamǝgule mem koya gìr mǝɓoarne mǝnana pàcau ace amuro, sǝ twalǝno a dumǝna murǝm amúr Isǝrayila ka, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />ɓwamǝgule mem pà nǝ̀ kum bumkiɗikea, ko múr-halǝkya ama a sukkina nkila mala amǝ'kunpwasǝa ko mala mbweban akúnì gìr mǝnana à pàkkô ka ɗàng. Sǝ lang Yahweh pano limurǝm ngga, ɗenyinǝ guro mò.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Pǝlǝa Dauda ne Abigiyel ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwangsǝban ɓǝ̀ pa aban Yahweh, Ɓakuli mala Isǝrayila, mǝnana tasǝo yalung ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm yi je ka! <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Tsǝkbu ɓǝ̀ pa amúr kwaro mò! Sǝ ɓǝ̀ Yahweh tsǝko bù, mǝnana a mgbaliam yalung arǝ sukki nkila, sǝ arǝ nyesǝ mǝɓane a kúnì mǝɓane ka. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Ɓǝ̀ ana raka, mbak-kàngkàng Yahweh Ɓakuli mala Isǝrayila nakam, mǝnana tamsǝam arǝ pakko mǝɓane ka, ɓǝ̀ a yiuma akaurǝa raka, ɓǝ́ kaniama ban nǝ̀ kwar ka, kǝɓwa pà kàm nǝ̀ ue nǝyilǝmu atà aburana mala Nabal ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Pǝlǝa Dauda ak agir mǝnana Abigiyel yinǝi wi ka, sǝ ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Nyare o a ɓala mò aɓa dorǝpwala. Sǝni, ǝn ongŋǝna cau mò, sǝ ǝn pano gìr mǝnana a zǝm ngga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Lang Abigiyel nyar ka, yi kum Nabal ramna aɓwana a ɓala male aban lili-banɓoarnado, ulang lili-banɓoarnado mala amurǝma. Nabal ka ɓabumi na aɓa pakkiɗire sǝ mba-walni kǝ̀rkǝ́r. Acemani ka, Abigiyel ne wi kǝcau ɗàng she lang ban fana ka. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Nǝ dǝmbari lang Nabal nyarǝna aɓa hakkilo male ka, māmí Abigiyel banggi wi acau mǝnia kat; kara ɓabum Nabal tùmùr, yilǝmi o, sǝ shǐ kǝla tali. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Anzǝm nongŋo lum ngga, Yahweh koè, kara wǔ.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Lang Dauda ongŋǝna ama Nabal wuna ka, bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwangsǝban ngga ɓǝ̀ pa aban Yahweh, mǝnana bǝlnakunam amúr gìr-kǝsǝkya mǝnana Nabal pàkkam, sǝ tamsǝnam, mim guro male, arǝ mǝɓike ka. Yahweh nyesǝ́nì Nabal túró-mǝɓike male a múrí.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa Dauda túrban sǝ bangcau nǝ Abigiyel, ace twale ɓǝ̀ duk māmí.<verse eid="1SA 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Lang amǝ'túró mala Dauda yiu aban Abigiyel a Kamel ka, à banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Dauda túr sǝm a bano, ama ɓǝ̀ sǝm kyan nǝ we a baní, wu pǝlǝ māmí.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Pǝlǝa Abigiyel lo, sǝ ɓun nǝ ɓamǝsǝi a nzali, sǝ na ama, &lt;&lt;Mim guro mò ka, mǝ nda mǝtúró ace lakki akusǝ amǝtúró mala ɓwamǝgule mem.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Osso Abigiyel lo akaurǝa, wario sǝ kya eau a nzǝm mǝdambǝriso, sǝ tongno atà amuna-mamǝna amǝ'túró-ɓala male o atè. Abigiyel o atà amǝ'na-túrbân mala Dauda, sǝ pǝlǝ mālá Dauda.<verse eid="1SA 25:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Dauda ka angŋa-dǝmba alna Ahinowam, ɓwama Jezǝril; yià mǝno kǝm ngga, à pǝlǝ amālá Dauda.<verse eid="1SA 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />(Adyan ngga, Sawul twalna muna-ɓwama male, yì Mikal mǝnana mālá Dauda na ka, pànî Paltiyel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:44 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Paltiyel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko Palti.</char></note> muna-ɓwabura mala Layish, ɓwa Gallim.)<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s">Dauda ɓinǝ twal yilǝmi Sawul ɗǝm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">26:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1SA 23:19">1Sam 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 54">Ang 54</ref></char>.</note>Amǝ'Zif wari aban Sawul a Gibiya, sǝ à banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Dauda pà aban sǝmbǝrǝa amur muna-nkono Hakila, tù a ban Jeshimon re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Nda Sawul lo sǝ sulǝo wari a ɓabondo Zif nǝ aburana á-tàrú mala Isǝrayila atè, ace alta Dauda a ɓabondo Zif. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Sawul tsǝk kàttì male amúr muna-nkono Hakila, mǝnana nda a nkanggari njargula a takuli mala Jeshimon ngga. Sǝ Dauda ka ue a ɓabondo. Lang sǝni ama Sawul yina atè a ɓabondo ace alte ka, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />Dauda tasǝ amǝ'shenzǝban, sǝ à wario à kya bwalte ama mbak-kàngkàng Sawul yina.<verse eid="1SA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Pǝlǝa Dauda lo sǝ wari a ban mǝnana Sawul bwal kàttì kam ngga; sǝ Dauda sǝn ban mǝnana Sawul andǝ Abǝna muna-ɓwabura mala Ner, yì mǝ'sàrǝ̀ban mala amǝ'lwa male nong kàm ngga. Sawul ka nong a tsùrú mala kàttì sǝ amǝ'lwa male gumbǝli. <verse eid="1SA 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Dauda nacau nǝ Ahimelek ɓwa'Hitti andǝ Abishai, muna-ɓwabura mala Zeruya, mǝ'eam Jowap ama, &lt;&lt;Ya ɓwa na atà wun nǝ̀ ká atàm aban Sawul aɓa kàttì male?&gt;&gt; Abishai eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ ká atò.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Nda Dauda andǝ Abishai wario sǝ à kya kútí a kàttì mala Sawul nǝ du, sǝ à sǝni ka, Sawul na a ntulo a tsùrú mala kàttì nǝ nzo male à kwaki a nzali, tù a ban ɓamuri. Sǝ Abǝna andǝ amǝ'lwa ka, à nongŋo à gumbǝlì aɓalǝu. <verse eid="1SA 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Abishai banggi Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Yalung ngga, Yahweh túrna ɓiomǝbura a ɓabuo. Adyan ngga, ɗekiam mǝ zuɓi nǝ nzo ɓǝ̀ kya kútí a nzali, nǝ zuɓiban mwashat ɓǝ̀rɓǝ̀r, sǝ pà mǝ nǝ zuɓi ɓaria ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Sǝama Dauda ne Abishai ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝa wal-lui ɗàng! Yana nǝ̀ loasǝ bui arǝ ɓwa mǝnana Yahweh tàrni ka, sǝ ɓwe nǝ̀ ɗwanyi kumcau?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Sǝ Dauda lidǝmba nǝ nacau ama, &lt;&lt;Mbak-kàngkàng Yahweh na kam nǝyilǝmu ka, Yahweh nǝnggearǝì nǝ̀ wali, ko ana raka lang pwari male karǝna ka nǝ̀ wǔ, ko nǝ̀ ká munǝo sǝ à nǝ̀ wal-luí kàm. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Sǝ mim ngga, ɓǝ̀ Yahweh twalbani mǝnana mǝ loasǝ buam arǝ ɓwa mana Yahweh tàrni ka! Ado ka, twal nzo male andǝ du-mùr male, sǝ ɓǝ̀ sǝm o!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Nda Dauda twal nzo andǝ du-mùr mǝnana à cam a múr Sawul ka, sǝ à nying ban mǝno. Kǝɓwa sǝnia ko sǝlǝce ɗàng, sǝ kǝɓwa ateà loapi ntulo ɗàng, acemǝnana <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:21">Tite 2:21</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:12">15:12</ref></char>.</note>nggea ntulo mǝlime nǝban Yahweh yi sulǝ amúrià.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Pǝlǝa Dauda o a ɓè buì sǝ kya cam zak amúr mgbangban; ban mǝnana Dauda cam kam ngga tètarǝì ban mǝnana à Sawul nakam ngga. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Dauda loasǝ gì sǝ tunǝ amǝ'lwa mala Sawul, sǝ tunǝ Abǝna muna-ɓwabura mala Ner ama, &lt;&lt;A pà wunǝ earam re, Abǝna?&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa Abǝna ear ama, &lt;&lt;A nda yana le, mǝnana a kǝ tunǝ murǝm ngga?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Dauda ne Abǝna ama, &lt;&lt;A nda ɓwabura re? Sǝ yana kam kǝla we a Isǝrayila? Palang sǝ a yál ɓwamǝgule mò, murǝm ɗàng? Acemǝnana ɓeɓwa yiu nǝ̀ wal murǝm, ɓwamǝgule mò. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Gìr mǝnia a pè ka, pànǝ ɓoaro ɗàng! Mbak-kàngkàng Yahweh nakam ngga, a karǝna ɓǝà wal-luio, acemǝnana a yál ɓwamǝgule mò mǝnana Yahweh tàrì ka ɗàng! Ado ka sǝnban! Nzo andǝ du-mùr mala murǝm mǝnana à cam a múrí ka, à nda ke?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Lang Sawul bwalta gì Dauda ka, ɗiban ama, &lt;&lt;Gio nda man le, munem Dauda?&gt;&gt; Dauda eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;E, giem na ɓwamǝgule mem, murǝm.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Dauda lidǝmba nǝ nacau ama, &lt;&lt;Palang sǝ ɓwamǝgule mem kǝ pǝrtam, mim guro male? Mana ǝn pà? Ya gìr mǝɓane na ǝn pa? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Adyan ngga, ɓǝ̀ ɓwamǝgule mem, yì murǝm ok acau mem, mim guro male. Ɓǝ̀ Yahweh nda mǝnana soakito arǝàm ngga, ɓǝ̀ Yahweh ak pàgir.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pàgir </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mala pisǝ muku gìr mala pà rǝmban mǝɓoarne ace pwasǝbum Yahweh</char></note> Sǝ ɓǝ̀ aɓwana na ka, ɓǝ̀ suban sulǝ amúria nǝban Yahweh; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 14:16">2Sam 14:16</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 20:19">20:19</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 21:3">21:3</ref></char>.</note>acemǝnana à pǝrnam yalung, ama mǝ nggá kum nzali liɓala mala Yahweh ɗàng, sǝ à bangŋǝ́nà ama, &lt;O, kya peri aban aɓea aɓakuli.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Adyan ngga, kǝa eare ɓǝà sukki nkilem a nzali mǝnana nda kuko nǝ ɓadǝm Yahweh ka ɗàng, acemǝnana murǝm mala Isǝrayila purna ace alta nkungga kǝla mana ɓwa kǝ alta nyal amúr ankono ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Pǝlǝa Sawul na ama, &lt;&lt;Ən pángŋǝ̀nà cauɓikea. Nyare, munem Dauda. Pà mǝ nǝ pakko kǝgìr mǝɓane ɗàng, acemǝnana a twal yilǝmem nǝ gulo a pwari man yalung ngga. Ən pángŋǝ̀nà ɓwaɓana, sǝ ǝn ɓwarkina kǝ̀rkǝ́r!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Sǝ Dauda ear ama, &lt;&lt;Nzo mala murǝm nia ka! Tasǝ mwashat atà alaggana ɓǝ̀ eauwe ɓǝ̀ yi e. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />Ɓakuli kǝ mbwe koyanale ka tangnakusǝi, ace ɓealɓoarna andǝ domǝsǝcau male; Yahweh ka, túrǒ a ɓabuam yalung, sǝ ǝn ɓinǝ loasǝ buam arǝ ɓwa mǝnana Yahweh ɗārǝi ka. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Kǝla mǝnana ǝn pè yilǝmo gulo yalung ngga, ɓǝ̀ yilǝmem kum gulo a mǝsǝ Yahweh, sǝ ɓǝ̀ amsǝam ɓǝn purî ɓá koya ulang tanni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Pǝlǝa Sawul banggi Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ Yahweh tsǝko bù, munem Dauda! Awu nǝ̀ pàkki agir mǝgulke, sǝ awu nǝ kum lidǝmba aɓa komǝyenani le ka!&gt;&gt; Nda Dauda bwal njar male o, sǝ Sawul nyar a ɓala male ka.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s">Dauda ɓangŋa wari aban amǝ'Filisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Pǝlǝa Dauda pakɗenyicau a ɓabumi ama, &lt;&lt;Akǝ fara ka, Sawul na nǝ̀ kiɗikiam ngga. Acemani ka, gìr mǝnana ɓoaribani ka, nda mǝnana ama mǝ nǝ ɓangŋa mǝ nǝ o a nzali mala amǝ'Filisti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa; </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 26:19">1Sam 26:19</ref></char>.</note> Anggo ka, Sawul nǝ̀ aulǝa arǝ altam aɓa bù-nzali mala Isǝrayila, sǝ mǝ nǝ api ɓabuì.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Nda Dauda lo sǝ wari andǝ aburana gbǝman-tongno-nong-mwashat (600) mǝnana à nda atè ka, aban Akish muna-ɓwabura mala Mawok,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa; </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 2:10">1Sam 2:10</ref> </char>.</note> murǝm Gat. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Pǝlǝa Dauda kya do a Gat, yì andǝ aburana male, koyan ngga andǝ amǝɓala male atè, sǝ Dauda gbal ka andǝ amāmí ɓari, Ahinowam ɓwama Jezǝril, andǝ Abigiyel ɓwama Kamel,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa; </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 25:42-44">1Sam 25:42-44</ref></char> .</note> yì mā-lú mala Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Sǝ lang à banggi Sawul ama Dauda ɓangŋǝna umǝna a Gat ka, Sawul nyare alte ɗǝm ɗàng.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Pǝlǝa Dauda ne Akish ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, ɓǝ̀ ǝn kumǝna earmúrú a bano ka, ɓǝà pàm bân aɓa mwashat atà alá mǝnana a liro ka, ace mǝnana mǝ duk kam ngga. Ace mana sǝ mim guro mò ka mǝ nǝ do atò a là-murǝm?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Nda Akish pe wi Zikǝlag<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zikǝlag </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa; </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 15:31">Jes 15:31</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 19:5">19:5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 11:28">Nehe 11:28</ref></char>.</note> akǝ̀ pwari mǝno ka. Acemani ka, Zikǝlag na a bu amurǝma mala Yahuda bà yalung. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Anonggio mǝnana Dauda pa aɓa do male a nzali mala amǝ'Filisti ka, pǝlǝa mwashat nǝ azongŋo ine na.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Arǝ anonggio mǝno ka, Dauda andǝ aburana male wario sǝ à tǝlli amǝ'Geshur, andǝ amǝ'Girǝz, andǝ amǝ'Amalek. (Twal arǝ anza ɓara-ɓara aɓwapǝndǝa mǝnia ka à sauna nǝdo aɓa nzali mǝnia, tite a Shur aban ká ɗār a nzali Masar.) <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />A koya pwari Dauda wari nǝ munǝo arǝ ɓè bu-nzali ka, pà nǝ̀ ɗeki kǝ ɓwabura ko ɓwama nǝyilǝmu ɗàng, sǝ nǝ̀ gbǝwi anzur, andǝ andá, andǝ amǝdambǝriso, andǝ akalakadambi, sǝ agir-nggūrǝu. Pǝlǝa nǝ̀ nyar aban Akish. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Sǝ lang Akish nǝ̀ ɗiban ama, &lt;&lt;A ya ban sǝ wu wari ace tǝlliban yalung ngga?&gt;&gt; Dauda nǝ̀ ear ama, &lt;&lt;A ban njar-kunmur mala Yahuda,&gt;&gt; ko &lt;&lt;A njar-kunmur mala Jerameel,&gt;&gt; ko &lt;&lt;A njar-kunmur mala amǝ'Ken.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Dauda ɗeki kǝ ɓwabura ko ɓwama nǝyilǝmu mǝnana nǝ̀ yinǝi a Gat ka ɗàng, nǝ ɗenyicau ama, &lt;&lt;Cè à yi oasǝkimur sǝm, ama, &lt;Ani sǝ Dauda pǎ.&gt; &gt;&gt; Mǝnia ka nda gìr mǝnana Dauda pakkiyi pwari-pwari, lang ndaban do aɓa bù-nzali mala amǝ'Filisti ka. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Anggo sǝ Akish earnǝ Dauda, sǝ kǝ twali ama, &lt;&lt;Tsǝngŋǝ̀nà aɓwana male amǝ'Isǝrayila à ɓinǝnamǝsǝi; acemani ka, nǝ̀ duk mǝtúró mem tàtǝ́k.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="s">Sawul andǝ mǝɗikalú mala En-dor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Arǝ anonggio mǝno ka, amǝ'Filisti ram amǝ'lwa malea ace lwa-lwa arǝ Isǝrayila. Pǝlǝa Akish ne Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝlǝa ama we wunǝ aburana mô ka wun nǝ̀ o atàm atà amǝ'lwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Dauda pǝlǝa eari Akish ama, &lt;&lt;E, akàm sǝ awu nǝ sǝni nǝnggearǝò gìr mǝnana guro mò nǝ̀ gandǝ pè ka.&gt;&gt;Pǝlǝa Akish banggi Dauda ama, &lt;&lt;Acemani ka, mǝ nǝ tsǝo awu nǝ duk mǝ'yáltàm bà.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Adyan ngga, Samuyila angŋa-dǝmba pàngŋǝ̀nà-lú, sǝ amǝ Isǝrayila kat angŋa-dǝmba à ɓuanì sǝ à tsǝ̀ngŋǝ̀nì a Rama, yì là male.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 25:1">1Sam 25:1</ref></char>.</note> Sǝ Sawul angŋa-dǝmba pǝrna amǝ'ɗikalú andǝ amǝ'nggár, à purni ɓá nzalî.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:31">Pǝris 19:31</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:27">20:27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:10-11">Nggur 18:10-11</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Amǝ'Filisti ramba sǝ à yi bwal kàttì a Shunem. Sǝ Sawul ram Isǝrayila kat, sǝ à bwal kàttì a Gilbowa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Lang Sawul sǝn amǝ'lwa mala amǝ'Filisti ka, ɓangciu pàkki wi, sǝ gǝggǝli kǝ̀rkǝ́r. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Sǝ lang Sawul alta nê mala Yahweh ka, Yahweh pè wi kǝ eare ɗang, ko aɓa lòrǝo, ko nǝban Urim, ko nǝban amǝ'ɓangnǝa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 28:30">Pur 28:30</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 27:21">Ɓal 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 3:5">1Amur 3:5</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Pǝlǝa Sawul banggi amǝtúró male ama, &lt;&lt;Wu alamta ɓwama mǝnana mǝɗikalú na ka, ace mǝnana mǝ kya ɗibancau a baní ka.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa amǝtúró male eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, ɓè mǝɗikalú nakam a En-dor.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Anggo sǝ Sawul ɓosǝki rǝì, oasǝ aɓea agir-nggūrǝu ɗàng, sǝ wario, yì andǝ aburana ɓari atè. À yi bik ban ɓwame nǝ du. Sǝ Sawul bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ida, ɗikamban atà alú, sǝ wu tunǝâm ɓwa mǝnana mǝ nǝ banggo lullǝi ka, ɓǝ̀ lǝmdǝ rǝì.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Sǝ ɓwame banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓafo a sǝlǝnace gìr mǝnana Sawul pàk ka, mǝnana pǝr amǝ'ɗikalú andǝ amǝ'nggár à purî là man ngga. Ace mana sǝ a kǝ tsǝkam gbǝli mǝnana nǝ̀ kánǝ yilǝmem a lú ka?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Sǝama Sawul kánbi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mbak-kàngkàng Yahweh nakam ngga, kǝ ɓè patanni pà nǝ̀ yiu amuro ace gìr mǝnia ka ɗàng!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Pǝlǝa ɓwame ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Yana mǝnana mǝ nǝ tunǝô wi ka?&gt;&gt; Sǝ ne ɓwame ama, &lt;&lt;Tunǝâm Samuyila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Lang ɓwame sǝn Samuyila ka, sà'ɓua bang-bang. Sǝ ɓwame ne Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Ace mana sǝ a swarkiam? A nda Sawul!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Murǝm pǝlǝa banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓangciu ɓǝ̀kǝa pakko ɗàng. Mana ɗe a sǝna?&gt;&gt; Ɓwame ne Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Ən sǝn ɓè lú aban puro nǝ ɓá nzali.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Sawul ɗi ama, &lt;&lt;Lang sǝ puro male pa?&gt;&gt; Eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Jamgula na puro kǝ yiu ka! Mbuɓiki rǝì aɓa nggea-daura.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 15:27">1Sam 15:27</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;Pǝlǝa Sawul sǝlǝ ama Samuyila na, pǝlǝa ɓunno sǝ ti múrí a nzali.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Pǝlǝa Samuyila banggi Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Mana tsǝa sǝ a tanninǝ mim aban tunǝam ɓǝn yiu?&gt;&gt; Sawul ear ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nda aɓa nggikiban mǝkǝ̀rkǝ́rnì, acemǝnana amǝ'Filisti yinǝ lwa arǝàm, sǝ Ɓakuli ka pǝlǝnàm nzǝmi, sǝ yale kǝ pam eare ɗǝm ɗàng,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 28:6">1Sam 28:6</ref></char></note> ko nǝban amǝ'ɓangnǝa ko aɓa lòrǝo. Acemani ka, ǝn alte nǝma ɓǝà tunǝo wu yiu wu banggam gìr mǝnana mǝ nǝ pàk ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Sǝ Samuyila banggi Sawul ama, &lt;&lt;Ace mana sǝ awu nǝ ɗiem, mǝnana a sǝlǝna ama Yahweh pǝlǝno nzǝmi, sǝ dumǝna ɓiomǝbura ka? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />Yahweh pàngŋǝ́nò kǝla mǝnana nam sǝ ǝn banggo ka; sanǝna domurǝm a ɓabuo sǝ pànî ɓio mǝ'murkala, yi Dauda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 15:28">1Sam 15:28</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Acemǝnana a oki Yahweh ɗàng, sǝ a lumsǝ nggea bumlulla male mǝ'earke amur amǝ'Amalek raka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 15:1-9">1Sam 15:1-9</ref></char>.</note> nda Yahweh pàkkô gìr mǝnia yalung ngga. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Amur mani ka, Yahweh nǝ̀ tasǝ Isǝrayila sǝ we gbal a ɓabù amǝ'Filisti! Lí ka, we wunǝ amuna-burana mô, wun nǝ̀ pà atàm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 31:2">1Sam 31:2</ref></char>.</note> Ɗǝm ngga Yahweh nǝ̀ tasǝ amǝ'lwa mala Isǝrayila a ɓabù amǝ'Filisti!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Kara Sawul kpa a nzali sárǝ́ pǝrapǝra, ɓangciu pakki wi kǝ̀rkǝ́r ace acau mala Samuyila. Rǝcandǝa malì rǝì kat acemǝnana lì kǝgir ɗàng, dù kat andǝ pwari kat. <verse eid="1SA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Pǝlǝa ɓwame yiu aban Sawul, sǝ lang sǝn ɓiki gǝggǝlya mǝnana gǝggǝli ka, ɓwame banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, mim guro mò ka ǝn kpanata cau mò. Ən twal yilǝmem a kún buam sǝ ǝn pak gìr mǝnana a banggam ngga. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Ado ka, we gbal ka, kwakikiro arǝàm, mim guro mò. Earam mǝ yinǝo nǝ girlina bǝti, ace mǝnana wu li, sǝ wu kum rǝcandǝa mala bwal njar ma'wun aban o ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Sawul ɓinǝe, sǝ bang ama, &lt;&lt;Pà mǝ nǝ lìli ɗang.&gt;&gt; Sǝama aguro male andǝ ɓwame ɓuakiarǝi, pǝlǝa kpata cau malea. Nda loapi nzali sǝ dumnǝdo amur gyangŋan-nongŋo ka. <verse eid="1SA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Ɓwama man ngga ndanǝ muna ndá-lǝsǝa a ɓala, pǝlǝa bwali sǝ pwanmyali akaurǝa. Sǝ ɗàrǝ́ muku, karki dyar bǝredi, sǝ lurǝi burè pà arǝì ɗàng, <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />sǝ tsǝki Sawul andǝ aguro male aɓadǝmbia, sǝ à li. Nda à lo sǝ à o, a kǝ dù mǝno ka.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s">Amǝ'Filisti ɓinǝ Dauda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Adyan ngga, amǝ'Filisti angŋa-dǝmba à ramna amǝ'lwa malea kat abanɓwáná a Afek,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Afek </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 4:1">1Sam 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 12:18">Jes 12:18</ref></char>.</note> sǝ amǝ'Isǝrayila ka à tsǝk kàttì malea a nkanggari mgbeaɗe-mùr mǝnana nda a Jezǝril ka. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Lang <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 13:3">Jes 13:3</ref></char>.</note>amǝ'yálmúrû mala amǝ'Filisti gya aban kutio andǝ aburana malea mǝnana à gau rǝia arǝ agbǝman sǝ arǝ aá ka, Dauda andǝ aburana male gbal ka à gya aban kutio anzǝm murǝm Akish.<verse eid="1SA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Amǝ'sàrǝ̀ban mala amǝ'Filisti ɗìban ama, &lt;&lt;Mana amǝ'Ibǝru man pakkiyi kani?&gt;&gt; Akish earia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia ka nda Dauda, mǝtúró mala murǝm Sawul mala Isǝrayila. Nda kani nǝdo atàm kútínì pǝlǝa mwashat. Sǝ twal a pwari mana nying Sawul ba ado ka, ǝn kumi nǝ ɓekǝ ɓwarkio ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Sǝama bum amǝ'sàrǝ̀ban mala amǝ'Filisti lul arǝ murǝm Akish, sǝ à banggi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Nyesǝ ɓwabura mǝna ka ɓǝ̀ o a ban mǝnana a pe wi ɓǝ̀ duk kàm ngga. Yì ka pà nǝ̀ ká atà sǝm a kún munǝo ɗàng, ace mǝnana ɓǝkǝa pǝlǝ ɓi'sǝm mǝbura a kún munǝo raka. Ya njar na ɗe ndakam nǝ̀ kumo, mǝnana ɓoaro-kutibanì, mala gilǝki-nre andǝ mǝtala-ɓala male ka, mǝnana ɓǝ̀ pà nǝ́ twal aɓamur aburana ma'sǝm raka? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Mǝnia ka nda Dauda mbo, mǝnana aɓwana tu'nggyal nǝ nggwam amurí ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 29:5">&lt;&lt; &lt;Sawul walna aá male,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 29:5">sǝ Dauda walna aá lum male ka?&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 18:7">1Sam 18:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 21:11">21:11</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Pǝlǝa Akish tunǝ Dauda sǝ ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mbak-kàngkàng Yahweh nakam ngga, a nda mǝ'ɓealɓoarna, sǝ puro mô andǝ kutio mô atàm aɓalǝ amǝ'lwa ka ndanǝ ɓoaro a mǝsǝàm. Ən kumô nǝ ɓekǝ mǝɓike ɗàng, twal a pwari mǝnana a yiu nǝi abanam ngga, bà yalung. Kat andǝ amani ka, amǝ'yálmúrû earnǝ we ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Acemani ka, nyar ado, o aɓa rǝpwala, ace mǝnana wu kǝa zurǝi ɓabum amǝ'yálmúrû mala amǝ'Filisti raka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Dauda banggi Akish ama, &lt;&lt;Mana ǝn pa? Mana a kumi arǝàm, mim guro mò, twal a pwari mǝnana ǝn yiu nǝi aɓa túró mô bà yalung, mǝnana nǝ̀ tsǝa sǝ pà mǝ nǝ ká munǝo arǝ aɓiu-mǝbura mala ɓwamǝgule mem murǝm raka?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Akish pa'eare ama, &lt;&lt;Ən sǝlǝna ama a nda ɓwa mǝ'mǝsǝcauì a mǝsǝàm kǝla mǝturonjar mala Ɓakuli! Sǝama amǝ'yálmúrû mala amǝ'Filisti bangŋǝna ama, &lt;Dauda pà nǝ̀ ká atà sǝm a munǝo ɗàng.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Adyan ngga, lo nǝ dǝmbari ɗiɗyal wunǝ amǝtúró mala mǝtala-ɓala mò mǝnana à yiu atò ka, sǝ lang banfana ka, wu bwal njar wu o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Nda Dauda andǝ aburana male lo nǝ dǝmbari ɗiɗyal, sǝ à bwal njar aban o a nzali mala amǝ'Filisti ka, sǝ amǝ'Filisti ka, à eau aban ká Jezǝril.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s">Dauda gandǝ amǝ'Amalek nǝ munǝo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Lang Dauda andǝ aburana male yina a <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 27:6">1Sam 27:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 29:4">29:4</ref>,<ref loc="1SA 29:11">11</ref></char>.</note>Zikǝlag a tàruia pwari ka, à yi sǝni ka amǝ'Amalek yina nǝ tǝlliban amur Negev andǝ Zikǝlag. À lina Zikǝlag nǝ munǝo, à pisǝni nǝ bǝsa, <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />sǝ à bwalkina amamǝna andǝ koyan mǝnana aɓalǝi ka bwalban-guro, amuna-mǝkeke andǝ aɓwana-mǝgule. À wal-lú kǝɓwa ateà ɗàng, sǝama à pwanǝnia, à umá nǝia.<verse eid="1SA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Lang Dauda andǝ aburana male yiu a nggea-lê ka, à yi kumi ka à pisǝni. Amālia andǝ amuna-burana malea, andǝ amuna-mamǝna malea ka, à pwanǝnia à umǝna nǝia. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Pǝlǝa Dauda andǝ aburana mana atè ka, à ɓua kǝ̀rkǝ́r she lang rǝcandǝa malea malǝna ka. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Amālá Dauda kǝm ngga à umǝna nǝia, yià Ahinowam, ɓwama Jezǝril andǝ Abigiyel, ɓwama Kamel, mā-lú mala Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Ɓabum Dauda zurǝì kǝ̀rkǝ́r, acemǝnana aburane kǝ earce ama à nǝ̀ ɓukki nǝ atali; koya ɓwabura ka, bumikiɗiki kǝ̀rkǝ́r ace amuna-burana male andǝ amuna-mamǝna male. Sǝama Dauda ɓakɓabumi nǝban Yahweh Ɓakuli male.<verse eid="1SA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Pǝlǝa Dauda banggi pǝris Abiyata, muna-ɓwabura mala Ahimelek ama, &lt;&lt;Yinǝam nǝ efot.&gt;&gt; Nda Abiyata yinǝ efot aban Dauda ka. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Dauda ɗì Yahweh ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ pǝrta amǝnia yì amǝ'tǝllìban ngga le? Mǝ nǝ kasǝmurià le?&gt;&gt; Yahweh eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Pǝrtea, acemǝnana mbak-kàngkàng awu nǝ̀ kasǝmurià, sǝ mbak-kàngkàng awu nǝ̀ amsǝ aɓwana, sǝ awu nǝ ak agir mana à pwania kat ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Nda Dauda lo aban ká andǝ aburana gbǝman-tongno-nong-mwashat (600) mǝnana atè ka. Lang à yi bingŋǝna myalmúr Beso ka, aɓea aɓwana atea mǝnana à nda anzǝ́mò ka à ue abanì. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Dauda andǝ aburana gbǝman-ine (400) lidǝmba nǝ pyangnǝatau; acili aburana gbǝman-ɓari (200) ka, à ɓiki aulǝa à gandǝnǝ yálì myalmúr Beso ɗàng, nda à ueo abanì ka.<verse eid="1SA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Pǝlǝa à kya kum ɓè ɓwa'Masar a patal, sǝ à yinǝi aban Dauda. À pè wi bǝredi shè, sǝ à pè wi mùr nu. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />Ɗǝm ngga à pè wi agbatali kyak ɓari mala ɓǝla vwari andǝ adangŋanshi ɓǝla-anap mǝ'ime ɓari. Lang linia ka, yilǝmi nyar arǝì; ɓwabure ka pàngŋǝ̀nà anonggio tàrú, du andǝ pwari li kǝgìr ɗàng. <verse eid="1SA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Dauda ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Yana nda mǝtala-ɓala mò? Sǝ a pur nǝ kǝshe?&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa ear ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nda lagga ɓwa'Masar, muna-ɓala mala ɓwa'Amalek. Mǝtala-ɓala mem o ɗekiam, acemǝnana ǝn nong rǝkwana anongŋo tàrú mǝnia à kùtí ka. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Sǝm wari a tǝlliban a njar-kunmur mala bù-nzali mala <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 8:18">2Sam 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:18">15:18</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 20:7">20:7</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 23">23</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 1:38">1Amur 1:38</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 18:17">1Acau 18:17</ref></char>.</note>amǝ'Keret, aɓa nzong-nzali mala Yahuda, andǝ njar-kunmur mala nzong-nzali Kalip; sǝ sǝm pisǝ Zikǝlag nǝ bǝsa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Dauda ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Awu nǝ gandǝ kánǝ mim aban nggǝsan mala amǝ'tǝllìban man le?&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa ear ama, &lt;&lt;Kánbam nǝ Ɓakuli ama a pà wunǝ wal-luem, ko awu nǝ túrǎm a ɓabù mǝtala-ɓala mem ɗàng, sǝ mǝ nǝ umnǝ we aban nggǝsan mala amǝ'tǝllìban man.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Nda warinǝ Dauda a banì ka, sǝ à kya kumia à mesǝna a koya ban a nzali. À ndaban li andǝ nu, andǝ pe ɓamúrià banɓoarnado ace nggea gǝna-lwa mǝnana à pwani aɓa nzali mala amǝ'Filisti, sǝ aɓa bù-nzali Yahuda ka. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Pǝlǝa Dauda soa arǝia nǝ munǝo, twal a ban-mbul'mbul aban ká pwarikpǝra mala ɓè pwari. Kǝɓwa ateà au ɗàng, shekǝ alaggana gbǝman-ine (400) mǝnana à ɓangŋa a nzǝm akalakadambi, à au ka. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Dauda ak agir mǝnana kat amǝ'Amalek pwania ka, andǝ amāmí ɓari. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Kǝgìr ɓwàr ɗàng, ko mǝkyauwe ko mǝgule. Ak amuna-burana, andǝ amuna-mamǝna, andǝ gǝna-lwa, andǝ koya gir mǝnana kat amǝ'tǝllìban mǝno pwania ka; Dauda nyesǝ agir kat. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Ɗǝm ngga Dauda pwan adomwan mala anzur andǝ ambul, andǝ mala andá, sǝ pǝria aban yiu a ɓadǝm acili agirkusǝu, sǝ bang ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia ka gǝna-lwa mala Dauda na!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Pǝlǝa Dauda nyar a ban aburana gbǝman-ɓari mǝnana aulǝa tsǝia à gandǝnǝ o atè raka, yì aɓwana mana à nyia a myalmúr Beso ka. À pur ace ká kúllí Dauda andǝ aɓwana mana atè ka. Lang Dauda bingŋǝna tù abania ka, pǝlǝa makkia-wia-kún. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Sǝama amǝ'ɓealɓikea andǝ amǝ'ɓealɓana aɓalǝ aburana mǝnana à o atà Dauda ka, à bang ama, &lt;&lt;Acemǝnana à o atà sǝm raka, pà sǝm nǝ̀ pè kǝɓwa ateà kǝgìr aɓa gǝna-lwa mǝnana sǝm nyesǝia ka ɗàng! Kǝ amālia andǝ amunia nda sǝm nǝ̀ pea wia ka, sǝ koyan ngga ɓǝ̀ bwal amale ɓǝà o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Sǝama Dauda na ama, &lt;&lt;Wun amǝ'eambǝam, wu kǝa pak anggo nǝ gìr mǝnana Yahweh pa sǝm ngga ɗàng! Yahweh yál sǝm sǝ tasǝ amǝ'tǝllìban mǝnana à yiu arǝ sǝm ngga, a ɓabù sǝm. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Yana nǝ̀ kwakikiri arǝ wun amúr cau man? Kāmbe mala ɓwa mǝnana wari a munǝo ka, nǝ̀ duk mwashat andǝ mala ɓwa mǝnana ue a ban atwalo ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Twal a pwari mǝno bà yalung ngga, mǝnia ka duk nzongcau andǝ nggurcau aban amǝ'Isǝrayila. <verse eid="1SA 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Lang Dauda bingŋǝna Zikǝlag ka, tasǝ aɓa gǝna-lwa mǝnana pwan ngga, aban aɓwana-mǝgule mala Yahuda, mǝnana à nda ka agyajam male ka, nǝ cau ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓoro nia ka ace wun, aɓa gǝna-lwa mǝnana sǝm pwan arǝ aɓibura mala Yahweh ka!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Aɓoronì ka, à nda ace aɓwana mǝno arǝ alá mǝnia ka: ace amǝno yì aɓwana a Betel, andǝ Ramot Negev, andǝ Jattir ka; <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />ace aɓwana mǝno a Aruwa, andǝ Sifmot, andǝ Eshtemowa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />andǝ Rakal ka; ace aɓwana mǝno arǝ anggea-là mala amǝ'Jerameel andǝ amǝ'Ken ngga; <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />ace aɓwana mǝno a Horma, andǝ Bor Ashan, andǝ Atak, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />andǝ Hebǝron ngga; sǝ ace aɓwana mǝno arǝ acili abân mǝnana kat Dauda andǝ aburana male ging kam ngga.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s">Lú mala Sawul andǝ amuna-burana male</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 10:1-12">1 Acau la Apwari 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Adyan ngga amǝ'Filisti naban munǝo arǝ amǝ'Isǝrayila; sǝ amǝ'lwa mala Isǝrayila ɓangŋa aɓadǝm amǝ'Filisti; à wal-lú amǝ'Isǝrayila amúr Nkono Gilbowa. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Amǝ'Filisti pǝrta Sawul andǝ amuna-burana male, à kya kasǝmurià, sǝ à wal-lú amuna-burana male, yià Jonatan, andǝ Abinadap, andǝ Malkishuwa. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Munǝo yi candǝ arǝ Sawul; amǝ'sǝlǝ túr mundi ta Sawul nǝ mundi, à tsǝki wi penye kǝ̀rkǝ́r.<verse eid="1SA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Sawul ne mǝ-bwali-wi agirmunǝo male ama, &lt;&lt;Pusǝ nggeabyau mô sǝ wu zuɓiam nǝi, ɓǝ̀ ana raka, amǝ ɗwanyi kasǝ-ɓatau man nǝ̀ yia zuɓiam sǝ à nǝ̀ ɓangginǝ mim.&gt;&gt; Sǝama mǝ-bwali-wi agirmunǝo male ɓinǝe, acemǝnana ɓangciu pàkki wi kǝ̀rkǝ́r. Nda Sawul twal nggeabyau male sǝ kpa amurí ka. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Lang mǝ-bwali-wi agirmunǝo male sǝni Sawul wuna ka, kara yì gbal ka kpa amúr nggeabyau male sǝ wù atà Sawul. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Anggo sǝ Sawul andǝ amuna-burana male tàrú, andǝ mǝ-bwali-wi agirmunǝo male andǝ aburana male mǝnana atè kat ka, à wù akǝ pwari mǝ'mwashati.<verse eid="1SA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Lang amǝ'Isǝrayila mǝnana à nda a buì njar-nza mala Ɓangŋaban Jezǝril andǝ amana a takuli mala Nggeasala Jodan sǝni ama, aburana mala amǝ'Isǝrayila ɓangŋǝna, sǝ Sawul andǝ amuna-burana male wukina ka, à ɓangŋa à nying alà malea; sǝ amǝ'Filisti yiu à yi do aɓalǝia.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Lang ban fana ka, amǝ'Filisti yiu ace pwan agirbura mala aɓwana mana à wuna ka, kara à yi kum lú Sawul andǝ alú amuna-burana male tàrú amúr Nkono Gilbowa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />À kasǝ ɓamur Sawul, sǝ à swár agirmunǝo male. À tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân aɓa nzali mala amǝ'Filisti kat ɓǝà hamnǝ bǝsacê a ndàmǝgule mala ankúl malea, sǝ aban aɓwana malea. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />À tsǝk agirmunǝo mala Sawul a ndàmǝgule mala <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sǝni aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 16:23-24">Akas 16:23-24</ref></char>.</note>Ashterot, sǝ à gyar luí arǝ sheran mala Bet Shan.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Lang aɓwana mǝnana nǝdo a Jabesh-Gilǝyat ok gìr mǝnana amǝ'Filisti pàkki Sawul ka, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />kara akanggǝrang amǝ'lwa malea kat lo, sǝ à gya aɓa dù mǝno kat. À kya twal lú Sawul andǝ alú amuna-burana male mǝnana arǝ sheran mala Bet Shan ngga, sǝ à yiu a Jabesh, à kya pisǝia kàm. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />À pwan amuia, sǝ à lumsǝia a tǝrta nggun zāmbo a Jabesh; sǝ à gilmùr anonggio tongno-nong-ɓari.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>